          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp5i8",
          "text": "Began a fresh assault.",
          "char_start": 1851,
          "char_end": 1873,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp6i0",
          "text": "Dismay'd not this",
          "char_start": 1874,
          "char_end": 1891,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp6i1",
          "text": "Our captains, Macbeth and Banquo?",
          "char_start": 1892,
          "char_end": 1925,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp7i0",
          "text": "Yes;",
          "char_start": 1926,
          "char_end": 1930,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp7i1",
          "text": "As sparrows eagles, or the hare the lion.",
          "char_start": 1931,
          "char_end": 1972,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp7i2",
          "text": "If I say sooth, I must report they were",
          "char_start": 1973,
          "char_end": 2012,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp7i3",
          "text": "As cannons overcharged with double cracks, so they",
          "char_start": 2013,
          "char_end": 2063,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp7i4",
          "text": "Doubly redoubled strokes upon the foe:",
          "char_start": 2064,
          "char_end": 2102,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp7i5",
          "text": "Except they meant to bathe in reeking wounds,",
          "char_start": 2103,
          "char_end": 2148,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp7i6",
          "text": "Or memorise another Golgotha,",
          "char_start": 2149,
          "char_end": 2178,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp7i7",
          "text": "I cannot tell.",
          "char_start": 2179,
          "char_end": 2193,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp7i8",
          "text": "But I am faint, my gashes cry for help.",
          "char_start": 2194,
          "char_end": 2233,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Sergeant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp8i0",
          "text": "So well thy words become thee as thy wounds;",
          "char_start": 2234,
          "char_end": 2278,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp8i1",
          "text": "They smack of honour both. Go get him surgeons.",
          "char_start": 2279,
          "char_end": 2326,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp8i2",
          "text": "Exit Sergeant, attended",
          "char_start": 2327,
          "char_end": 2350,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp8i3",
          "text": "Who comes here?",
          "char_start": 2351,
          "char_end": 2366,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp8i4",
          "text": "Enter ROSS",
          "char_start": 2367,
          "char_end": 2377,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp9i0",
          "text": "The worthy thane of Ross.",
          "char_start": 2378,
          "char_end": 2403,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp10i0",
          "text": "What a haste looks through his eyes! So should he look",
          "char_start": 2404,
          "char_end": 2458,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp10i1",
          "text": "That seems to speak things strange.",
          "char_start": 2459,
          "char_end": 2494,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp11i0",
          "text": "God save the king!",
          "char_start": 2495,
          "char_end": 2513,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp12i0",
          "text": "Whence camest thou, worthy thane?",
          "char_start": 2514,
          "char_end": 2547,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i0",
          "text": "From Fife, great king;",
          "char_start": 2548,
          "char_end": 2570,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i1",
          "text": "Where the Norweyan banners flout the sky",
          "char_start": 2571,
          "char_end": 2611,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i2",
          "text": "And fan our people cold. Norway himself,",
          "char_start": 2612,
          "char_end": 2652,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i3",
          "text": "With terrible numbers,",
          "char_start": 2653,
          "char_end": 2675,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i4",
          "text": "Assisted by that most disloyal traitor",
          "char_start": 2676,
          "char_end": 2714,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i5",
          "text": "The thane of Cawdor, began a dismal conflict;",
          "char_start": 2715,
          "char_end": 2760,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i6",
          "text": "Till that Bellona's bridegroom, lapp'd in proof,",
          "char_start": 2761,
          "char_end": 2809,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i7",
          "text": "Confronted him with self-comparisons,",
          "char_start": 2810,
          "char_end": 2847,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i8",
          "text": "Point against point rebellious, arm 'gainst arm.",
          "char_start": 2848,
          "char_end": 2896,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i9",
          "text": "Curbing his lavish spirit: and, to conclude,",
          "char_start": 2897,
          "char_end": 2941,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp13i10",
          "text": "The victory fell on us.",
          "char_start": 2942,
          "char_end": 2965,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp14i0",
          "text": "Great happiness!",
          "char_start": 2966,
          "char_end": 2982,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp15i0",
          "text": "That now",
          "char_start": 2983,
          "char_end": 2991,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp15i1",
          "text": "Sweno, the Norways' king, craves composition:",
          "char_start": 2992,
          "char_end": 3037,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp15i2",
          "text": "Nor would we deign him burial of his men",
          "char_start": 3038,
          "char_end": 3078,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp15i3",
          "text": "Till he disbursed at Saint Colme's inch",
          "char_start": 3079,
          "char_end": 3118,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp15i4",
          "text": "Ten thousand dollars to our general use.",
          "char_start": 3119,
          "char_end": 3159,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp16i0",
          "text": "No more that thane of Cawdor shall deceive",
          "char_start": 3160,
          "char_end": 3202,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp16i1",
          "text": "Our bosom interest: go pronounce his present death,",
          "char_start": 3203,
          "char_end": 3254,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp16i2",
          "text": "And with his former title greet Macbeth.",
          "char_start": 3255,
          "char_end": 3295,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp17i0",
          "text": "I'll see it done.",
          "char_start": 3296,
          "char_end": 3313,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp18i0",
          "text": "What he hath lost noble Macbeth hath won.",
          "char_start": 3314,
          "char_end": 3355,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "1.2.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s2:sp18i1",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 3356,
          "char_end": 3362,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:open",
          "text": "Thunder. Enter the three Witches",
          "char_start": 3363,
          "char_end": 3395,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp1i0",
          "text": "Where hast thou been, sister?",
          "char_start": 3396,
          "char_end": 3425,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp2i0",
          "text": "Killing swine.",
          "char_start": 3426,
          "char_end": 3440,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp3i0",
          "text": "Sister, where thou?",
          "char_start": 3441,
          "char_end": 3460,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp4i0",
          "text": "A sailor's wife had chestnuts in her lap,",
          "char_start": 3461,
          "char_end": 3502,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp4i1",
          "text": "And munch'd, and munch'd, and munch'd:--",
          "char_start": 3503,
          "char_end": 3543,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp4i2",
          "text": "'Give me,' quoth I:",
          "char_start": 3544,
          "char_end": 3563,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp4i3",
          "text": "'Aroint thee, witch!' the rump-fed ronyon cries.",
          "char_start": 3564,
          "char_end": 3612,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp4i4",
          "text": "Her husband's to Aleppo gone, master o' the Tiger:",
          "char_start": 3613,
          "char_end": 3663,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp4i5",
          "text": "But in a sieve I'll thither sail,",
          "char_start": 3664,
          "char_end": 3697,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp4i6",
          "text": "And, like a rat without a tail,",
          "char_start": 3698,
          "char_end": 3729,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp4i7",
          "text": "I'll do, I'll do, and I'll do.",
          "char_start": 3730,
          "char_end": 3760,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp5i0",
          "text": "I'll give thee a wind.",
          "char_start": 3761,
          "char_end": 3783,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp6i0",
          "text": "Thou'rt kind.",
          "char_start": 3784,
          "char_end": 3797,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp7i0",
          "text": "And I another.",
          "char_start": 3798,
          "char_end": 3812,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i0",
          "text": "I myself have all the other,",
          "char_start": 3813,
          "char_end": 3841,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i1",
          "text": "And the very ports they blow,",
          "char_start": 3842,
          "char_end": 3871,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i2",
          "text": "All the quarters that they know",
          "char_start": 3872,
          "char_end": 3903,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i3",
          "text": "I' the shipman's card.",
          "char_start": 3904,
          "char_end": 3926,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i4",
          "text": "I will drain him dry as hay:",
          "char_start": 3927,
          "char_end": 3955,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i5",
          "text": "Sleep shall neither night nor day",
          "char_start": 3956,
          "char_end": 3989,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i6",
          "text": "Hang upon his pent-house lid;",
          "char_start": 3990,
          "char_end": 4019,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i7",
          "text": "He shall live a man forbid:",
          "char_start": 4020,
          "char_end": 4047,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i8",
          "text": "Weary se'nnights nine times nine",
          "char_start": 4048,
          "char_end": 4080,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i9",
          "text": "Shall he dwindle, peak and pine:",
          "char_start": 4081,
          "char_end": 4113,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i10",
          "text": "Though his bark cannot be lost,",
          "char_start": 4114,
          "char_end": 4145,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i11",
          "text": "Yet it shall be tempest-tost.",
          "char_start": 4146,
          "char_end": 4175,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp8i12",
          "text": "Look what I have.",
          "char_start": 4176,
          "char_end": 4193,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp9i0",
          "text": "Show me, show me.",
          "char_start": 4194,
          "char_end": 4211,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp10i0",
          "text": "Here I have a pilot's thumb,",
          "char_start": 4212,
          "char_end": 4240,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp10i1",
          "text": "Wreck'd as homeward he did come.",
          "char_start": 4241,
          "char_end": 4273,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp10i2",
          "text": "Drum within",
          "char_start": 4274,
          "char_end": 4285,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp11i0",
          "text": "A drum, a drum!",
          "char_start": 4286,
          "char_end": 4301,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp11i1",
          "text": "Macbeth doth come.",
          "char_start": 4302,
          "char_end": 4320,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp12i0",
          "text": "The weird sisters, hand in hand,",
          "char_start": 4321,
          "char_end": 4353,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp12i1",
          "text": "Posters of the sea and land,",
          "char_start": 4354,
          "char_end": 4382,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp12i2",
          "text": "Thus do go about, about:",
          "char_start": 4383,
          "char_end": 4407,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp12i3",
          "text": "Thrice to thine and thrice to mine",
          "char_start": 4408,
          "char_end": 4442,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp12i4",
          "text": "And thrice again, to make up nine.",
          "char_start": 4443,
          "char_end": 4477,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp12i5",
          "text": "Peace! the charm's wound up.",
          "char_start": 4478,
          "char_end": 4506,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp12i6",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH and BANQUO",
          "char_start": 4507,
          "char_end": 4531,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp13i0",
          "text": "So foul and fair a day I have not seen.",
          "char_start": 4532,
          "char_end": 4571,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp14i0",
          "text": "How far is't call'd to Forres? What are these",
          "char_start": 4572,
          "char_end": 4617,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp14i1",
          "text": "So wither'd and so wild in their attire,",
          "char_start": 4618,
          "char_end": 4658,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp14i2",
          "text": "That look not like the inhabitants o' the earth,",
          "char_start": 4659,
          "char_end": 4707,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp14i3",
          "text": "And yet are on't? Live you? or are you aught",
          "char_start": 4708,
          "char_end": 4752,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp14i4",
          "text": "That man may question? You seem to understand me,",
          "char_start": 4753,
          "char_end": 4802,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp14i5",
          "text": "By each at once her chappy finger laying",
          "char_start": 4803,
          "char_end": 4843,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp14i6",
          "text": "Upon her skinny lips: you should be women,",
          "char_start": 4844,
          "char_end": 4886,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp14i7",
          "text": "And yet your beards forbid me to interpret",
          "char_start": 4887,
          "char_end": 4929,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp14i8",
          "text": "That you are so.",
          "char_start": 4930,
          "char_end": 4946,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp15i0",
          "text": "Speak, if you can: what are you?",
          "char_start": 4947,
          "char_end": 4979,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp16i0",
          "text": "All hail, Macbeth! hail to thee, thane of Glamis!",
          "char_start": 4980,
          "char_end": 5029,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp17i0",
          "text": "All hail, Macbeth, hail to thee, thane of Cawdor!",
          "char_start": 5030,
          "char_end": 5079,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp18i0",
          "text": "All hail, Macbeth, thou shalt be king hereafter!",
          "char_start": 5080,
          "char_end": 5128,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i0",
          "text": "Good sir, why do you start; and seem to fear",
          "char_start": 5129,
          "char_end": 5173,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i1",
          "text": "Things that do sound so fair? I' the name of truth,",
          "char_start": 5174,
          "char_end": 5225,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i2",
          "text": "Are ye fantastical, or that indeed",
          "char_start": 5226,
          "char_end": 5260,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i3",
          "text": "Which outwardly ye show? My noble partner",
          "char_start": 5261,
          "char_end": 5302,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i4",
          "text": "You greet with present grace and great prediction",
          "char_start": 5303,
          "char_end": 5352,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i5",
          "text": "Of noble having and of royal hope,",
          "char_start": 5353,
          "char_end": 5387,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i6",
          "text": "That he seems rapt withal: to me you speak not.",
          "char_start": 5388,
          "char_end": 5435,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i7",
          "text": "If you can look into the seeds of time,",
          "char_start": 5436,
          "char_end": 5475,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i8",
          "text": "And say which grain will grow and which will not,",
          "char_start": 5476,
          "char_end": 5525,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i9",
          "text": "Speak then to me, who neither beg nor fear",
          "char_start": 5526,
          "char_end": 5568,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp19i10",
          "text": "Your favours nor your hate.",
          "char_start": 5569,
          "char_end": 5596,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp20i0",
          "text": "Hail!",
          "char_start": 5597,
          "char_end": 5602,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp21i0",
          "text": "Hail!",
          "char_start": 5603,
          "char_end": 5608,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp22i0",
          "text": "Hail!",
          "char_start": 5609,
          "char_end": 5614,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp23i0",
          "text": "Lesser than Macbeth, and greater.",
          "char_start": 5615,
          "char_end": 5648,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp24i0",
          "text": "Not so happy, yet much happier.",
          "char_start": 5649,
          "char_end": 5680,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp25i0",
          "text": "Thou shalt get kings, though thou be none:",
          "char_start": 5681,
          "char_end": 5723,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp25i1",
          "text": "So all hail, Macbeth and Banquo!",
          "char_start": 5724,
          "char_end": 5756,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp26i0",
          "text": "Banquo and Macbeth, all hail!",
          "char_start": 5757,
          "char_end": 5786,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i0",
          "text": "Stay, you imperfect speakers, tell me more:",
          "char_start": 5787,
          "char_end": 5830,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i1",
          "text": "By Sinel's death I know I am thane of Glamis;",
          "char_start": 5831,
          "char_end": 5876,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i2",
          "text": "But how of Cawdor? the thane of Cawdor lives,",
          "char_start": 5877,
          "char_end": 5922,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i3",
          "text": "A prosperous gentleman; and to be king",
          "char_start": 5923,
          "char_end": 5961,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i4",
          "text": "Stands not within the prospect of belief,",
          "char_start": 5962,
          "char_end": 6003,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i5",
          "text": "No more than to be Cawdor. Say from whence",
          "char_start": 6004,
          "char_end": 6046,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i6",
          "text": "You owe this strange intelligence? or why",
          "char_start": 6047,
          "char_end": 6088,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i7",
          "text": "Upon this blasted heath you stop our way",
          "char_start": 6089,
          "char_end": 6129,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i8",
          "text": "With such prophetic greeting? Speak, I charge you.",
          "char_start": 6130,
          "char_end": 6180,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp27i9",
          "text": "Witches vanish",
          "char_start": 6181,
          "char_end": 6195,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp28i0",
          "text": "The earth hath bubbles, as the water has,",
          "char_start": 6196,
          "char_end": 6237,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp28i1",
          "text": "And these are of them. Whither are they vanish'd?",
          "char_start": 6238,
          "char_end": 6287,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp29i0",
          "text": "Into the air; and what seem'd corporal melted",
          "char_start": 6288,
          "char_end": 6333,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp29i1",
          "text": "As breath into the wind. Would they had stay'd!",
          "char_start": 6334,
          "char_end": 6381,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp30i0",
          "text": "Were such things here as we do speak about?",
          "char_start": 6382,
          "char_end": 6425,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp30i1",
          "text": "Or have we eaten on the insane root",
          "char_start": 6426,
          "char_end": 6461,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp30i2",
          "text": "That takes the reason prisoner?",
          "char_start": 6462,
          "char_end": 6493,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.87",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp31i0",
          "text": "Your children shall be kings.",
          "char_start": 6494,
          "char_end": 6523,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.88",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp32i0",
          "text": "You shall be king.",
          "char_start": 6524,
          "char_end": 6542,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.89",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp33i0",
          "text": "And thane of Cawdor too: went it not so?",
          "char_start": 6543,
          "char_end": 6583,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.90",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp34i0",
          "text": "To the selfsame tune and words. Who's here?",
          "char_start": 6584,
          "char_end": 6627,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.91",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp34i1",
          "text": "Enter ROSS and ANGUS",
          "char_start": 6628,
          "char_end": 6648,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i0",
          "text": "The king hath happily received, Macbeth,",
          "char_start": 6649,
          "char_end": 6689,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.92",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i1",
          "text": "The news of thy success; and when he reads",
          "char_start": 6690,
          "char_end": 6732,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.93",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i2",
          "text": "Thy personal venture in the rebels' fight,",
          "char_start": 6733,
          "char_end": 6775,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.94",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i3",
          "text": "His wonders and his praises do contend",
          "char_start": 6776,
          "char_end": 6814,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.95",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i4",
          "text": "Which should be thine or his: silenced with that,",
          "char_start": 6815,
          "char_end": 6864,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.96",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i5",
          "text": "In viewing o'er the rest o' the selfsame day,",
          "char_start": 6865,
          "char_end": 6910,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.97",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i6",
          "text": "He finds thee in the stout Norweyan ranks,",
          "char_start": 6911,
          "char_end": 6953,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.98",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i7",
          "text": "Nothing afeard of what thyself didst make,",
          "char_start": 6954,
          "char_end": 6996,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.99",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i8",
          "text": "Strange images of death. As thick as hail",
          "char_start": 6997,
          "char_end": 7038,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.100",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i9",
          "text": "Came post with post; and every one did bear",
          "char_start": 7039,
          "char_end": 7082,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.101",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i10",
          "text": "Thy praises in his kingdom's great defence,",
          "char_start": 7083,
          "char_end": 7126,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.102",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp35i11",
          "text": "And pour'd them down before him.",
          "char_start": 7127,
          "char_end": 7159,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.103",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp36i0",
          "text": "We are sent",
          "char_start": 7160,
          "char_end": 7171,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.104",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp36i1",
          "text": "To give thee from our royal master thanks;",
          "char_start": 7172,
          "char_end": 7214,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.105",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp36i2",
          "text": "Only to herald thee into his sight,",
          "char_start": 7215,
          "char_end": 7250,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.106",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp36i3",
          "text": "Not pay thee.",
          "char_start": 7251,
          "char_end": 7264,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.107",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp37i0",
          "text": "And, for an earnest of a greater honour,",
          "char_start": 7265,
          "char_end": 7305,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.108",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp37i1",
          "text": "He bade me, from him, call thee thane of Cawdor:",
          "char_start": 7306,
          "char_end": 7354,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.109",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp37i2",
          "text": "In which addition, hail, most worthy thane!",
          "char_start": 7355,
          "char_end": 7398,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.110",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp37i3",
          "text": "For it is thine.",
          "char_start": 7399,
          "char_end": 7415,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.111",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp38i0",
          "text": "What, can the devil speak true?",
          "char_start": 7416,
          "char_end": 7447,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.112",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp39i0",
          "text": "The thane of Cawdor lives: why do you dress me",
          "char_start": 7448,
          "char_end": 7494,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.113",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp39i1",
          "text": "In borrow'd robes?",
          "char_start": 7495,
          "char_end": 7513,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.114",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp40i0",
          "text": "Who was the thane lives yet;",
          "char_start": 7514,
          "char_end": 7542,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.115",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp40i1",
          "text": "But under heavy judgment bears that life",
          "char_start": 7543,
          "char_end": 7583,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.116",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp40i2",
          "text": "Which he deserves to lose. Whether he was combined",
          "char_start": 7584,
          "char_end": 7634,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.117",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp40i3",
          "text": "With those of Norway, or did line the rebel",
          "char_start": 7635,
          "char_end": 7678,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.118",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp40i4",
          "text": "With hidden help and vantage, or that with both",
          "char_start": 7679,
          "char_end": 7726,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.119",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp40i5",
          "text": "He labour'd in his country's wreck, I know not;",
          "char_start": 7727,
          "char_end": 7774,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.120",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp40i6",
          "text": "But treasons capital, confess'd and proved,",
          "char_start": 7775,
          "char_end": 7818,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.121",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp40i7",
          "text": "Have overthrown him.",
          "char_start": 7819,
          "char_end": 7839,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.122",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp41i0",
          "text": "[Aside] Glamis, and thane of Cawdor!",
          "char_start": 7840,
          "char_end": 7876,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.123",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp41i1",
          "text": "The greatest is behind.",
          "char_start": 7877,
          "char_end": 7900,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.124",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp41i2",
          "text": "To ROSS and ANGUS",
          "char_start": 7901,
          "char_end": 7918,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp41i3",
          "text": "Thanks for your pains.",
          "char_start": 7919,
          "char_end": 7941,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.125",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp41i4",
          "text": "To BANQUO",
          "char_start": 7942,
          "char_end": 7951,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp41i5",
          "text": "Do you not hope your children shall be kings,",
          "char_start": 7952,
          "char_end": 7997,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.126",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp41i6",
          "text": "When those that gave the thane of Cawdor to me",
          "char_start": 7998,
          "char_end": 8044,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.127",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp41i7",
          "text": "Promised no less to them?",
          "char_start": 8045,
          "char_end": 8070,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.128",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp42i0",
          "text": "That trusted home",
          "char_start": 8071,
          "char_end": 8088,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.129",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp42i1",
          "text": "Might yet enkindle you unto the crown,",
          "char_start": 8089,
          "char_end": 8127,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.130",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp42i2",
          "text": "Besides the thane of Cawdor. But 'tis strange:",
          "char_start": 8128,
          "char_end": 8174,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.131",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp42i3",
          "text": "And oftentimes, to win us to our harm,",
          "char_start": 8175,
          "char_end": 8213,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.132",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp42i4",
          "text": "The instruments of darkness tell us truths,",
          "char_start": 8214,
          "char_end": 8257,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.133",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp42i5",
          "text": "Win us with honest trifles, to betray's",
          "char_start": 8258,
          "char_end": 8297,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.134",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp42i6",
          "text": "In deepest consequence.",
          "char_start": 8298,
          "char_end": 8321,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.135",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp42i7",
          "text": "Cousins, a word, I pray you.",
          "char_start": 8322,
          "char_end": 8350,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.136",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i0",
          "text": "[Aside] Two truths are told,",
          "char_start": 8351,
          "char_end": 8379,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.137",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i1",
          "text": "As happy prologues to the swelling act",
          "char_start": 8380,
          "char_end": 8418,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.138",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i2",
          "text": "Of the imperial theme.--I thank you, gentlemen.",
          "char_start": 8419,
          "char_end": 8466,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.139",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i3",
          "text": "Aside",
          "char_start": 8467,
          "char_end": 8472,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i4",
          "text": "Cannot be ill, cannot be good: if ill,",
          "char_start": 8473,
          "char_end": 8511,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.140",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i5",
          "text": "Why hath it given me earnest of success,",
          "char_start": 8512,
          "char_end": 8552,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.141",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i6",
          "text": "Commencing in a truth? I am thane of Cawdor:",
          "char_start": 8553,
          "char_end": 8597,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.142",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i7",
          "text": "If good, why do I yield to that suggestion",
          "char_start": 8598,
          "char_end": 8640,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.143",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i8",
          "text": "Whose horrid image doth unfix my hair",
          "char_start": 8641,
          "char_end": 8678,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.144",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i9",
          "text": "And make my seated heart knock at my ribs,",
          "char_start": 8679,
          "char_end": 8721,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.145",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i10",
          "text": "Against the use of nature? Present fears",
          "char_start": 8722,
          "char_end": 8762,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.146",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i11",
          "text": "Are less than horrible imaginings:",
          "char_start": 8763,
          "char_end": 8797,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.147",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i12",
          "text": "My thought, whose murder yet is but fantastical,",
          "char_start": 8798,
          "char_end": 8846,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.148",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i13",
          "text": "Shakes so my single state of man that function",
          "char_start": 8847,
          "char_end": 8893,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.149",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i14",
          "text": "Is smother'd in surmise, and nothing is",
          "char_start": 8894,
          "char_end": 8933,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.150",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp43i15",
          "text": "But what is not.",
          "char_start": 8934,
          "char_end": 8950,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.151",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp44i0",
          "text": "Look, how our partner's rapt.",
          "char_start": 8951,
          "char_end": 8980,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.152",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp45i0",
          "text": "[Aside] If chance will have me king, why, chance may crown me,",
          "char_start": 8981,
          "char_end": 9043,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.153",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp45i1",
          "text": "Without my stir.",
          "char_start": 9044,
          "char_end": 9060,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.154",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp46i0",
          "text": "New horrors come upon him,",
          "char_start": 9061,
          "char_end": 9087,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.155",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp46i1",
          "text": "Like our strange garments, cleave not to their mould",
          "char_start": 9088,
          "char_end": 9140,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.156",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp46i2",
          "text": "But with the aid of use.",
          "char_start": 9141,
          "char_end": 9165,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.157",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp47i0",
          "text": "[Aside] Come what come may,",
          "char_start": 9166,
          "char_end": 9193,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.158",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp47i1",
          "text": "Time and the hour runs through the roughest day.",
          "char_start": 9194,
          "char_end": 9242,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.159",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp48i0",
          "text": "Worthy Macbeth, we stay upon your leisure.",
          "char_start": 9243,
          "char_end": 9285,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.160",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp49i0",
          "text": "Give me your favour: my dull brain was wrought",
          "char_start": 9286,
          "char_end": 9332,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.161",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp49i1",
          "text": "With things forgotten. Kind gentlemen, your pains",
          "char_start": 9333,
          "char_end": 9382,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.162",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp49i2",
          "text": "Are register'd where every day I turn",
          "char_start": 9383,
          "char_end": 9420,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.163",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp49i3",
          "text": "The leaf to read them. Let us toward the king.",
          "char_start": 9421,
          "char_end": 9467,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.164",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp49i4",
          "text": "Think upon what hath chanced, and, at more time,",
          "char_start": 9468,
          "char_end": 9516,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.165",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp49i5",
          "text": "The interim having weigh'd it, let us speak",
          "char_start": 9517,
          "char_end": 9560,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.166",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp49i6",
          "text": "Our free hearts each to other.",
          "char_start": 9561,
          "char_end": 9591,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.167",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp50i0",
          "text": "Very gladly.",
          "char_start": 9592,
          "char_end": 9604,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.168",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp51i0",
          "text": "Till then, enough. Come, friends.",
          "char_start": 9605,
          "char_end": 9638,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "1.3.169",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s3:sp51i1",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 9639,
          "char_end": 9645,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:open",
          "text": "Flourish. Enter DUNCAN, MALCOLM, DONALBAIN, LENNOX, and Attendants",
          "char_start": 9646,
          "char_end": 9712,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp1i0",
          "text": "Is execution done on Cawdor? Are not",
          "char_start": 9713,
          "char_end": 9749,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp1i1",
          "text": "Those in commission yet return'd?",
          "char_start": 9750,
          "char_end": 9783,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i0",
          "text": "My liege,",
          "char_start": 9784,
          "char_end": 9793,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i1",
          "text": "They are not yet come back. But I have spoke",
          "char_start": 9794,
          "char_end": 9838,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i2",
          "text": "With one that saw him die: who did report",
          "char_start": 9839,
          "char_end": 9880,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i3",
          "text": "That very frankly he confess'd his treasons,",
          "char_start": 9881,
          "char_end": 9925,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i4",
          "text": "Implored your highness' pardon and set forth",
          "char_start": 9926,
          "char_end": 9970,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i5",
          "text": "A deep repentance: nothing in his life",
          "char_start": 9971,
          "char_end": 10009,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i6",
          "text": "Became him like the leaving it; he died",
          "char_start": 10010,
          "char_end": 10049,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i7",
          "text": "As one that had been studied in his death",
          "char_start": 10050,
          "char_end": 10091,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i8",
          "text": "To throw away the dearest thing he owed,",
          "char_start": 10092,
          "char_end": 10132,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp2i9",
          "text": "As 'twere a careless trifle.",
          "char_start": 10133,
          "char_end": 10161,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i0",
          "text": "There's no art",
          "char_start": 10162,
          "char_end": 10176,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i1",
          "text": "To find the mind's construction in the face:",
          "char_start": 10177,
          "char_end": 10221,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i2",
          "text": "He was a gentleman on whom I built",
          "char_start": 10222,
          "char_end": 10256,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i3",
          "text": "An absolute trust.",
          "char_start": 10257,
          "char_end": 10275,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i4",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH, BANQUO, ROSS, and ANGUS",
          "char_start": 10276,
          "char_end": 10314,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i5",
          "text": "O worthiest cousin!",
          "char_start": 10315,
          "char_end": 10334,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i6",
          "text": "The sin of my ingratitude even now",
          "char_start": 10335,
          "char_end": 10369,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i7",
          "text": "Was heavy on me: thou art so far before",
          "char_start": 10370,
          "char_end": 10409,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i8",
          "text": "That swiftest wing of recompense is slow",
          "char_start": 10410,
          "char_end": 10450,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i9",
          "text": "To overtake thee. Would thou hadst less deserved,",
          "char_start": 10451,
          "char_end": 10500,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i10",
          "text": "That the proportion both of thanks and payment",
          "char_start": 10501,
          "char_end": 10547,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i11",
          "text": "Might have been mine! only I have left to say,",
          "char_start": 10548,
          "char_end": 10594,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp3i12",
          "text": "More is thy due than more than all can pay.",
          "char_start": 10595,
          "char_end": 10638,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp4i0",
          "text": "The service and the loyalty I owe,",
          "char_start": 10639,
          "char_end": 10673,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp4i1",
          "text": "In doing it, pays itself. Your highness' part",
          "char_start": 10674,
          "char_end": 10719,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp4i2",
          "text": "Is to receive our duties; and our duties",
          "char_start": 10720,
          "char_end": 10760,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp4i3",
          "text": "Are to your throne and state children and servants,",
          "char_start": 10761,
          "char_end": 10812,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp4i4",
          "text": "Which do but what they should, by doing every thing",
          "char_start": 10813,
          "char_end": 10864,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp4i5",
          "text": "Safe toward your love and honour.",
          "char_start": 10865,
          "char_end": 10898,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp5i0",
          "text": "Welcome hither:",
          "char_start": 10899,
          "char_end": 10914,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp5i1",
          "text": "I have begun to plant thee, and will labour",
          "char_start": 10915,
          "char_end": 10958,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp5i2",
          "text": "To make thee full of growing. Noble Banquo,",
          "char_start": 10959,
          "char_end": 11002,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp5i3",
          "text": "That hast no less deserved, nor must be known",
          "char_start": 11003,
          "char_end": 11048,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp5i4",
          "text": "No less to have done so, let me enfold thee",
          "char_start": 11049,
          "char_end": 11092,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp5i5",
          "text": "And hold thee to my heart.",
          "char_start": 11093,
          "char_end": 11119,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp6i0",
          "text": "There if I grow,",
          "char_start": 11120,
          "char_end": 11136,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp6i1",
          "text": "The harvest is your own.",
          "char_start": 11137,
          "char_end": 11161,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i0",
          "text": "My plenteous joys,",
          "char_start": 11162,
          "char_end": 11180,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i1",
          "text": "Wanton in fulness, seek to hide themselves",
          "char_start": 11181,
          "char_end": 11223,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i2",
          "text": "In drops of sorrow. Sons, kinsmen, thanes,",
          "char_start": 11224,
          "char_end": 11266,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i3",
          "text": "And you whose places are the nearest, know",
          "char_start": 11267,
          "char_end": 11309,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i4",
          "text": "We will establish our estate upon",
          "char_start": 11310,
          "char_end": 11343,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i5",
          "text": "Our eldest, Malcolm, whom we name hereafter",
          "char_start": 11344,
          "char_end": 11387,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i6",
          "text": "The Prince of Cumberland; which honour must",
          "char_start": 11388,
          "char_end": 11431,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i7",
          "text": "Not unaccompanied invest him only,",
          "char_start": 11432,
          "char_end": 11466,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i8",
          "text": "But signs of nobleness, like stars, shall shine",
          "char_start": 11467,
          "char_end": 11514,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i9",
          "text": "On all deservers. From hence to Inverness,",
          "char_start": 11515,
          "char_end": 11557,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp7i10",
          "text": "And bind us further to you.",
          "char_start": 11558,
          "char_end": 11585,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp8i0",
          "text": "The rest is labour, which is not used for you:",
          "char_start": 11586,
          "char_end": 11632,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp8i1",
          "text": "I'll be myself the harbinger and make joyful",
          "char_start": 11633,
          "char_end": 11677,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp8i2",
          "text": "The hearing of my wife with your approach;",
          "char_start": 11678,
          "char_end": 11720,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp8i3",
          "text": "So humbly take my leave.",
          "char_start": 11721,
          "char_end": 11745,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp9i0",
          "text": "My worthy Cawdor!",
          "char_start": 11746,
          "char_end": 11763,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp10i0",
          "text": "[Aside] The Prince of Cumberland! that is a step",
          "char_start": 11764,
          "char_end": 11812,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp10i1",
          "text": "On which I must fall down, or else o'erleap,",
          "char_start": 11813,
          "char_end": 11857,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp10i2",
          "text": "For in my way it lies. Stars, hide your fires;",
          "char_start": 11858,
          "char_end": 11904,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp10i3",
          "text": "Let not light see my black and deep desires:",
          "char_start": 11905,
          "char_end": 11949,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp10i4",
          "text": "The eye wink at the hand; yet let that be,",
          "char_start": 11950,
          "char_end": 11992,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp10i5",
          "text": "Which the eye fears, when it is done, to see.",
          "char_start": 11993,
          "char_end": 12038,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp10i6",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 12039,
          "char_end": 12043,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp11i0",
          "text": "True, worthy Banquo; he is full so valiant,",
          "char_start": 12044,
          "char_end": 12087,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp11i1",
          "text": "And in his commendations I am fed;",
          "char_start": 12088,
          "char_end": 12122,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp11i2",
          "text": "It is a banquet to me. Let's after him,",
          "char_start": 12123,
          "char_end": 12162,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp11i3",
          "text": "Whose care is gone before to bid us welcome:",
          "char_start": 12163,
          "char_end": 12207,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp11i4",
          "text": "It is a peerless kinsman.",
          "char_start": 12208,
          "char_end": 12233,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "1.4.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s4:sp11i5",
          "text": "Flourish. Exeunt",
          "char_start": 12234,
          "char_end": 12250,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:open",
          "text": "Enter LADY MACBETH, reading a letter",
          "char_start": 12251,
          "char_end": 12287,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i0",
          "text": "'They met me in the day of success: and I have",
          "char_start": 12288,
          "char_end": 12334,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i1",
          "text": "learned by the perfectest report, they have more in",
          "char_start": 12335,
          "char_end": 12386,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i2",
          "text": "them than mortal knowledge. When I burned in desire",
          "char_start": 12387,
          "char_end": 12438,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i3",
          "text": "to question them further, they made themselves air,",
          "char_start": 12439,
          "char_end": 12490,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i4",
          "text": "into which they vanished. Whiles I stood rapt in",
          "char_start": 12491,
          "char_end": 12539,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i5",
          "text": "the wonder of it, came missives from the king, who",
          "char_start": 12540,
          "char_end": 12590,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i6",
          "text": "all-hailed me 'Thane of Cawdor;' by which title,",
          "char_start": 12591,
          "char_end": 12639,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i7",
          "text": "before, these weird sisters saluted me, and referred",
          "char_start": 12640,
          "char_end": 12692,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i8",
          "text": "me to the coming on of time, with 'Hail, king that",
          "char_start": 12693,
          "char_end": 12743,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i9",
          "text": "shalt be!' This have I thought good to deliver",
          "char_start": 12744,
          "char_end": 12790,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i10",
          "text": "thee, my dearest partner of greatness, that thou",
          "char_start": 12791,
          "char_end": 12839,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i11",
          "text": "mightst not lose the dues of rejoicing, by being",
          "char_start": 12840,
          "char_end": 12888,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i12",
          "text": "ignorant of what greatness is promised thee. Lay it",
          "char_start": 12889,
          "char_end": 12940,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i13",
          "text": "to thy heart, and farewell.'",
          "char_start": 12941,
          "char_end": 12969,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i14",
          "text": "Glamis thou art, and Cawdor; and shalt be",
          "char_start": 12970,
          "char_end": 13011,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i15",
          "text": "What thou art promised: yet do I fear thy nature;",
          "char_start": 13012,
          "char_end": 13061,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i16",
          "text": "It is too full o' the milk of human kindness",
          "char_start": 13062,
          "char_end": 13106,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i17",
          "text": "To catch the nearest way: thou wouldst be great;",
          "char_start": 13107,
          "char_end": 13155,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i18",
          "text": "Art not without ambition, but without",
          "char_start": 13156,
          "char_end": 13193,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i19",
          "text": "The illness should attend it: what thou wouldst highly,",
          "char_start": 13194,
          "char_end": 13249,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i20",
          "text": "That wouldst thou holily; wouldst not play false,",
          "char_start": 13250,
          "char_end": 13299,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i21",
          "text": "And yet wouldst wrongly win: thou'ldst have, great Glamis,",
          "char_start": 13300,
          "char_end": 13358,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i22",
          "text": "That which cries 'Thus thou must do, if thou have it;",
          "char_start": 13359,
          "char_end": 13412,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i23",
          "text": "And that which rather thou dost fear to do",
          "char_start": 13413,
          "char_end": 13455,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i24",
          "text": "Than wishest should be undone.' Hie thee hither,",
          "char_start": 13456,
          "char_end": 13504,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i25",
          "text": "That I may pour my spirits in thine ear;",
          "char_start": 13505,
          "char_end": 13545,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i26",
          "text": "And chastise with the valour of my tongue",
          "char_start": 13546,
          "char_end": 13587,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i27",
          "text": "All that impedes thee from the golden round,",
          "char_start": 13588,
          "char_end": 13632,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i28",
          "text": "Which fate and metaphysical aid doth seem",
          "char_start": 13633,
          "char_end": 13674,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i29",
          "text": "To have thee crown'd withal.",
          "char_start": 13675,
          "char_end": 13703,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i30",
          "text": "Enter a Messenger",
          "char_start": 13704,
          "char_end": 13721,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp1i31",
          "text": "What is your tidings?",
          "char_start": 13722,
          "char_end": 13743,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp2i0",
          "text": "The king comes here to-night.",
          "char_start": 13744,
          "char_end": 13773,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp3i0",
          "text": "Thou'rt mad to say it:",
          "char_start": 13774,
          "char_end": 13796,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp3i1",
          "text": "Is not thy master with him? who, were't so,",
          "char_start": 13797,
          "char_end": 13840,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp3i2",
          "text": "Would have inform'd for preparation.",
          "char_start": 13841,
          "char_end": 13877,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp4i0",
          "text": "So please you, it is true: our thane is coming:",
          "char_start": 13878,
          "char_end": 13925,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp4i1",
          "text": "One of my fellows had the speed of him,",
          "char_start": 13926,
          "char_end": 13965,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp4i2",
          "text": "Who, almost dead for breath, had scarcely more",
          "char_start": 13966,
          "char_end": 14012,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp4i3",
          "text": "Than would make up his message.",
          "char_start": 14013,
          "char_end": 14044,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i0",
          "text": "Give him tending;",
          "char_start": 14045,
          "char_end": 14062,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i1",
          "text": "He brings great news.",
          "char_start": 14063,
          "char_end": 14084,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i2",
          "text": "Exit Messenger",
          "char_start": 14085,
          "char_end": 14099,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i3",
          "text": "The raven himself is hoarse",
          "char_start": 14100,
          "char_end": 14127,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i4",
          "text": "That croaks the fatal entrance of Duncan",
          "char_start": 14128,
          "char_end": 14168,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i5",
          "text": "Under my battlements. Come, you spirits",
          "char_start": 14169,
          "char_end": 14208,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i6",
          "text": "That tend on mortal thoughts, unsex me here,",
          "char_start": 14209,
          "char_end": 14253,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i7",
          "text": "And fill me from the crown to the toe top-full",
          "char_start": 14254,
          "char_end": 14300,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i8",
          "text": "Of direst cruelty! make thick my blood;",
          "char_start": 14301,
          "char_end": 14340,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i9",
          "text": "Stop up the access and passage to remorse,",
          "char_start": 14341,
          "char_end": 14383,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i10",
          "text": "That no compunctious visitings of nature",
          "char_start": 14384,
          "char_end": 14424,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i11",
          "text": "Shake my fell purpose, nor keep peace between",
          "char_start": 14425,
          "char_end": 14470,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i12",
          "text": "The effect and it! Come to my woman's breasts,",
          "char_start": 14471,
          "char_end": 14517,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i13",
          "text": "And take my milk for gall, you murdering ministers,",
          "char_start": 14518,
          "char_end": 14569,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i14",
          "text": "Wherever in your sightless substances",
          "char_start": 14570,
          "char_end": 14607,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i15",
          "text": "You wait on nature's mischief! Come, thick night,",
          "char_start": 14608,
          "char_end": 14657,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i16",
          "text": "And pall thee in the dunnest smoke of hell,",
          "char_start": 14658,
          "char_end": 14701,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i17",
          "text": "That my keen knife see not the wound it makes,",
          "char_start": 14702,
          "char_end": 14748,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i18",
          "text": "Nor heaven peep through the blanket of the dark,",
          "char_start": 14749,
          "char_end": 14797,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i19",
          "text": "To cry 'Hold, hold!'",
          "char_start": 14798,
          "char_end": 14818,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i20",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH",
          "char_start": 14819,
          "char_end": 14832,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i21",
          "text": "Great Glamis! worthy Cawdor!",
          "char_start": 14833,
          "char_end": 14861,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i22",
          "text": "Greater than both, by the all-hail hereafter!",
          "char_start": 14862,
          "char_end": 14907,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i23",
          "text": "Thy letters have transported me beyond",
          "char_start": 14908,
          "char_end": 14946,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i24",
          "text": "This ignorant present, and I feel now",
          "char_start": 14947,
          "char_end": 14984,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp5i25",
          "text": "The future in the instant.",
          "char_start": 14985,
          "char_end": 15011,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp6i0",
          "text": "My dearest love,",
          "char_start": 15012,
          "char_end": 15028,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp6i1",
          "text": "Duncan comes here to-night.",
          "char_start": 15029,
          "char_end": 15056,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp7i0",
          "text": "And when goes hence?",
          "char_start": 15057,
          "char_end": 15077,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp8i0",
          "text": "To-morrow, as he purposes.",
          "char_start": 15078,
          "char_end": 15104,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i0",
          "text": "O, never",
          "char_start": 15105,
          "char_end": 15113,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i1",
          "text": "Shall sun that morrow see!",
          "char_start": 15114,
          "char_end": 15140,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i2",
          "text": "Your face, my thane, is as a book where men",
          "char_start": 15141,
          "char_end": 15184,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i3",
          "text": "May read strange matters. To beguile the time,",
          "char_start": 15185,
          "char_end": 15231,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i4",
          "text": "Look like the time; bear welcome in your eye,",
          "char_start": 15232,
          "char_end": 15277,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i5",
          "text": "Your hand, your tongue: look like the innocent flower,",
          "char_start": 15278,
          "char_end": 15332,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i6",
          "text": "But be the serpent under't. He that's coming",
          "char_start": 15333,
          "char_end": 15377,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i7",
          "text": "Must be provided for: and you shall put",
          "char_start": 15378,
          "char_end": 15417,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i8",
          "text": "This night's great business into my dispatch;",
          "char_start": 15418,
          "char_end": 15463,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i9",
          "text": "Which shall to all our nights and days to come",
          "char_start": 15464,
          "char_end": 15510,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp9i10",
          "text": "Give solely sovereign sway and masterdom.",
          "char_start": 15511,
          "char_end": 15552,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp10i0",
          "text": "We will speak further.",
          "char_start": 15553,
          "char_end": 15575,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp11i0",
          "text": "Only look up clear;",
          "char_start": 15576,
          "char_end": 15595,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp11i1",
          "text": "To alter favour ever is to fear:",
          "char_start": 15596,
          "char_end": 15628,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp11i2",
          "text": "Leave all the rest to me.",
          "char_start": 15629,
          "char_end": 15654,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "1.5.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s5:sp11i3",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 15655,
          "char_end": 15661,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:open",
          "text": "Hautboys and torches. Enter DUNCAN, MALCOLM, DONALBAIN, BANQUO, LENNOX, MACDUFF, ROSS, ANGUS, and Attendants",
          "char_start": 15662,
          "char_end": 15770,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp1i0",
          "text": "This castle hath a pleasant seat; the air",
          "char_start": 15771,
          "char_end": 15812,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp1i1",
          "text": "Nimbly and sweetly recommends itself",
          "char_start": 15813,
          "char_end": 15849,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp1i2",
          "text": "Unto our gentle senses.",
          "char_start": 15850,
          "char_end": 15873,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp2i0",
          "text": "This guest of summer,",
          "char_start": 15874,
          "char_end": 15895,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp2i1",
          "text": "The temple-haunting martlet, does approve,",
          "char_start": 15896,
          "char_end": 15938,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp2i2",
          "text": "By his loved mansionry, that the heaven's breath",
          "char_start": 15939,
          "char_end": 15987,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp2i3",
          "text": "Smells wooingly here: no jutty, frieze,",
          "char_start": 15988,
          "char_end": 16027,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp2i4",
          "text": "Buttress, nor coign of vantage, but this bird",
          "char_start": 16028,
          "char_end": 16073,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp2i5",
          "text": "Hath made his pendent bed and procreant cradle:",
          "char_start": 16074,
          "char_end": 16121,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp2i6",
          "text": "Where they most breed and haunt, I have observed,",
          "char_start": 16122,
          "char_end": 16171,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp2i7",
          "text": "The air is delicate.",
          "char_start": 16172,
          "char_end": 16192,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp2i8",
          "text": "Enter LADY MACBETH",
          "char_start": 16193,
          "char_end": 16211,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp3i0",
          "text": "See, see, our honour'd hostess!",
          "char_start": 16212,
          "char_end": 16243,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp3i1",
          "text": "The love that follows us sometime is our trouble,",
          "char_start": 16244,
          "char_end": 16293,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp3i2",
          "text": "Which still we thank as love. Herein I teach you",
          "char_start": 16294,
          "char_end": 16342,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp3i3",
          "text": "How you shall bid God 'ild us for your pains,",
          "char_start": 16343,
          "char_end": 16388,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp3i4",
          "text": "And thank us for your trouble.",
          "char_start": 16389,
          "char_end": 16419,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp4i0",
          "text": "All our service",
          "char_start": 16420,
          "char_end": 16435,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp4i1",
          "text": "In every point twice done and then done double",
          "char_start": 16436,
          "char_end": 16482,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp4i2",
          "text": "Were poor and single business to contend",
          "char_start": 16483,
          "char_end": 16523,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp4i3",
          "text": "Against those honours deep and broad wherewith",
          "char_start": 16524,
          "char_end": 16570,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp4i4",
          "text": "Your majesty loads our house: for those of old,",
          "char_start": 16571,
          "char_end": 16618,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp4i5",
          "text": "And the late dignities heap'd up to them,",
          "char_start": 16619,
          "char_end": 16660,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp4i6",
          "text": "We rest your hermits.",
          "char_start": 16661,
          "char_end": 16682,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp5i0",
          "text": "Where's the thane of Cawdor?",
          "char_start": 16683,
          "char_end": 16711,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp5i1",
          "text": "We coursed him at the heels, and had a purpose",
          "char_start": 16712,
          "char_end": 16758,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp5i2",
          "text": "To be his purveyor: but he rides well;",
          "char_start": 16759,
          "char_end": 16797,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp5i3",
          "text": "And his great love, sharp as his spur, hath holp him",
          "char_start": 16798,
          "char_end": 16850,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp5i4",
          "text": "To his home before us. Fair and noble hostess,",
          "char_start": 16851,
          "char_end": 16897,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp5i5",
          "text": "We are your guest to-night.",
          "char_start": 16898,
          "char_end": 16925,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp6i0",
          "text": "Your servants ever",
          "char_start": 16926,
          "char_end": 16944,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp6i1",
          "text": "Have theirs, themselves and what is theirs, in compt,",
          "char_start": 16945,
          "char_end": 16998,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp6i2",
          "text": "To make their audit at your highness' pleasure,",
          "char_start": 16999,
          "char_end": 17046,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp6i3",
          "text": "Still to return your own.",
          "char_start": 17047,
          "char_end": 17072,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp7i0",
          "text": "Give me your hand;",
          "char_start": 17073,
          "char_end": 17091,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp7i1",
          "text": "Conduct me to mine host: we love him highly,",
          "char_start": 17092,
          "char_end": 17136,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp7i2",
          "text": "And shall continue our graces towards him.",
          "char_start": 17137,
          "char_end": 17179,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp7i3",
          "text": "By your leave, hostess.",
          "char_start": 17180,
          "char_end": 17203,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "1.6.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s6:sp7i4",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 17204,
          "char_end": 17210,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "DUNCAN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:open",
          "text": "Hautboys and torches. Enter a Sewer, and divers Servants with dishes and service, and pass over the stage. Then enter MACBETH",
          "char_start": 17211,
          "char_end": 17336,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i0",
          "text": "If it were done when 'tis done, then 'twere well",
          "char_start": 17337,
          "char_end": 17385,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i1",
          "text": "It were done quickly: if the assassination",
          "char_start": 17386,
          "char_end": 17428,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i2",
          "text": "Could trammel up the consequence, and catch",
          "char_start": 17429,
          "char_end": 17472,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i3",
          "text": "With his surcease success; that but this blow",
          "char_start": 17473,
          "char_end": 17518,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i4",
          "text": "Might be the be-all and the end-all here,",
          "char_start": 17519,
          "char_end": 17560,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i5",
          "text": "But here, upon this bank and shoal of time,",
          "char_start": 17561,
          "char_end": 17604,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i6",
          "text": "We'ld jump the life to come. But in these cases",
          "char_start": 17605,
          "char_end": 17652,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i7",
          "text": "We still have judgment here; that we but teach",
          "char_start": 17653,
          "char_end": 17699,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i8",
          "text": "Bloody instructions, which, being taught, return",
          "char_start": 17700,
          "char_end": 17748,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i9",
          "text": "To plague the inventor: this even-handed justice",
          "char_start": 17749,
          "char_end": 17797,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i10",
          "text": "Commends the ingredients of our poison'd chalice",
          "char_start": 17798,
          "char_end": 17846,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i11",
          "text": "To our own lips. He's here in double trust;",
          "char_start": 17847,
          "char_end": 17890,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i12",
          "text": "First, as I am his kinsman and his subject,",
          "char_start": 17891,
          "char_end": 17934,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i13",
          "text": "Strong both against the deed; then, as his host,",
          "char_start": 17935,
          "char_end": 17983,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i14",
          "text": "Who should against his murderer shut the door,",
          "char_start": 17984,
          "char_end": 18030,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i15",
          "text": "Not bear the knife myself. Besides, this Duncan",
          "char_start": 18031,
          "char_end": 18078,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i16",
          "text": "Hath borne his faculties so meek, hath been",
          "char_start": 18079,
          "char_end": 18122,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i17",
          "text": "So clear in his great office, that his virtues",
          "char_start": 18123,
          "char_end": 18169,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i18",
          "text": "Will plead like angels, trumpet-tongued, against",
          "char_start": 18170,
          "char_end": 18218,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i19",
          "text": "The deep damnation of his taking-off;",
          "char_start": 18219,
          "char_end": 18256,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i20",
          "text": "And pity, like a naked new-born babe,",
          "char_start": 18257,
          "char_end": 18294,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i21",
          "text": "Striding the blast, or heaven's cherubim, horsed",
          "char_start": 18295,
          "char_end": 18343,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i22",
          "text": "Upon the sightless couriers of the air,",
          "char_start": 18344,
          "char_end": 18383,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i23",
          "text": "Shall blow the horrid deed in every eye,",
          "char_start": 18384,
          "char_end": 18424,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i24",
          "text": "That tears shall drown the wind. I have no spur",
          "char_start": 18425,
          "char_end": 18472,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i25",
          "text": "To prick the sides of my intent, but only",
          "char_start": 18473,
          "char_end": 18514,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i26",
          "text": "Vaulting ambition, which o'erleaps itself",
          "char_start": 18515,
          "char_end": 18556,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i27",
          "text": "And falls on the other.",
          "char_start": 18557,
          "char_end": 18580,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i28",
          "text": "Enter LADY MACBETH",
          "char_start": 18581,
          "char_end": 18599,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp1i29",
          "text": "How now! what news?",
          "char_start": 18600,
          "char_end": 18619,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp2i0",
          "text": "He has almost supp'd: why have you left the chamber?",
          "char_start": 18620,
          "char_end": 18672,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp3i0",
          "text": "Hath he ask'd for me?",
          "char_start": 18673,
          "char_end": 18694,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp4i0",
          "text": "Know you not he has?",
          "char_start": 18695,
          "char_end": 18715,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp5i0",
          "text": "We will proceed no further in this business:",
          "char_start": 18716,
          "char_end": 18760,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp5i1",
          "text": "He hath honour'd me of late; and I have bought",
          "char_start": 18761,
          "char_end": 18807,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp5i2",
          "text": "Golden opinions from all sorts of people,",
          "char_start": 18808,
          "char_end": 18849,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp5i3",
          "text": "Which would be worn now in their newest gloss,",
          "char_start": 18850,
          "char_end": 18896,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp5i4",
          "text": "Not cast aside so soon.",
          "char_start": 18897,
          "char_end": 18920,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i0",
          "text": "Was the hope drunk",
          "char_start": 18921,
          "char_end": 18939,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i1",
          "text": "Wherein you dress'd yourself? hath it slept since?",
          "char_start": 18940,
          "char_end": 18990,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i2",
          "text": "And wakes it now, to look so green and pale",
          "char_start": 18991,
          "char_end": 19034,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i3",
          "text": "At what it did so freely? From this time",
          "char_start": 19035,
          "char_end": 19075,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i4",
          "text": "Such I account thy love. Art thou afeard",
          "char_start": 19076,
          "char_end": 19116,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i5",
          "text": "To be the same in thine own act and valour",
          "char_start": 19117,
          "char_end": 19159,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i6",
          "text": "As thou art in desire? Wouldst thou have that",
          "char_start": 19160,
          "char_end": 19205,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i7",
          "text": "Which thou esteem'st the ornament of life,",
          "char_start": 19206,
          "char_end": 19248,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i8",
          "text": "And live a coward in thine own esteem,",
          "char_start": 19249,
          "char_end": 19287,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i9",
          "text": "Letting 'I dare not' wait upon 'I would,'",
          "char_start": 19288,
          "char_end": 19329,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp6i10",
          "text": "Like the poor cat i' the adage?",
          "char_start": 19330,
          "char_end": 19361,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp7i0",
          "text": "Prithee, peace:",
          "char_start": 19362,
          "char_end": 19377,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp7i1",
          "text": "I dare do all that may become a man;",
          "char_start": 19378,
          "char_end": 19414,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp7i2",
          "text": "Who dares do more is none.",
          "char_start": 19415,
          "char_end": 19441,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i0",
          "text": "What beast was't, then,",
          "char_start": 19442,
          "char_end": 19465,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i1",
          "text": "That made you break this enterprise to me?",
          "char_start": 19466,
          "char_end": 19508,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i2",
          "text": "When you durst do it, then you were a man;",
          "char_start": 19509,
          "char_end": 19551,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i3",
          "text": "And, to be more than what you were, you would",
          "char_start": 19552,
          "char_end": 19597,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i4",
          "text": "Be so much more the man. Nor time nor place",
          "char_start": 19598,
          "char_end": 19641,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i5",
          "text": "Did then adhere, and yet you would make both:",
          "char_start": 19642,
          "char_end": 19687,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i6",
          "text": "They have made themselves, and that their fitness now",
          "char_start": 19688,
          "char_end": 19741,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i7",
          "text": "Does unmake you. I have given suck, and know",
          "char_start": 19742,
          "char_end": 19786,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i8",
          "text": "How tender 'tis to love the babe that milks me:",
          "char_start": 19787,
          "char_end": 19834,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i9",
          "text": "I would, while it was smiling in my face,",
          "char_start": 19835,
          "char_end": 19876,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i10",
          "text": "Have pluck'd my nipple from his boneless gums,",
          "char_start": 19877,
          "char_end": 19923,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i11",
          "text": "And dash'd the brains out, had I so sworn as you",
          "char_start": 19924,
          "char_end": 19972,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp8i12",
          "text": "Have done to this.",
          "char_start": 19973,
          "char_end": 19991,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp9i0",
          "text": "If we should fail?",
          "char_start": 19992,
          "char_end": 20010,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i0",
          "text": "We fail!",
          "char_start": 20011,
          "char_end": 20019,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i1",
          "text": "But screw your courage to the sticking-place,",
          "char_start": 20020,
          "char_end": 20065,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i2",
          "text": "And we'll not fail. When Duncan is asleep--",
          "char_start": 20066,
          "char_end": 20109,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i3",
          "text": "Whereto the rather shall his day's hard journey",
          "char_start": 20110,
          "char_end": 20157,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i4",
          "text": "Soundly invite him--his two chamberlains",
          "char_start": 20158,
          "char_end": 20198,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i5",
          "text": "Will I with wine and wassail so convince",
          "char_start": 20199,
          "char_end": 20239,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i6",
          "text": "That memory, the warder of the brain,",
          "char_start": 20240,
          "char_end": 20277,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i7",
          "text": "Shall be a fume, and the receipt of reason",
          "char_start": 20278,
          "char_end": 20320,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i8",
          "text": "A limbeck only: when in swinish sleep",
          "char_start": 20321,
          "char_end": 20358,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i9",
          "text": "Their drenched natures lie as in a death,",
          "char_start": 20359,
          "char_end": 20400,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i10",
          "text": "What cannot you and I perform upon",
          "char_start": 20401,
          "char_end": 20435,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i11",
          "text": "The unguarded Duncan? what not put upon",
          "char_start": 20436,
          "char_end": 20475,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i12",
          "text": "His spongy officers, who shall bear the guilt",
          "char_start": 20476,
          "char_end": 20521,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp10i13",
          "text": "Of our great quell?",
          "char_start": 20522,
          "char_end": 20541,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp11i0",
          "text": "Bring forth men-children only;",
          "char_start": 20542,
          "char_end": 20572,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp11i1",
          "text": "For thy undaunted mettle should compose",
          "char_start": 20573,
          "char_end": 20612,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp11i2",
          "text": "Nothing but males. Will it not be received,",
          "char_start": 20613,
          "char_end": 20656,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp11i3",
          "text": "When we have mark'd with blood those sleepy two",
          "char_start": 20657,
          "char_end": 20704,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp11i4",
          "text": "Of his own chamber and used their very daggers,",
          "char_start": 20705,
          "char_end": 20752,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp11i5",
          "text": "That they have done't?",
          "char_start": 20753,
          "char_end": 20775,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp12i0",
          "text": "Who dares receive it other,",
          "char_start": 20776,
          "char_end": 20803,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp12i1",
          "text": "As we shall make our griefs and clamour roar",
          "char_start": 20804,
          "char_end": 20848,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.87",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp12i2",
          "text": "Upon his death?",
          "char_start": 20849,
          "char_end": 20864,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.88",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp13i0",
          "text": "I am settled, and bend up",
          "char_start": 20865,
          "char_end": 20890,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.89",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp13i1",
          "text": "Each corporal agent to this terrible feat.",
          "char_start": 20891,
          "char_end": 20933,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.90",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp13i2",
          "text": "Away, and mock the time with fairest show:",
          "char_start": 20934,
          "char_end": 20976,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.91",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp13i3",
          "text": "False face must hide what the false heart doth know.",
          "char_start": 20977,
          "char_end": 21029,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "1.7.92",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a1s7:sp13i4",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 21030,
          "char_end": 21036,
          "act": 1,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:open",
          "text": "Enter BANQUO, and FLEANCE bearing a torch before him",
          "char_start": 21037,
          "char_end": 21089,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp1i0",
          "text": "How goes the night, boy?",
          "char_start": 21090,
          "char_end": 21114,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp2i0",
          "text": "The moon is down; I have not heard the clock.",
          "char_start": 21115,
          "char_end": 21160,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "FLEANCE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp3i0",
          "text": "And she goes down at twelve.",
          "char_start": 21161,
          "char_end": 21189,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp4i0",
          "text": "I take't, 'tis later, sir.",
          "char_start": 21190,
          "char_end": 21216,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "FLEANCE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp5i0",
          "text": "Hold, take my sword. There's husbandry in heaven;",
          "char_start": 21217,
          "char_end": 21266,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp5i1",
          "text": "Their candles are all out. Take thee that too.",
          "char_start": 21267,
          "char_end": 21313,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp5i2",
          "text": "A heavy summons lies like lead upon me,",
          "char_start": 21314,
          "char_end": 21353,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp5i3",
          "text": "And yet I would not sleep: merciful powers,",
          "char_start": 21354,
          "char_end": 21397,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp5i4",
          "text": "Restrain in me the cursed thoughts that nature",
          "char_start": 21398,
          "char_end": 21444,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp5i5",
          "text": "Gives way to in repose!",
          "char_start": 21445,
          "char_end": 21468,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp5i6",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH, and a Servant with a torch",
          "char_start": 21469,
          "char_end": 21510,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp5i7",
          "text": "Give me my sword.",
          "char_start": 21511,
          "char_end": 21528,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp5i8",
          "text": "Who's there?",
          "char_start": 21529,
          "char_end": 21541,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp6i0",
          "text": "A friend.",
          "char_start": 21542,
          "char_end": 21551,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp7i0",
          "text": "What, sir, not yet at rest? The king's a-bed:",
          "char_start": 21552,
          "char_end": 21597,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp7i1",
          "text": "He hath been in unusual pleasure, and",
          "char_start": 21598,
          "char_end": 21635,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp7i2",
          "text": "Sent forth great largess to your offices.",
          "char_start": 21636,
          "char_end": 21677,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp7i3",
          "text": "This diamond he greets your wife withal,",
          "char_start": 21678,
          "char_end": 21718,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp7i4",
          "text": "By the name of most kind hostess; and shut up",
          "char_start": 21719,
          "char_end": 21764,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp7i5",
          "text": "In measureless content.",
          "char_start": 21765,
          "char_end": 21788,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp8i0",
          "text": "Being unprepared,",
          "char_start": 21789,
          "char_end": 21806,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp8i1",
          "text": "Our will became the servant to defect;",
          "char_start": 21807,
          "char_end": 21845,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp8i2",
          "text": "Which else should free have wrought.",
          "char_start": 21846,
          "char_end": 21882,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp9i0",
          "text": "All's well.",
          "char_start": 21883,
          "char_end": 21894,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp9i1",
          "text": "I dreamt last night of the three weird sisters:",
          "char_start": 21895,
          "char_end": 21942,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp9i2",
          "text": "To you they have show'd some truth.",
          "char_start": 21943,
          "char_end": 21978,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp10i0",
          "text": "I think not of them:",
          "char_start": 21979,
          "char_end": 21999,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp10i1",
          "text": "Yet, when we can entreat an hour to serve,",
          "char_start": 22000,
          "char_end": 22042,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp10i2",
          "text": "We would spend it in some words upon that business,",
          "char_start": 22043,
          "char_end": 22094,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp10i3",
          "text": "If you would grant the time.",
          "char_start": 22095,
          "char_end": 22123,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp11i0",
          "text": "At your kind'st leisure.",
          "char_start": 22124,
          "char_end": 22148,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp12i0",
          "text": "If you shall cleave to my consent, when 'tis,",
          "char_start": 22149,
          "char_end": 22194,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp12i1",
          "text": "It shall make honour for you.",
          "char_start": 22195,
          "char_end": 22224,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp13i0",
          "text": "So I lose none",
          "char_start": 22225,
          "char_end": 22239,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp13i1",
          "text": "In seeking to augment it, but still keep",
          "char_start": 22240,
          "char_end": 22280,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp13i2",
          "text": "My bosom franchised and allegiance clear,",
          "char_start": 22281,
          "char_end": 22322,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp13i3",
          "text": "I shall be counsell'd.",
          "char_start": 22323,
          "char_end": 22345,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp14i0",
          "text": "Good repose the while!",
          "char_start": 22346,
          "char_end": 22368,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp15i0",
          "text": "Thanks, sir: the like to you!",
          "char_start": 22369,
          "char_end": 22398,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp15i1",
          "text": "Exeunt BANQUO and FLEANCE",
          "char_start": 22399,
          "char_end": 22424,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i0",
          "text": "Go bid thy mistress, when my drink is ready,",
          "char_start": 22425,
          "char_end": 22469,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i1",
          "text": "She strike upon the bell. Get thee to bed.",
          "char_start": 22470,
          "char_end": 22512,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i2",
          "text": "Exit Servant",
          "char_start": 22513,
          "char_end": 22525,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i3",
          "text": "Is this a dagger which I see before me,",
          "char_start": 22526,
          "char_end": 22565,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i4",
          "text": "The handle toward my hand? Come, let me clutch thee.",
          "char_start": 22566,
          "char_end": 22618,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i5",
          "text": "I have thee not, and yet I see thee still.",
          "char_start": 22619,
          "char_end": 22661,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i6",
          "text": "Art thou not, fatal vision, sensible",
          "char_start": 22662,
          "char_end": 22698,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i7",
          "text": "To feeling as to sight? or art thou but",
          "char_start": 22699,
          "char_end": 22738,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i8",
          "text": "A dagger of the mind, a false creation,",
          "char_start": 22739,
          "char_end": 22778,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i9",
          "text": "Proceeding from the heat-oppressed brain?",
          "char_start": 22779,
          "char_end": 22820,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i10",
          "text": "I see thee yet, in form as palpable",
          "char_start": 22821,
          "char_end": 22856,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i11",
          "text": "As this which now I draw.",
          "char_start": 22857,
          "char_end": 22882,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i12",
          "text": "Thou marshall'st me the way that I was going;",
          "char_start": 22883,
          "char_end": 22928,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i13",
          "text": "And such an instrument I was to use.",
          "char_start": 22929,
          "char_end": 22965,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i14",
          "text": "Mine eyes are made the fools o' the other senses,",
          "char_start": 22966,
          "char_end": 23015,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i15",
          "text": "Or else worth all the rest; I see thee still,",
          "char_start": 23016,
          "char_end": 23061,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i16",
          "text": "And on thy blade and dudgeon gouts of blood,",
          "char_start": 23062,
          "char_end": 23106,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i17",
          "text": "Which was not so before. There's no such thing:",
          "char_start": 23107,
          "char_end": 23154,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i18",
          "text": "It is the bloody business which informs",
          "char_start": 23155,
          "char_end": 23194,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i19",
          "text": "Thus to mine eyes. Now o'er the one halfworld",
          "char_start": 23195,
          "char_end": 23240,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i20",
          "text": "Nature seems dead, and wicked dreams abuse",
          "char_start": 23241,
          "char_end": 23283,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i21",
          "text": "The curtain'd sleep; witchcraft celebrates",
          "char_start": 23284,
          "char_end": 23326,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i22",
          "text": "Pale Hecate's offerings, and wither'd murder,",
          "char_start": 23327,
          "char_end": 23372,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i23",
          "text": "Alarum'd by his sentinel, the wolf,",
          "char_start": 23373,
          "char_end": 23408,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i24",
          "text": "Whose howl's his watch, thus with his stealthy pace.",
          "char_start": 23409,
          "char_end": 23461,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i25",
          "text": "With Tarquin's ravishing strides, towards his design",
          "char_start": 23462,
          "char_end": 23514,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i26",
          "text": "Moves like a ghost. Thou sure and firm-set earth,",
          "char_start": 23515,
          "char_end": 23564,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i27",
          "text": "Hear not my steps, which way they walk, for fear",
          "char_start": 23565,
          "char_end": 23613,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i28",
          "text": "Thy very stones prate of my whereabout,",
          "char_start": 23614,
          "char_end": 23653,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i29",
          "text": "And take the present horror from the time,",
          "char_start": 23654,
          "char_end": 23696,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i30",
          "text": "Which now suits with it. Whiles I threat, he lives:",
          "char_start": 23697,
          "char_end": 23748,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i31",
          "text": "Words to the heat of deeds too cold breath gives.",
          "char_start": 23749,
          "char_end": 23798,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i32",
          "text": "A bell rings",
          "char_start": 23799,
          "char_end": 23811,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i33",
          "text": "I go, and it is done; the bell invites me.",
          "char_start": 23812,
          "char_end": 23854,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i34",
          "text": "Hear it not, Duncan; for it is a knell",
          "char_start": 23855,
          "char_end": 23893,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i35",
          "text": "That summons thee to heaven or to hell.",
          "char_start": 23894,
          "char_end": 23933,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "2.1.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s1:sp16i36",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 23934,
          "char_end": 23938,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:open",
          "text": "Enter LADY MACBETH",
          "char_start": 23939,
          "char_end": 23957,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i0",
          "text": "That which hath made them drunk hath made me bold;",
          "char_start": 23958,
          "char_end": 24008,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i1",
          "text": "What hath quench'd them hath given me fire.",
          "char_start": 24009,
          "char_end": 24052,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i2",
          "text": "Hark! Peace!",
          "char_start": 24053,
          "char_end": 24065,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i3",
          "text": "It was the owl that shriek'd, the fatal bellman,",
          "char_start": 24066,
          "char_end": 24114,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i4",
          "text": "Which gives the stern'st good-night. He is about it:",
          "char_start": 24115,
          "char_end": 24167,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i5",
          "text": "The doors are open; and the surfeited grooms",
          "char_start": 24168,
          "char_end": 24212,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i6",
          "text": "Do mock their charge with snores: I have drugg'd",
          "char_start": 24213,
          "char_end": 24261,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i7",
          "text": "their possets,",
          "char_start": 24262,
          "char_end": 24276,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i8",
          "text": "That death and nature do contend about them,",
          "char_start": 24277,
          "char_end": 24321,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp1i9",
          "text": "Whether they live or die.",
          "char_start": 24322,
          "char_end": 24347,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp2i0",
          "text": "[Within] Who's there? what, ho!",
          "char_start": 24348,
          "char_end": 24379,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp3i0",
          "text": "Alack, I am afraid they have awaked,",
          "char_start": 24380,
          "char_end": 24416,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp3i1",
          "text": "And 'tis not done. The attempt and not the deed",
          "char_start": 24417,
          "char_end": 24464,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp3i2",
          "text": "Confounds us. Hark! I laid their daggers ready;",
          "char_start": 24465,
          "char_end": 24512,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp3i3",
          "text": "He could not miss 'em. Had he not resembled",
          "char_start": 24513,
          "char_end": 24556,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp3i4",
          "text": "My father as he slept, I had done't.",
          "char_start": 24557,
          "char_end": 24593,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp3i5",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH",
          "char_start": 24594,
          "char_end": 24607,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp3i6",
          "text": "My husband!",
          "char_start": 24608,
          "char_end": 24619,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp4i0",
          "text": "I have done the deed. Didst thou not hear a noise?",
          "char_start": 24620,
          "char_end": 24670,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp5i0",
          "text": "I heard the owl scream and the crickets cry.",
          "char_start": 24671,
          "char_end": 24715,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp5i1",
          "text": "Did not you speak?",
          "char_start": 24716,
          "char_end": 24734,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp6i0",
          "text": "When?",
          "char_start": 24735,
          "char_end": 24740,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp7i0",
          "text": "Now.",
          "char_start": 24741,
          "char_end": 24745,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp8i0",
          "text": "As I descended?",
          "char_start": 24746,
          "char_end": 24761,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp9i0",
          "text": "Ay.",
          "char_start": 24762,
          "char_end": 24765,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp10i0",
          "text": "Hark!",
          "char_start": 24766,
          "char_end": 24771,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp10i1",
          "text": "Who lies i' the second chamber?",
          "char_start": 24772,
          "char_end": 24803,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp11i0",
          "text": "Donalbain.",
          "char_start": 24804,
          "char_end": 24814,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp12i0",
          "text": "This is a sorry sight.",
          "char_start": 24815,
          "char_end": 24837,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp12i1",
          "text": "Looking on his hands",
          "char_start": 24838,
          "char_end": 24858,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp13i0",
          "text": "A foolish thought, to say a sorry sight.",
          "char_start": 24859,
          "char_end": 24899,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp14i0",
          "text": "There's one did laugh in's sleep, and one cried",
          "char_start": 24900,
          "char_end": 24947,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp14i1",
          "text": "'Murder!'",
          "char_start": 24948,
          "char_end": 24957,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp14i2",
          "text": "That they did wake each other: I stood and heard them:",
          "char_start": 24958,
          "char_end": 25012,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp14i3",
          "text": "But they did say their prayers, and address'd them",
          "char_start": 25013,
          "char_end": 25063,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp14i4",
          "text": "Again to sleep.",
          "char_start": 25064,
          "char_end": 25079,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp15i0",
          "text": "There are two lodged together.",
          "char_start": 25080,
          "char_end": 25110,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp16i0",
          "text": "One cried 'God bless us!' and 'Amen' the other;",
          "char_start": 25111,
          "char_end": 25158,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp16i1",
          "text": "As they had seen me with these hangman's hands.",
          "char_start": 25159,
          "char_end": 25206,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp16i2",
          "text": "Listening their fear, I could not say 'Amen,'",
          "char_start": 25207,
          "char_end": 25252,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp16i3",
          "text": "When they did say 'God bless us!'",
          "char_start": 25253,
          "char_end": 25286,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp17i0",
          "text": "Consider it not so deeply.",
          "char_start": 25287,
          "char_end": 25313,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp18i0",
          "text": "But wherefore could not I pronounce 'Amen'?",
          "char_start": 25314,
          "char_end": 25357,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp18i1",
          "text": "I had most need of blessing, and 'Amen'",
          "char_start": 25358,
          "char_end": 25397,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp18i2",
          "text": "Stuck in my throat.",
          "char_start": 25398,
          "char_end": 25417,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp19i0",
          "text": "These deeds must not be thought",
          "char_start": 25418,
          "char_end": 25449,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp19i1",
          "text": "After these ways; so, it will make us mad.",
          "char_start": 25450,
          "char_end": 25492,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp20i0",
          "text": "Methought I heard a voice cry 'Sleep no more!",
          "char_start": 25493,
          "char_end": 25538,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp20i1",
          "text": "Macbeth does murder sleep', the innocent sleep,",
          "char_start": 25539,
          "char_end": 25586,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp20i2",
          "text": "Sleep that knits up the ravell'd sleeve of care,",
          "char_start": 25587,
          "char_end": 25635,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp20i3",
          "text": "The death of each day's life, sore labour's bath,",
          "char_start": 25636,
          "char_end": 25685,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp20i4",
          "text": "Balm of hurt minds, great nature's second course,",
          "char_start": 25686,
          "char_end": 25735,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp20i5",
          "text": "Chief nourisher in life's feast,--",
          "char_start": 25736,
          "char_end": 25770,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp21i0",
          "text": "What do you mean?",
          "char_start": 25771,
          "char_end": 25788,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp22i0",
          "text": "Still it cried 'Sleep no more!' to all the house:",
          "char_start": 25789,
          "char_end": 25838,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp22i1",
          "text": "'Glamis hath murder'd sleep, and therefore Cawdor",
          "char_start": 25839,
          "char_end": 25888,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp22i2",
          "text": "Shall sleep no more; Macbeth shall sleep no more.'",
          "char_start": 25889,
          "char_end": 25939,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp23i0",
          "text": "Who was it that thus cried? Why, worthy thane,",
          "char_start": 25940,
          "char_end": 25986,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp23i1",
          "text": "You do unbend your noble strength, to think",
          "char_start": 25987,
          "char_end": 26030,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp23i2",
          "text": "So brainsickly of things. Go get some water,",
          "char_start": 26031,
          "char_end": 26075,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp23i3",
          "text": "And wash this filthy witness from your hand.",
          "char_start": 26076,
          "char_end": 26120,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp23i4",
          "text": "Why did you bring these daggers from the place?",
          "char_start": 26121,
          "char_end": 26168,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp23i5",
          "text": "They must lie there: go carry them; and smear",
          "char_start": 26169,
          "char_end": 26214,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp23i6",
          "text": "The sleepy grooms with blood.",
          "char_start": 26215,
          "char_end": 26244,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp24i0",
          "text": "I'll go no more:",
          "char_start": 26245,
          "char_end": 26261,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp24i1",
          "text": "I am afraid to think what I have done;",
          "char_start": 26262,
          "char_end": 26300,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp24i2",
          "text": "Look on't again I dare not.",
          "char_start": 26301,
          "char_end": 26328,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp25i0",
          "text": "Infirm of purpose!",
          "char_start": 26329,
          "char_end": 26347,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp25i1",
          "text": "Give me the daggers: the sleeping and the dead",
          "char_start": 26348,
          "char_end": 26394,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp25i2",
          "text": "Are but as pictures: 'tis the eye of childhood",
          "char_start": 26395,
          "char_end": 26441,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp25i3",
          "text": "That fears a painted devil. If he do bleed,",
          "char_start": 26442,
          "char_end": 26485,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp25i4",
          "text": "I'll gild the faces of the grooms withal;",
          "char_start": 26486,
          "char_end": 26527,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp25i5",
          "text": "For it must seem their guilt.",
          "char_start": 26528,
          "char_end": 26557,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp25i6",
          "text": "Exit. Knocking within",
          "char_start": 26558,
          "char_end": 26579,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp26i0",
          "text": "Whence is that knocking?",
          "char_start": 26580,
          "char_end": 26604,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp26i1",
          "text": "How is't with me, when every noise appals me?",
          "char_start": 26605,
          "char_end": 26650,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp26i2",
          "text": "What hands are here? ha! they pluck out mine eyes.",
          "char_start": 26651,
          "char_end": 26701,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp26i3",
          "text": "Will all great Neptune's ocean wash this blood",
          "char_start": 26702,
          "char_end": 26748,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp26i4",
          "text": "Clean from my hand? No, this my hand will rather",
          "char_start": 26749,
          "char_end": 26797,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp26i5",
          "text": "The multitudinous seas in incarnadine,",
          "char_start": 26798,
          "char_end": 26836,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp26i6",
          "text": "Making the green one red.",
          "char_start": 26837,
          "char_end": 26862,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp26i7",
          "text": "Re-enter LADY MACBETH",
          "char_start": 26863,
          "char_end": 26884,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i0",
          "text": "My hands are of your colour; but I shame",
          "char_start": 26885,
          "char_end": 26925,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i1",
          "text": "To wear a heart so white.",
          "char_start": 26926,
          "char_end": 26951,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i2",
          "text": "Knocking within",
          "char_start": 26952,
          "char_end": 26967,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i3",
          "text": "I hear a knocking",
          "char_start": 26968,
          "char_end": 26985,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i4",
          "text": "At the south entry: retire we to our chamber;",
          "char_start": 26986,
          "char_end": 27031,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i5",
          "text": "A little water clears us of this deed:",
          "char_start": 27032,
          "char_end": 27070,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i6",
          "text": "How easy is it, then! Your constancy",
          "char_start": 27071,
          "char_end": 27107,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i7",
          "text": "Hath left you unattended.",
          "char_start": 27108,
          "char_end": 27133,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i8",
          "text": "Knocking within",
          "char_start": 27134,
          "char_end": 27149,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i9",
          "text": "Hark! more knocking.",
          "char_start": 27150,
          "char_end": 27170,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i10",
          "text": "Get on your nightgown, lest occasion call us,",
          "char_start": 27171,
          "char_end": 27216,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.87",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i11",
          "text": "And show us to be watchers. Be not lost",
          "char_start": 27217,
          "char_end": 27256,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.88",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp27i12",
          "text": "So poorly in your thoughts.",
          "char_start": 27257,
          "char_end": 27284,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.89",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp28i0",
          "text": "To know my deed, 'twere best not know myself.",
          "char_start": 27285,
          "char_end": 27330,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.90",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp28i1",
          "text": "Knocking within",
          "char_start": 27331,
          "char_end": 27346,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp28i2",
          "text": "Wake Duncan with thy knocking! I would thou couldst!",
          "char_start": 27347,
          "char_end": 27399,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "2.2.91",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s2:sp28i3",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 27400,
          "char_end": 27406,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:open",
          "text": "Knocking within. Enter a Porter",
          "char_start": 27407,
          "char_end": 27438,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i0",
          "text": "Here's a knocking indeed! If a",
          "char_start": 27439,
          "char_end": 27469,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i1",
          "text": "man were porter of hell-gate, he should have",
          "char_start": 27470,
          "char_end": 27514,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i2",
          "text": "old turning the key.",
          "char_start": 27515,
          "char_end": 27535,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i3",
          "text": "Knocking within",
          "char_start": 27536,
          "char_end": 27551,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i4",
          "text": "Knock,",
          "char_start": 27552,
          "char_end": 27558,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i5",
          "text": "knock, knock! Who's there, i' the name of",
          "char_start": 27559,
          "char_end": 27600,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i6",
          "text": "Beelzebub? Here's a farmer, that hanged",
          "char_start": 27601,
          "char_end": 27640,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i7",
          "text": "himself on the expectation of plenty: come in",
          "char_start": 27641,
          "char_end": 27686,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i8",
          "text": "time; have napkins enow about you; here",
          "char_start": 27687,
          "char_end": 27726,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i9",
          "text": "you'll sweat for't.",
          "char_start": 27727,
          "char_end": 27746,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i10",
          "text": "Knocking within",
          "char_start": 27747,
          "char_end": 27762,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i11",
          "text": "Knock,",
          "char_start": 27763,
          "char_end": 27769,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i12",
          "text": "knock! Who's there, in the other devil's",
          "char_start": 27770,
          "char_end": 27810,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i13",
          "text": "name? Faith, here's an equivocator, that could",
          "char_start": 27811,
          "char_end": 27857,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i14",
          "text": "swear in both the scales against either scale;",
          "char_start": 27858,
          "char_end": 27904,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i15",
          "text": "who committed treason enough for God's sake,",
          "char_start": 27905,
          "char_end": 27949,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i16",
          "text": "yet could not equivocate to heaven: O, come",
          "char_start": 27950,
          "char_end": 27993,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i17",
          "text": "in, equivocator.",
          "char_start": 27994,
          "char_end": 28010,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i18",
          "text": "Knocking within",
          "char_start": 28011,
          "char_end": 28026,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i19",
          "text": "Knock,",
          "char_start": 28027,
          "char_end": 28033,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i20",
          "text": "knock, knock! Who's there? Faith, here's an",
          "char_start": 28034,
          "char_end": 28077,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i21",
          "text": "English tailor come hither, for stealing out of",
          "char_start": 28078,
          "char_end": 28125,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i22",
          "text": "a French hose: come in, tailor; here you may",
          "char_start": 28126,
          "char_end": 28170,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i23",
          "text": "roast your goose.",
          "char_start": 28171,
          "char_end": 28188,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i24",
          "text": "Knocking within",
          "char_start": 28189,
          "char_end": 28204,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i25",
          "text": "Knock,",
          "char_start": 28205,
          "char_end": 28211,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i26",
          "text": "knock; never at quiet! What are you? But",
          "char_start": 28212,
          "char_end": 28252,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i27",
          "text": "this place is too cold for hell. I'll devil-porter",
          "char_start": 28253,
          "char_end": 28303,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i28",
          "text": "it no further: I had thought to have let in",
          "char_start": 28304,
          "char_end": 28347,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i29",
          "text": "some of all professions that go the primrose",
          "char_start": 28348,
          "char_end": 28392,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i30",
          "text": "way to the everlasting bonfire.",
          "char_start": 28393,
          "char_end": 28424,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i31",
          "text": "Knocking within",
          "char_start": 28425,
          "char_end": 28440,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i32",
          "text": "Anon, anon! I pray you, remember the porter.",
          "char_start": 28441,
          "char_end": 28485,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i33",
          "text": "Opens the gate",
          "char_start": 28486,
          "char_end": 28500,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp1i34",
          "text": "Enter MACDUFF and LENNOX",
          "char_start": 28501,
          "char_end": 28525,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp2i0",
          "text": "Was it so late, friend, ere you went to bed,",
          "char_start": 28526,
          "char_end": 28570,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp2i1",
          "text": "That you do lie so late?",
          "char_start": 28571,
          "char_end": 28595,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp3i0",
          "text": "'Faith sir, we were carousing till the",
          "char_start": 28596,
          "char_end": 28634,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp3i1",
          "text": "second cock: and drink, sir, is a great",
          "char_start": 28635,
          "char_end": 28674,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp3i2",
          "text": "provoker of three things.",
          "char_start": 28675,
          "char_end": 28700,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp4i0",
          "text": "What three things does drink especially provoke?",
          "char_start": 28701,
          "char_end": 28749,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i0",
          "text": "Marry, sir, nose-painting, sleep, and",
          "char_start": 28750,
          "char_end": 28787,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i1",
          "text": "urine. Lechery, sir, it provokes, and unprovokes;",
          "char_start": 28788,
          "char_end": 28837,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i2",
          "text": "it provokes the desire, but it takes",
          "char_start": 28838,
          "char_end": 28874,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i3",
          "text": "away the performance: therefore, much drink",
          "char_start": 28875,
          "char_end": 28918,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i4",
          "text": "may be said to be an equivocator with lechery:",
          "char_start": 28919,
          "char_end": 28965,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i5",
          "text": "it makes him, and it mars him; it sets",
          "char_start": 28966,
          "char_end": 29004,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i6",
          "text": "him on, and it takes him off; it persuades him,",
          "char_start": 29005,
          "char_end": 29052,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i7",
          "text": "and disheartens him; makes him stand to, and",
          "char_start": 29053,
          "char_end": 29097,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i8",
          "text": "not stand to; in conclusion, equivocates him",
          "char_start": 29098,
          "char_end": 29142,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp5i9",
          "text": "in a sleep, and, giving him the lie, leaves him.",
          "char_start": 29143,
          "char_end": 29191,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp6i0",
          "text": "I believe drink gave thee the lie last night.",
          "char_start": 29192,
          "char_end": 29237,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp7i0",
          "text": "That it did, sir, i' the very throat on",
          "char_start": 29238,
          "char_end": 29277,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp7i1",
          "text": "me: but I requited him for his lie; and, I",
          "char_start": 29278,
          "char_end": 29320,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp7i2",
          "text": "think, being too strong for him, though he took",
          "char_start": 29321,
          "char_end": 29368,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp7i3",
          "text": "up my legs sometime, yet I made a shift to cast",
          "char_start": 29369,
          "char_end": 29416,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp7i4",
          "text": "him.",
          "char_start": 29417,
          "char_end": 29421,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Porter"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp8i0",
          "text": "Is thy master stirring?",
          "char_start": 29422,
          "char_end": 29445,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp8i1",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH",
          "char_start": 29446,
          "char_end": 29459,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp8i2",
          "text": "Our knocking has awaked him; here he comes.",
          "char_start": 29460,
          "char_end": 29503,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp9i0",
          "text": "Good morrow, noble sir.",
          "char_start": 29504,
          "char_end": 29527,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp10i0",
          "text": "Good morrow, both.",
          "char_start": 29528,
          "char_end": 29546,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp11i0",
          "text": "Is the king stirring, worthy thane?",
          "char_start": 29547,
          "char_end": 29582,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp12i0",
          "text": "Not yet.",
          "char_start": 29583,
          "char_end": 29591,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp13i0",
          "text": "He did command me to call timely on him:",
          "char_start": 29592,
          "char_end": 29632,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp13i1",
          "text": "I have almost slipp'd the hour.",
          "char_start": 29633,
          "char_end": 29664,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp14i0",
          "text": "I'll bring you to him.",
          "char_start": 29665,
          "char_end": 29687,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp15i0",
          "text": "I know this is a joyful trouble to you;",
          "char_start": 29688,
          "char_end": 29727,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp15i1",
          "text": "But yet 'tis one.",
          "char_start": 29728,
          "char_end": 29745,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp16i0",
          "text": "The labour we delight in physics pain.",
          "char_start": 29746,
          "char_end": 29784,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp16i1",
          "text": "This is the door.",
          "char_start": 29785,
          "char_end": 29802,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp17i0",
          "text": "I'll make so bold to call,",
          "char_start": 29803,
          "char_end": 29829,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp17i1",
          "text": "For 'tis my limited service.",
          "char_start": 29830,
          "char_end": 29858,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp17i2",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 29859,
          "char_end": 29863,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp18i0",
          "text": "Goes the king hence to-day?",
          "char_start": 29864,
          "char_end": 29891,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp19i0",
          "text": "He does: he did appoint so.",
          "char_start": 29892,
          "char_end": 29919,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp20i0",
          "text": "The night has been unruly: where we lay,",
          "char_start": 29920,
          "char_end": 29960,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp20i1",
          "text": "Our chimneys were blown down; and, as they say,",
          "char_start": 29961,
          "char_end": 30008,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp20i2",
          "text": "Lamentings heard i' the air; strange screams of death,",
          "char_start": 30009,
          "char_end": 30063,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp20i3",
          "text": "And prophesying with accents terrible",
          "char_start": 30064,
          "char_end": 30101,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp20i4",
          "text": "Of dire combustion and confused events",
          "char_start": 30102,
          "char_end": 30140,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp20i5",
          "text": "New hatch'd to the woeful time: the obscure bird",
          "char_start": 30141,
          "char_end": 30189,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp20i6",
          "text": "Clamour'd the livelong night: some say, the earth",
          "char_start": 30190,
          "char_end": 30239,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp20i7",
          "text": "Was feverous and did shake.",
          "char_start": 30240,
          "char_end": 30267,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp21i0",
          "text": "'Twas a rough night.",
          "char_start": 30268,
          "char_end": 30288,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp22i0",
          "text": "My young remembrance cannot parallel",
          "char_start": 30289,
          "char_end": 30325,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp22i1",
          "text": "A fellow to it.",
          "char_start": 30326,
          "char_end": 30341,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp22i2",
          "text": "Re-enter MACDUFF",
          "char_start": 30342,
          "char_end": 30358,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp23i0",
          "text": "O horror, horror, horror! Tongue nor heart",
          "char_start": 30359,
          "char_end": 30401,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp23i1",
          "text": "Cannot conceive nor name thee!",
          "char_start": 30402,
          "char_end": 30432,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp24i0",
          "text": "What's the matter.",
          "char_start": 30433,
          "char_end": 30451,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp25i0",
          "text": "What's the matter.",
          "char_start": 30452,
          "char_end": 30470,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp26i0",
          "text": "Confusion now hath made his masterpiece!",
          "char_start": 30471,
          "char_end": 30511,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp26i1",
          "text": "Most sacrilegious murder hath broke ope",
          "char_start": 30512,
          "char_end": 30551,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp26i2",
          "text": "The Lord's anointed temple, and stole thence",
          "char_start": 30552,
          "char_end": 30596,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp26i3",
          "text": "The life o' the building!",
          "char_start": 30597,
          "char_end": 30622,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp27i0",
          "text": "What is 't you say? the life?",
          "char_start": 30623,
          "char_end": 30652,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp28i0",
          "text": "Mean you his majesty?",
          "char_start": 30653,
          "char_end": 30674,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.87",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i0",
          "text": "Approach the chamber, and destroy your sight",
          "char_start": 30675,
          "char_end": 30719,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.88",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i1",
          "text": "With a new Gorgon: do not bid me speak;",
          "char_start": 30720,
          "char_end": 30759,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.89",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i2",
          "text": "See, and then speak yourselves.",
          "char_start": 30760,
          "char_end": 30791,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.90",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i3",
          "text": "Exeunt MACBETH and LENNOX",
          "char_start": 30792,
          "char_end": 30817,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i4",
          "text": "Awake, awake!",
          "char_start": 30818,
          "char_end": 30831,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.91",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i5",
          "text": "Ring the alarum-bell. Murder and treason!",
          "char_start": 30832,
          "char_end": 30873,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.92",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i6",
          "text": "Banquo and Donalbain! Malcolm! awake!",
          "char_start": 30874,
          "char_end": 30911,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.93",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i7",
          "text": "Shake off this downy sleep, death's counterfeit,",
          "char_start": 30912,
          "char_end": 30960,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.94",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i8",
          "text": "And look on death itself! up, up, and see",
          "char_start": 30961,
          "char_end": 31002,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.95",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i9",
          "text": "The great doom's image! Malcolm! Banquo!",
          "char_start": 31003,
          "char_end": 31043,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.96",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i10",
          "text": "As from your graves rise up, and walk like sprites,",
          "char_start": 31044,
          "char_end": 31095,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.97",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i11",
          "text": "To countenance this horror! Ring the bell.",
          "char_start": 31096,
          "char_end": 31138,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.98",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i12",
          "text": "Bell rings",
          "char_start": 31139,
          "char_end": 31149,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp29i13",
          "text": "Enter LADY MACBETH",
          "char_start": 31150,
          "char_end": 31168,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp30i0",
          "text": "What's the business,",
          "char_start": 31169,
          "char_end": 31189,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.99",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp30i1",
          "text": "That such a hideous trumpet calls to parley",
          "char_start": 31190,
          "char_end": 31233,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.100",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp30i2",
          "text": "The sleepers of the house? speak, speak!",
          "char_start": 31234,
          "char_end": 31274,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.101",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp31i0",
          "text": "O gentle lady,",
          "char_start": 31275,
          "char_end": 31289,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.102",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp31i1",
          "text": "'Tis not for you to hear what I can speak:",
          "char_start": 31290,
          "char_end": 31332,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.103",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp31i2",
          "text": "The repetition, in a woman's ear,",
          "char_start": 31333,
          "char_end": 31366,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.104",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp31i3",
          "text": "Would murder as it fell.",
          "char_start": 31367,
          "char_end": 31391,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.105",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp31i4",
          "text": "Enter BANQUO",
          "char_start": 31392,
          "char_end": 31404,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp31i5",
          "text": "O Banquo, Banquo,",
          "char_start": 31405,
          "char_end": 31422,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.106",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp31i6",
          "text": "Our royal master 's murder'd!",
          "char_start": 31423,
          "char_end": 31452,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.107",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp32i0",
          "text": "Woe, alas!",
          "char_start": 31453,
          "char_end": 31463,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.108",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp32i1",
          "text": "What, in our house?",
          "char_start": 31464,
          "char_end": 31483,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.109",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp33i0",
          "text": "Too cruel any where.",
          "char_start": 31484,
          "char_end": 31504,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.110",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp33i1",
          "text": "Dear Duff, I prithee, contradict thyself,",
          "char_start": 31505,
          "char_end": 31546,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.111",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp33i2",
          "text": "And say it is not so.",
          "char_start": 31547,
          "char_end": 31568,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.112",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp33i3",
          "text": "Re-enter MACBETH and LENNOX, with ROSS",
          "char_start": 31569,
          "char_end": 31607,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp34i0",
          "text": "Had I but died an hour before this chance,",
          "char_start": 31608,
          "char_end": 31650,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.113",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp34i1",
          "text": "I had lived a blessed time; for, from this instant,",
          "char_start": 31651,
          "char_end": 31702,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.114",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp34i2",
          "text": "There 's nothing serious in mortality:",
          "char_start": 31703,
          "char_end": 31741,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.115",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp34i3",
          "text": "All is but toys: renown and grace is dead;",
          "char_start": 31742,
          "char_end": 31784,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.116",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp34i4",
          "text": "The wine of life is drawn, and the mere lees",
          "char_start": 31785,
          "char_end": 31829,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.117",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp34i5",
          "text": "Is left this vault to brag of.",
          "char_start": 31830,
          "char_end": 31860,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.118",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp34i6",
          "text": "Enter MALCOLM and DONALBAIN",
          "char_start": 31861,
          "char_end": 31888,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp35i0",
          "text": "What is amiss?",
          "char_start": 31889,
          "char_end": 31903,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.119",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp36i0",
          "text": "You are, and do not know't:",
          "char_start": 31904,
          "char_end": 31931,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.120",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp36i1",
          "text": "The spring, the head, the fountain of your blood",
          "char_start": 31932,
          "char_end": 31980,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.121",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp36i2",
          "text": "Is stopp'd; the very source of it is stopp'd.",
          "char_start": 31981,
          "char_end": 32026,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.122",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp37i0",
          "text": "Your royal father 's murder'd.",
          "char_start": 32027,
          "char_end": 32057,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.123",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp38i0",
          "text": "O, by whom?",
          "char_start": 32058,
          "char_end": 32069,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.124",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp39i0",
          "text": "Those of his chamber, as it seem'd, had done 't:",
          "char_start": 32070,
          "char_end": 32118,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.125",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp39i1",
          "text": "Their hands and faces were an badged with blood;",
          "char_start": 32119,
          "char_end": 32167,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.126",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp39i2",
          "text": "So were their daggers, which unwiped we found",
          "char_start": 32168,
          "char_end": 32213,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.127",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp39i3",
          "text": "Upon their pillows:",
          "char_start": 32214,
          "char_end": 32233,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.128",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp39i4",
          "text": "They stared, and were distracted; no man's life",
          "char_start": 32234,
          "char_end": 32281,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.129",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp39i5",
          "text": "Was to be trusted with them.",
          "char_start": 32282,
          "char_end": 32310,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.130",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp40i0",
          "text": "O, yet I do repent me of my fury,",
          "char_start": 32311,
          "char_end": 32344,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.131",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp40i1",
          "text": "That I did kill them.",
          "char_start": 32345,
          "char_end": 32366,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.132",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp41i0",
          "text": "Wherefore did you so?",
          "char_start": 32367,
          "char_end": 32388,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.133",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i0",
          "text": "Who can be wise, amazed, temperate and furious,",
          "char_start": 32389,
          "char_end": 32436,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.134",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i1",
          "text": "Loyal and neutral, in a moment? No man:",
          "char_start": 32437,
          "char_end": 32476,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.135",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i2",
          "text": "The expedition my violent love",
          "char_start": 32477,
          "char_end": 32507,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.136",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i3",
          "text": "Outrun the pauser, reason. Here lay Duncan,",
          "char_start": 32508,
          "char_end": 32551,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.137",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i4",
          "text": "His silver skin laced with his golden blood;",
          "char_start": 32552,
          "char_end": 32596,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.138",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i5",
          "text": "And his gash'd stabs look'd like a breach in nature",
          "char_start": 32597,
          "char_end": 32648,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.139",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i6",
          "text": "For ruin's wasteful entrance: there, the murderers,",
          "char_start": 32649,
          "char_end": 32700,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.140",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i7",
          "text": "Steep'd in the colours of their trade, their daggers",
          "char_start": 32701,
          "char_end": 32753,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.141",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i8",
          "text": "Unmannerly breech'd with gore: who could refrain,",
          "char_start": 32754,
          "char_end": 32803,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.142",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i9",
          "text": "That had a heart to love, and in that heart",
          "char_start": 32804,
          "char_end": 32847,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.143",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp42i10",
          "text": "Courage to make 's love kno wn?",
          "char_start": 32848,
          "char_end": 32879,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.144",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp43i0",
          "text": "Help me hence, ho!",
          "char_start": 32880,
          "char_end": 32898,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.145",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp44i0",
          "text": "Look to the lady.",
          "char_start": 32899,
          "char_end": 32916,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.146",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp45i0",
          "text": "[Aside to DONALBAIN] Why do we hold our tongues,",
          "char_start": 32917,
          "char_end": 32965,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.147",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp45i1",
          "text": "That most may claim this argument for ours?",
          "char_start": 32966,
          "char_end": 33009,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.148",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp46i0",
          "text": "[Aside to MALCOLM] What should be spoken here,",
          "char_start": 33010,
          "char_end": 33056,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.149",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp46i1",
          "text": "where our fate,",
          "char_start": 33057,
          "char_end": 33072,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.150",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp46i2",
          "text": "Hid in an auger-hole, may rush, and seize us?",
          "char_start": 33073,
          "char_end": 33118,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.151",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp46i3",
          "text": "Let 's away;",
          "char_start": 33119,
          "char_end": 33131,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.152",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp46i4",
          "text": "Our tears are not yet brew'd.",
          "char_start": 33132,
          "char_end": 33161,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.153",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp47i0",
          "text": "[Aside to DONALBAIN] Nor our strong sorrow",
          "char_start": 33162,
          "char_end": 33204,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.154",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp47i1",
          "text": "Upon the foot of motion.",
          "char_start": 33205,
          "char_end": 33229,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.155",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp48i0",
          "text": "Look to the lady:",
          "char_start": 33230,
          "char_end": 33247,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.156",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp48i1",
          "text": "LADY MACBETH is carried out",
          "char_start": 33248,
          "char_end": 33275,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp48i2",
          "text": "And when we have our naked frailties hid,",
          "char_start": 33276,
          "char_end": 33317,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.157",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp48i3",
          "text": "That suffer in exposure, let us meet,",
          "char_start": 33318,
          "char_end": 33355,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.158",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp48i4",
          "text": "And question this most bloody piece of work,",
          "char_start": 33356,
          "char_end": 33400,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.159",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp48i5",
          "text": "To know it further. Fears and scruples shake us:",
          "char_start": 33401,
          "char_end": 33449,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.160",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp48i6",
          "text": "In the great hand of God I stand; and thence",
          "char_start": 33450,
          "char_end": 33494,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.161",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp48i7",
          "text": "Against the undivulged pretence I fight",
          "char_start": 33495,
          "char_end": 33534,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.162",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp48i8",
          "text": "Of treasonous malice.",
          "char_start": 33535,
          "char_end": 33556,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.163",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp49i0",
          "text": "And so do I.",
          "char_start": 33557,
          "char_end": 33569,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.164",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp50i0",
          "text": "So all.",
          "char_start": 33570,
          "char_end": 33577,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.165",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp51i0",
          "text": "Let's briefly put on manly readiness,",
          "char_start": 33578,
          "char_end": 33615,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.166",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp51i1",
          "text": "And meet i' the hall together.",
          "char_start": 33616,
          "char_end": 33646,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.167",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp52i0",
          "text": "Well contented.",
          "char_start": 33647,
          "char_end": 33662,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.168",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp52i1",
          "text": "Exeunt all but Malcolm and Donalbain.",
          "char_start": 33663,
          "char_end": 33700,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp53i0",
          "text": "What will you do? Let's not consort with them:",
          "char_start": 33701,
          "char_end": 33747,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.169",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp53i1",
          "text": "To show an unfelt sorrow is an office",
          "char_start": 33748,
          "char_end": 33785,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.170",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp53i2",
          "text": "Which the false man does easy. I'll to England.",
          "char_start": 33786,
          "char_end": 33833,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.171",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp54i0",
          "text": "To Ireland, I; our separated fortune",
          "char_start": 33834,
          "char_end": 33870,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.172",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp54i1",
          "text": "Shall keep us both the safer: where we are,",
          "char_start": 33871,
          "char_end": 33914,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.173",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp54i2",
          "text": "There's daggers in men's smiles: the near in blood,",
          "char_start": 33915,
          "char_end": 33966,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.174",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp54i3",
          "text": "The nearer bloody.",
          "char_start": 33967,
          "char_end": 33985,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.175",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "DONALBAIN"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp55i0",
          "text": "This murderous shaft that's shot",
          "char_start": 33986,
          "char_end": 34018,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.176",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp55i1",
          "text": "Hath not yet lighted, and our safest way",
          "char_start": 34019,
          "char_end": 34059,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.177",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp55i2",
          "text": "Is to avoid the aim. Therefore, to horse;",
          "char_start": 34060,
          "char_end": 34101,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.178",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp55i3",
          "text": "And let us not be dainty of leave-taking,",
          "char_start": 34102,
          "char_end": 34143,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.179",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp55i4",
          "text": "But shift away: there's warrant in that theft",
          "char_start": 34144,
          "char_end": 34189,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.180",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp55i5",
          "text": "Which steals itself, when there's no mercy left.",
          "char_start": 34190,
          "char_end": 34238,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "2.3.181",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s3:sp55i6",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 34239,
          "char_end": 34245,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:open",
          "text": "Enter ROSS and an old Man",
          "char_start": 34246,
          "char_end": 34271,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp1i0",
          "text": "Threescore and ten I can remember well:",
          "char_start": 34272,
          "char_end": 34311,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp1i1",
          "text": "Within the volume of which time I have seen",
          "char_start": 34312,
          "char_end": 34355,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp1i2",
          "text": "Hours dreadful and things strange; but this sore night",
          "char_start": 34356,
          "char_end": 34410,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp1i3",
          "text": "Hath trifled former knowings.",
          "char_start": 34411,
          "char_end": 34440,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp2i0",
          "text": "Ah, good father,",
          "char_start": 34441,
          "char_end": 34457,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp2i1",
          "text": "Thou seest, the heavens, as troubled with man's act,",
          "char_start": 34458,
          "char_end": 34510,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp2i2",
          "text": "Threaten his bloody stage: by the clock, 'tis day,",
          "char_start": 34511,
          "char_end": 34561,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp2i3",
          "text": "And yet dark night strangles the travelling lamp:",
          "char_start": 34562,
          "char_end": 34611,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp2i4",
          "text": "Is't night's predominance, or the day's shame,",
          "char_start": 34612,
          "char_end": 34658,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp2i5",
          "text": "That darkness does the face of earth entomb,",
          "char_start": 34659,
          "char_end": 34703,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp2i6",
          "text": "When living light should kiss it?",
          "char_start": 34704,
          "char_end": 34737,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp3i0",
          "text": "'Tis unnatural,",
          "char_start": 34738,
          "char_end": 34753,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp3i1",
          "text": "Even like the deed that's done. On Tuesday last,",
          "char_start": 34754,
          "char_end": 34802,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp3i2",
          "text": "A falcon, towering in her pride of place,",
          "char_start": 34803,
          "char_end": 34844,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp3i3",
          "text": "Was by a mousing owl hawk'd at and kill'd.",
          "char_start": 34845,
          "char_end": 34887,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp4i0",
          "text": "And Duncan's horses--a thing most strange and certain--",
          "char_start": 34888,
          "char_end": 34943,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp4i1",
          "text": "Beauteous and swift, the minions of their race,",
          "char_start": 34944,
          "char_end": 34991,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp4i2",
          "text": "Turn'd wild in nature, broke their stalls, flung out,",
          "char_start": 34992,
          "char_end": 35045,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp4i3",
          "text": "Contending 'gainst obedience, as they would make",
          "char_start": 35046,
          "char_end": 35094,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp4i4",
          "text": "War with mankind.",
          "char_start": 35095,
          "char_end": 35112,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp5i0",
          "text": "'Tis said they eat each other.",
          "char_start": 35113,
          "char_end": 35143,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp6i0",
          "text": "They did so, to the amazement of mine eyes",
          "char_start": 35144,
          "char_end": 35186,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp6i1",
          "text": "That look'd upon't. Here comes the good Macduff.",
          "char_start": 35187,
          "char_end": 35235,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp6i2",
          "text": "Enter MACDUFF",
          "char_start": 35236,
          "char_end": 35249,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp6i3",
          "text": "How goes the world, sir, now?",
          "char_start": 35250,
          "char_end": 35279,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp7i0",
          "text": "Why, see you not?",
          "char_start": 35280,
          "char_end": 35297,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp8i0",
          "text": "Is't known who did this more than bloody deed?",
          "char_start": 35298,
          "char_end": 35344,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp9i0",
          "text": "Those that Macbeth hath slain.",
          "char_start": 35345,
          "char_end": 35375,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp10i0",
          "text": "Alas, the day!",
          "char_start": 35376,
          "char_end": 35390,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp10i1",
          "text": "What good could they pretend?",
          "char_start": 35391,
          "char_end": 35420,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp11i0",
          "text": "They were suborn'd:",
          "char_start": 35421,
          "char_end": 35440,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp11i1",
          "text": "Malcolm and Donalbain, the king's two sons,",
          "char_start": 35441,
          "char_end": 35484,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp11i2",
          "text": "Are stol'n away and fled; which puts upon them",
          "char_start": 35485,
          "char_end": 35531,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp11i3",
          "text": "Suspicion of the deed.",
          "char_start": 35532,
          "char_end": 35554,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp12i0",
          "text": "'Gainst nature still!",
          "char_start": 35555,
          "char_end": 35576,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp12i1",
          "text": "Thriftless ambition, that wilt ravin up",
          "char_start": 35577,
          "char_end": 35616,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp12i2",
          "text": "Thine own life's means! Then 'tis most like",
          "char_start": 35617,
          "char_end": 35660,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp12i3",
          "text": "The sovereignty will fall upon Macbeth.",
          "char_start": 35661,
          "char_end": 35700,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp13i0",
          "text": "He is already named, and gone to Scone",
          "char_start": 35701,
          "char_end": 35739,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp13i1",
          "text": "To be invested.",
          "char_start": 35740,
          "char_end": 35755,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp14i0",
          "text": "Where is Duncan's body?",
          "char_start": 35756,
          "char_end": 35779,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp15i0",
          "text": "Carried to Colmekill,",
          "char_start": 35780,
          "char_end": 35801,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp15i1",
          "text": "The sacred storehouse of his predecessors,",
          "char_start": 35802,
          "char_end": 35844,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp15i2",
          "text": "And guardian of their bones.",
          "char_start": 35845,
          "char_end": 35873,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp16i0",
          "text": "Will you to Scone?",
          "char_start": 35874,
          "char_end": 35892,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp17i0",
          "text": "No, cousin, I'll to Fife.",
          "char_start": 35893,
          "char_end": 35918,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp18i0",
          "text": "Well, I will thither.",
          "char_start": 35919,
          "char_end": 35940,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp19i0",
          "text": "Well, may you see things well done there: adieu!",
          "char_start": 35941,
          "char_end": 35989,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp19i1",
          "text": "Lest our old robes sit easier than our new!",
          "char_start": 35990,
          "char_end": 36033,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp20i0",
          "text": "Farewell, father.",
          "char_start": 36034,
          "char_end": 36051,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp21i0",
          "text": "God's benison go with you; and with those",
          "char_start": 36052,
          "char_end": 36093,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp21i1",
          "text": "That would make good of bad, and friends of foes!",
          "char_start": 36094,
          "char_end": 36143,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "2.4.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a2s4:sp21i2",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 36144,
          "char_end": 36150,
          "act": 2,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Old Man"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:open",
          "text": "Enter BANQUO",
          "char_start": 36151,
          "char_end": 36163,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i0",
          "text": "Thou hast it now: king, Cawdor, Glamis, all,",
          "char_start": 36164,
          "char_end": 36208,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i1",
          "text": "As the weird women promised, and, I fear,",
          "char_start": 36209,
          "char_end": 36250,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i2",
          "text": "Thou play'dst most foully for't: yet it was said",
          "char_start": 36251,
          "char_end": 36299,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i3",
          "text": "It should not stand in thy posterity,",
          "char_start": 36300,
          "char_end": 36337,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i4",
          "text": "But that myself should be the root and father",
          "char_start": 36338,
          "char_end": 36383,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i5",
          "text": "Of many kings. If there come truth from them--",
          "char_start": 36384,
          "char_end": 36430,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i6",
          "text": "As upon thee, Macbeth, their speeches shine--",
          "char_start": 36431,
          "char_end": 36476,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i7",
          "text": "Why, by the verities on thee made good,",
          "char_start": 36477,
          "char_end": 36516,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i8",
          "text": "May they not be my oracles as well,",
          "char_start": 36517,
          "char_end": 36552,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i9",
          "text": "And set me up in hope? But hush! no more.",
          "char_start": 36553,
          "char_end": 36594,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp1i10",
          "text": "Sennet sounded. Enter MACBETH, as king, LADY MACBETH, as queen, LENNOX, ROSS, Lords, Ladies, and Attendants",
          "char_start": 36595,
          "char_end": 36702,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp2i0",
          "text": "Here's our chief guest.",
          "char_start": 36703,
          "char_end": 36726,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp3i0",
          "text": "If he had been forgotten,",
          "char_start": 36727,
          "char_end": 36752,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp3i1",
          "text": "It had been as a gap in our great feast,",
          "char_start": 36753,
          "char_end": 36793,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp3i2",
          "text": "And all-thing unbecoming.",
          "char_start": 36794,
          "char_end": 36819,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp4i0",
          "text": "To-night we hold a solemn supper sir,",
          "char_start": 36820,
          "char_end": 36857,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp4i1",
          "text": "And I'll request your presence.",
          "char_start": 36858,
          "char_end": 36889,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp5i0",
          "text": "Let your highness",
          "char_start": 36890,
          "char_end": 36907,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp5i1",
          "text": "Command upon me; to the which my duties",
          "char_start": 36908,
          "char_end": 36947,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp5i2",
          "text": "Are with a most indissoluble tie",
          "char_start": 36948,
          "char_end": 36980,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp5i3",
          "text": "For ever knit.",
          "char_start": 36981,
          "char_end": 36995,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp6i0",
          "text": "Ride you this afternoon?",
          "char_start": 36996,
          "char_end": 37020,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp7i0",
          "text": "Ay, my good lord.",
          "char_start": 37021,
          "char_end": 37038,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp8i0",
          "text": "We should have else desired your good advice,",
          "char_start": 37039,
          "char_end": 37084,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp8i1",
          "text": "Which still hath been both grave and prosperous,",
          "char_start": 37085,
          "char_end": 37133,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp8i2",
          "text": "In this day's council; but we'll take to-morrow.",
          "char_start": 37134,
          "char_end": 37182,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp8i3",
          "text": "Is't far you ride?",
          "char_start": 37183,
          "char_end": 37201,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp9i0",
          "text": "As far, my lord, as will fill up the time",
          "char_start": 37202,
          "char_end": 37243,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp9i1",
          "text": "'Twixt this and supper: go not my horse the better,",
          "char_start": 37244,
          "char_end": 37295,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp9i2",
          "text": "I must become a borrower of the night",
          "char_start": 37296,
          "char_end": 37333,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp9i3",
          "text": "For a dark hour or twain.",
          "char_start": 37334,
          "char_end": 37359,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp10i0",
          "text": "Fail not our feast.",
          "char_start": 37360,
          "char_end": 37379,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp11i0",
          "text": "My lord, I will not.",
          "char_start": 37380,
          "char_end": 37400,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp12i0",
          "text": "We hear, our bloody cousins are bestow'd",
          "char_start": 37401,
          "char_end": 37441,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp12i1",
          "text": "In England and in Ireland, not confessing",
          "char_start": 37442,
          "char_end": 37483,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp12i2",
          "text": "Their cruel parricide, filling their hearers",
          "char_start": 37484,
          "char_end": 37528,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp12i3",
          "text": "With strange invention: but of that to-morrow,",
          "char_start": 37529,
          "char_end": 37575,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp12i4",
          "text": "When therewithal we shall have cause of state",
          "char_start": 37576,
          "char_end": 37621,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp12i5",
          "text": "Craving us jointly. Hie you to horse: adieu,",
          "char_start": 37622,
          "char_end": 37666,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp12i6",
          "text": "Till you return at night. Goes Fleance with you?",
          "char_start": 37667,
          "char_end": 37715,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp13i0",
          "text": "Ay, my good lord: our time does call upon 's.",
          "char_start": 37716,
          "char_end": 37761,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i0",
          "text": "I wish your horses swift and sure of foot;",
          "char_start": 37762,
          "char_end": 37804,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i1",
          "text": "And so I do commend you to their backs. Farewell.",
          "char_start": 37805,
          "char_end": 37854,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i2",
          "text": "Exit BANQUO",
          "char_start": 37855,
          "char_end": 37866,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i3",
          "text": "Let every man be master of his time",
          "char_start": 37867,
          "char_end": 37902,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i4",
          "text": "Till seven at night: to make society",
          "char_start": 37903,
          "char_end": 37939,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i5",
          "text": "The sweeter welcome, we will keep ourself",
          "char_start": 37940,
          "char_end": 37981,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i6",
          "text": "Till supper-time alone: while then, God be with you!",
          "char_start": 37982,
          "char_end": 38034,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i7",
          "text": "Exeunt all but MACBETH, and an attendant",
          "char_start": 38035,
          "char_end": 38075,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i8",
          "text": "Sirrah, a word with you: attend those men",
          "char_start": 38076,
          "char_end": 38117,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp14i9",
          "text": "Our pleasure?",
          "char_start": 38118,
          "char_end": 38131,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp15i0",
          "text": "They are, my lord, without the palace gate.",
          "char_start": 38132,
          "char_end": 38175,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ATTENDANT"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i0",
          "text": "Bring them before us.",
          "char_start": 38176,
          "char_end": 38197,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i1",
          "text": "Exit Attendant",
          "char_start": 38198,
          "char_end": 38212,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i2",
          "text": "To be thus is nothing;",
          "char_start": 38213,
          "char_end": 38235,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i3",
          "text": "But to be safely thus.--Our fears in Banquo",
          "char_start": 38236,
          "char_end": 38279,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i4",
          "text": "Stick deep; and in his royalty of nature",
          "char_start": 38280,
          "char_end": 38320,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i5",
          "text": "Reigns that which would be fear'd: 'tis much he dares;",
          "char_start": 38321,
          "char_end": 38375,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i6",
          "text": "And, to that dauntless temper of his mind,",
          "char_start": 38376,
          "char_end": 38418,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i7",
          "text": "He hath a wisdom that doth guide his valour",
          "char_start": 38419,
          "char_end": 38462,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i8",
          "text": "To act in safety. There is none but he",
          "char_start": 38463,
          "char_end": 38501,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i9",
          "text": "Whose being I do fear: and, under him,",
          "char_start": 38502,
          "char_end": 38540,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i10",
          "text": "My Genius is rebuked; as, it is said,",
          "char_start": 38541,
          "char_end": 38578,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i11",
          "text": "Mark Antony's was by Caesar. He chid the sisters",
          "char_start": 38579,
          "char_end": 38627,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i12",
          "text": "When first they put the name of king upon me,",
          "char_start": 38628,
          "char_end": 38673,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i13",
          "text": "And bade them speak to him: then prophet-like",
          "char_start": 38674,
          "char_end": 38719,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i14",
          "text": "They hail'd him father to a line of kings:",
          "char_start": 38720,
          "char_end": 38762,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i15",
          "text": "Upon my head they placed a fruitless crown,",
          "char_start": 38763,
          "char_end": 38806,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i16",
          "text": "And put a barren sceptre in my gripe,",
          "char_start": 38807,
          "char_end": 38844,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i17",
          "text": "Thence to be wrench'd with an unlineal hand,",
          "char_start": 38845,
          "char_end": 38889,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i18",
          "text": "No son of mine succeeding. If 't be so,",
          "char_start": 38890,
          "char_end": 38929,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i19",
          "text": "For Banquo's issue have I filed my mind;",
          "char_start": 38930,
          "char_end": 38970,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i20",
          "text": "For them the gracious Duncan have I murder'd;",
          "char_start": 38971,
          "char_end": 39016,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i21",
          "text": "Put rancours in the vessel of my peace",
          "char_start": 39017,
          "char_end": 39055,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i22",
          "text": "Only for them; and mine eternal jewel",
          "char_start": 39056,
          "char_end": 39093,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i23",
          "text": "Given to the common enemy of man,",
          "char_start": 39094,
          "char_end": 39127,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i24",
          "text": "To make them kings, the seed of Banquo kings!",
          "char_start": 39128,
          "char_end": 39173,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i25",
          "text": "Rather than so, come fate into the list.",
          "char_start": 39174,
          "char_end": 39214,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i26",
          "text": "And champion me to the utterance! Who's there!",
          "char_start": 39215,
          "char_end": 39261,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i27",
          "text": "Re-enter Attendant, with two Murderers",
          "char_start": 39262,
          "char_end": 39300,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i28",
          "text": "Now go to the door, and stay there till we call.",
          "char_start": 39301,
          "char_end": 39349,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i29",
          "text": "Exit Attendant",
          "char_start": 39350,
          "char_end": 39364,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp16i30",
          "text": "Was it not yesterday we spoke together?",
          "char_start": 39365,
          "char_end": 39404,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp17i0",
          "text": "It was, so please your highness.",
          "char_start": 39405,
          "char_end": 39437,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i0",
          "text": "Well then, now",
          "char_start": 39438,
          "char_end": 39452,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i1",
          "text": "Have you consider'd of my speeches? Know",
          "char_start": 39453,
          "char_end": 39493,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i2",
          "text": "That it was he in the times past which held you",
          "char_start": 39494,
          "char_end": 39541,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i3",
          "text": "So under fortune, which you thought had been",
          "char_start": 39542,
          "char_end": 39586,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i4",
          "text": "Our innocent self: this I made good to you",
          "char_start": 39587,
          "char_end": 39629,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i5",
          "text": "In our last conference, pass'd in probation with you,",
          "char_start": 39630,
          "char_end": 39683,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i6",
          "text": "How you were borne in hand, how cross'd,",
          "char_start": 39684,
          "char_end": 39724,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i7",
          "text": "the instruments,",
          "char_start": 39725,
          "char_end": 39741,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i8",
          "text": "Who wrought with them, and all things else that might",
          "char_start": 39742,
          "char_end": 39795,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.87",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i9",
          "text": "To half a soul and to a notion crazed",
          "char_start": 39796,
          "char_end": 39833,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.88",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp18i10",
          "text": "Say 'Thus did Banquo.'",
          "char_start": 39834,
          "char_end": 39856,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.89",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp19i0",
          "text": "You made it known to us.",
          "char_start": 39857,
          "char_end": 39881,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.90",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp20i0",
          "text": "I did so, and went further, which is now",
          "char_start": 39882,
          "char_end": 39922,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.91",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp20i1",
          "text": "Our point of second meeting. Do you find",
          "char_start": 39923,
          "char_end": 39963,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.92",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp20i2",
          "text": "Your patience so predominant in your nature",
          "char_start": 39964,
          "char_end": 40007,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.93",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp20i3",
          "text": "That you can let this go? Are you so gospell'd",
          "char_start": 40008,
          "char_end": 40054,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.94",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp20i4",
          "text": "To pray for this good man and for his issue,",
          "char_start": 40055,
          "char_end": 40099,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.95",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp20i5",
          "text": "Whose heavy hand hath bow'd you to the grave",
          "char_start": 40100,
          "char_end": 40144,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.96",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp20i6",
          "text": "And beggar'd yours for ever?",
          "char_start": 40145,
          "char_end": 40173,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.97",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp21i0",
          "text": "We are men, my liege.",
          "char_start": 40174,
          "char_end": 40195,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.98",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i0",
          "text": "Ay, in the catalogue ye go for men;",
          "char_start": 40196,
          "char_end": 40231,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.99",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i1",
          "text": "As hounds and greyhounds, mongrels, spaniels, curs,",
          "char_start": 40232,
          "char_end": 40283,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.100",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i2",
          "text": "Shoughs, water-rugs and demi-wolves, are clept",
          "char_start": 40284,
          "char_end": 40330,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.101",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i3",
          "text": "All by the name of dogs: the valued file",
          "char_start": 40331,
          "char_end": 40371,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.102",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i4",
          "text": "Distinguishes the swift, the slow, the subtle,",
          "char_start": 40372,
          "char_end": 40418,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.103",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i5",
          "text": "The housekeeper, the hunter, every one",
          "char_start": 40419,
          "char_end": 40457,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.104",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i6",
          "text": "According to the gift which bounteous nature",
          "char_start": 40458,
          "char_end": 40502,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.105",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i7",
          "text": "Hath in him closed; whereby he does receive",
          "char_start": 40503,
          "char_end": 40546,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.106",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i8",
          "text": "Particular addition. from the bill",
          "char_start": 40547,
          "char_end": 40581,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.107",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i9",
          "text": "That writes them all alike: and so of men.",
          "char_start": 40582,
          "char_end": 40624,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.108",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i10",
          "text": "Now, if you have a station in the file,",
          "char_start": 40625,
          "char_end": 40664,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.109",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i11",
          "text": "Not i' the worst rank of manhood, say 't;",
          "char_start": 40665,
          "char_end": 40706,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.110",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i12",
          "text": "And I will put that business in your bosoms,",
          "char_start": 40707,
          "char_end": 40751,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.111",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i13",
          "text": "Whose execution takes your enemy off,",
          "char_start": 40752,
          "char_end": 40789,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.112",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i14",
          "text": "Grapples you to the heart and love of us,",
          "char_start": 40790,
          "char_end": 40831,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.113",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i15",
          "text": "Who wear our health but sickly in his life,",
          "char_start": 40832,
          "char_end": 40875,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.114",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp22i16",
          "text": "Which in his death were perfect.",
          "char_start": 40876,
          "char_end": 40908,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.115",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp23i0",
          "text": "I am one, my liege,",
          "char_start": 40909,
          "char_end": 40928,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.116",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp23i1",
          "text": "Whom the vile blows and buffets of the world",
          "char_start": 40929,
          "char_end": 40973,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.117",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp23i2",
          "text": "Have so incensed that I am reckless what",
          "char_start": 40974,
          "char_end": 41014,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.118",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp23i3",
          "text": "I do to spite the world.",
          "char_start": 41015,
          "char_end": 41039,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.119",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp24i0",
          "text": "And I another",
          "char_start": 41040,
          "char_end": 41053,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.120",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp24i1",
          "text": "So weary with disasters, tugg'd with fortune,",
          "char_start": 41054,
          "char_end": 41099,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.121",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp24i2",
          "text": "That I would set my lie on any chance,",
          "char_start": 41100,
          "char_end": 41138,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.122",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp24i3",
          "text": "To mend it, or be rid on't.",
          "char_start": 41139,
          "char_end": 41166,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.123",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp25i0",
          "text": "Both of you",
          "char_start": 41167,
          "char_end": 41178,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.124",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp25i1",
          "text": "Know Banquo was your enemy.",
          "char_start": 41179,
          "char_end": 41206,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.125",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp26i0",
          "text": "True, my lord.",
          "char_start": 41207,
          "char_end": 41221,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.126",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Both Murderers"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i0",
          "text": "So is he mine; and in such bloody distance,",
          "char_start": 41222,
          "char_end": 41265,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.127",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i1",
          "text": "That every minute of his being thrusts",
          "char_start": 41266,
          "char_end": 41304,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.128",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i2",
          "text": "Against my near'st of life: and though I could",
          "char_start": 41305,
          "char_end": 41351,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.129",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i3",
          "text": "With barefaced power sweep him from my sight",
          "char_start": 41352,
          "char_end": 41396,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.130",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i4",
          "text": "And bid my will avouch it, yet I must not,",
          "char_start": 41397,
          "char_end": 41439,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.131",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i5",
          "text": "For certain friends that are both his and mine,",
          "char_start": 41440,
          "char_end": 41487,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.132",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i6",
          "text": "Whose loves I may not drop, but wail his fall",
          "char_start": 41488,
          "char_end": 41533,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.133",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i7",
          "text": "Who I myself struck down; and thence it is,",
          "char_start": 41534,
          "char_end": 41577,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.134",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i8",
          "text": "That I to your assistance do make love,",
          "char_start": 41578,
          "char_end": 41617,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.135",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i9",
          "text": "Masking the business from the common eye",
          "char_start": 41618,
          "char_end": 41658,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.136",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp27i10",
          "text": "For sundry weighty reasons.",
          "char_start": 41659,
          "char_end": 41686,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.137",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp28i0",
          "text": "We shall, my lord,",
          "char_start": 41687,
          "char_end": 41705,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.138",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp28i1",
          "text": "Perform what you command us.",
          "char_start": 41706,
          "char_end": 41734,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.139",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp29i0",
          "text": "Though our lives--",
          "char_start": 41735,
          "char_end": 41753,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.140",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i0",
          "text": "Your spirits shine through you. Within this hour at most",
          "char_start": 41754,
          "char_end": 41810,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.141",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i1",
          "text": "I will advise you where to plant yourselves;",
          "char_start": 41811,
          "char_end": 41855,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.142",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i2",
          "text": "Acquaint you with the perfect spy o' the time,",
          "char_start": 41856,
          "char_end": 41902,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.143",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i3",
          "text": "The moment on't; for't must be done to-night,",
          "char_start": 41903,
          "char_end": 41948,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.144",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i4",
          "text": "And something from the palace; always thought",
          "char_start": 41949,
          "char_end": 41994,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.145",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i5",
          "text": "That I require a clearness: and with him--",
          "char_start": 41995,
          "char_end": 42037,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.146",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i6",
          "text": "To leave no rubs nor botches in the work--",
          "char_start": 42038,
          "char_end": 42080,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.147",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i7",
          "text": "Fleance his son, that keeps him company,",
          "char_start": 42081,
          "char_end": 42121,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.148",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i8",
          "text": "Whose absence is no less material to me",
          "char_start": 42122,
          "char_end": 42161,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.149",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i9",
          "text": "Than is his father's, must embrace the fate",
          "char_start": 42162,
          "char_end": 42205,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.150",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i10",
          "text": "Of that dark hour. Resolve yourselves apart:",
          "char_start": 42206,
          "char_end": 42250,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.151",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp30i11",
          "text": "I'll come to you anon.",
          "char_start": 42251,
          "char_end": 42273,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.152",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp31i0",
          "text": "We are resolved, my lord.",
          "char_start": 42274,
          "char_end": 42299,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.153",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Both Murderers"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp32i0",
          "text": "I'll call upon you straight: abide within.",
          "char_start": 42300,
          "char_end": 42342,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.154",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp32i1",
          "text": "Exeunt Murderers",
          "char_start": 42343,
          "char_end": 42359,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp32i2",
          "text": "It is concluded. Banquo, thy soul's flight,",
          "char_start": 42360,
          "char_end": 42403,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.155",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp32i3",
          "text": "If it find heaven, must find it out to-night.",
          "char_start": 42404,
          "char_end": 42449,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "3.1.156",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s1:sp32i4",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 42450,
          "char_end": 42454,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:open",
          "text": "Enter LADY MACBETH and a Servant",
          "char_start": 42455,
          "char_end": 42487,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp1i0",
          "text": "Is Banquo gone from court?",
          "char_start": 42488,
          "char_end": 42514,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp2i0",
          "text": "Ay, madam, but returns again to-night.",
          "char_start": 42515,
          "char_end": 42553,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Servant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp3i0",
          "text": "Say to the king, I would attend his leisure",
          "char_start": 42554,
          "char_end": 42597,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp3i1",
          "text": "For a few words.",
          "char_start": 42598,
          "char_end": 42614,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp4i0",
          "text": "Madam, I will.",
          "char_start": 42615,
          "char_end": 42629,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Servant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp4i1",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 42630,
          "char_end": 42634,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Servant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i0",
          "text": "Nought's had, all's spent,",
          "char_start": 42635,
          "char_end": 42661,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i1",
          "text": "Where our desire is got without content:",
          "char_start": 42662,
          "char_end": 42702,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i2",
          "text": "'Tis safer to be that which we destroy",
          "char_start": 42703,
          "char_end": 42741,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i3",
          "text": "Than by destruction dwell in doubtful joy.",
          "char_start": 42742,
          "char_end": 42784,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i4",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH",
          "char_start": 42785,
          "char_end": 42798,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i5",
          "text": "How now, my lord! why do you keep alone,",
          "char_start": 42799,
          "char_end": 42839,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i6",
          "text": "Of sorriest fancies your companions making,",
          "char_start": 42840,
          "char_end": 42883,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i7",
          "text": "Using those thoughts which should indeed have died",
          "char_start": 42884,
          "char_end": 42934,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i8",
          "text": "With them they think on? Things without all remedy",
          "char_start": 42935,
          "char_end": 42985,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp5i9",
          "text": "Should be without regard: what's done is done.",
          "char_start": 42986,
          "char_end": 43032,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i0",
          "text": "We have scotch'd the snake, not kill'd it:",
          "char_start": 43033,
          "char_end": 43075,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i1",
          "text": "She'll close and be herself, whilst our poor malice",
          "char_start": 43076,
          "char_end": 43127,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i2",
          "text": "Remains in danger of her former tooth.",
          "char_start": 43128,
          "char_end": 43166,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i3",
          "text": "But let the frame of things disjoint, both the",
          "char_start": 43167,
          "char_end": 43213,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i4",
          "text": "worlds suffer,",
          "char_start": 43214,
          "char_end": 43228,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i5",
          "text": "Ere we will eat our meal in fear and sleep",
          "char_start": 43229,
          "char_end": 43271,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i6",
          "text": "In the affliction of these terrible dreams",
          "char_start": 43272,
          "char_end": 43314,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i7",
          "text": "That shake us nightly: better be with the dead,",
          "char_start": 43315,
          "char_end": 43362,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i8",
          "text": "Whom we, to gain our peace, have sent to peace,",
          "char_start": 43363,
          "char_end": 43410,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i9",
          "text": "Than on the torture of the mind to lie",
          "char_start": 43411,
          "char_end": 43449,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i10",
          "text": "In restless ecstasy. Duncan is in his grave;",
          "char_start": 43450,
          "char_end": 43494,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i11",
          "text": "After life's fitful fever he sleeps well;",
          "char_start": 43495,
          "char_end": 43536,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i12",
          "text": "Treason has done his worst: nor steel, nor poison,",
          "char_start": 43537,
          "char_end": 43587,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i13",
          "text": "Malice domestic, foreign levy, nothing,",
          "char_start": 43588,
          "char_end": 43627,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp6i14",
          "text": "Can touch him further.",
          "char_start": 43628,
          "char_end": 43650,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp7i0",
          "text": "Come on;",
          "char_start": 43651,
          "char_end": 43659,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp7i1",
          "text": "Gentle my lord, sleek o'er your rugged looks;",
          "char_start": 43660,
          "char_end": 43705,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp7i2",
          "text": "Be bright and jovial among your guests to-night.",
          "char_start": 43706,
          "char_end": 43754,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp8i0",
          "text": "So shall I, love; and so, I pray, be you:",
          "char_start": 43755,
          "char_end": 43796,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp8i1",
          "text": "Let your remembrance apply to Banquo;",
          "char_start": 43797,
          "char_end": 43834,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp8i2",
          "text": "Present him eminence, both with eye and tongue:",
          "char_start": 43835,
          "char_end": 43882,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp8i3",
          "text": "Unsafe the while, that we",
          "char_start": 43883,
          "char_end": 43908,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp8i4",
          "text": "Must lave our honours in these flattering streams,",
          "char_start": 43909,
          "char_end": 43959,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp8i5",
          "text": "And make our faces vizards to our hearts,",
          "char_start": 43960,
          "char_end": 44001,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp8i6",
          "text": "Disguising what they are.",
          "char_start": 44002,
          "char_end": 44027,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp9i0",
          "text": "You must leave this.",
          "char_start": 44028,
          "char_end": 44048,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp10i0",
          "text": "O, full of scorpions is my mind, dear wife!",
          "char_start": 44049,
          "char_end": 44092,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp10i1",
          "text": "Thou know'st that Banquo, and his Fleance, lives.",
          "char_start": 44093,
          "char_end": 44142,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp11i0",
          "text": "But in them nature's copy's not eterne.",
          "char_start": 44143,
          "char_end": 44182,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp12i0",
          "text": "There's comfort yet; they are assailable;",
          "char_start": 44183,
          "char_end": 44224,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp12i1",
          "text": "Then be thou jocund: ere the bat hath flown",
          "char_start": 44225,
          "char_end": 44268,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp12i2",
          "text": "His cloister'd flight, ere to black Hecate's summons",
          "char_start": 44269,
          "char_end": 44321,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp12i3",
          "text": "The shard-borne beetle with his drowsy hums",
          "char_start": 44322,
          "char_end": 44365,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp12i4",
          "text": "Hath rung night's yawning peal, there shall be done",
          "char_start": 44366,
          "char_end": 44417,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp12i5",
          "text": "A deed of dreadful note.",
          "char_start": 44418,
          "char_end": 44442,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp13i0",
          "text": "What's to be done?",
          "char_start": 44443,
          "char_end": 44461,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i0",
          "text": "Be innocent of the knowledge, dearest chuck,",
          "char_start": 44462,
          "char_end": 44506,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i1",
          "text": "Till thou applaud the deed. Come, seeling night,",
          "char_start": 44507,
          "char_end": 44555,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i2",
          "text": "Scarf up the tender eye of pitiful day;",
          "char_start": 44556,
          "char_end": 44595,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i3",
          "text": "And with thy bloody and invisible hand",
          "char_start": 44596,
          "char_end": 44634,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i4",
          "text": "Cancel and tear to pieces that great bond",
          "char_start": 44635,
          "char_end": 44676,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i5",
          "text": "Which keeps me pale! Light thickens; and the crow",
          "char_start": 44677,
          "char_end": 44726,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i6",
          "text": "Makes wing to the rooky wood:",
          "char_start": 44727,
          "char_end": 44756,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i7",
          "text": "Good things of day begin to droop and drowse;",
          "char_start": 44757,
          "char_end": 44802,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i8",
          "text": "While night's black agents to their preys do rouse.",
          "char_start": 44803,
          "char_end": 44854,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i9",
          "text": "Thou marvell'st at my words: but hold thee still;",
          "char_start": 44855,
          "char_end": 44904,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i10",
          "text": "Things bad begun make strong themselves by ill.",
          "char_start": 44905,
          "char_end": 44952,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i11",
          "text": "So, prithee, go with me.",
          "char_start": 44953,
          "char_end": 44977,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "3.2.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s2:sp14i12",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 44978,
          "char_end": 44984,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:open",
          "text": "Enter three Murderers",
          "char_start": 44985,
          "char_end": 45006,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp1i0",
          "text": "But who did bid thee join with us?",
          "char_start": 45007,
          "char_end": 45041,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp2i0",
          "text": "Macbeth.",
          "char_start": 45042,
          "char_end": 45050,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp3i0",
          "text": "He needs not our mistrust, since he delivers",
          "char_start": 45051,
          "char_end": 45095,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp3i1",
          "text": "Our offices and what we have to do",
          "char_start": 45096,
          "char_end": 45130,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp3i2",
          "text": "To the direction just.",
          "char_start": 45131,
          "char_end": 45153,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp4i0",
          "text": "Then stand with us.",
          "char_start": 45154,
          "char_end": 45173,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp4i1",
          "text": "The west yet glimmers with some streaks of day:",
          "char_start": 45174,
          "char_end": 45221,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp4i2",
          "text": "Now spurs the lated traveller apace",
          "char_start": 45222,
          "char_end": 45257,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp4i3",
          "text": "To gain the timely inn; and near approaches",
          "char_start": 45258,
          "char_end": 45301,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp4i4",
          "text": "The subject of our watch.",
          "char_start": 45302,
          "char_end": 45327,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp5i0",
          "text": "Hark! I hear horses.",
          "char_start": 45328,
          "char_end": 45348,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp6i0",
          "text": "[Within] Give us a light there, ho!",
          "char_start": 45349,
          "char_end": 45384,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp7i0",
          "text": "Then 'tis he: the rest",
          "char_start": 45385,
          "char_end": 45407,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp7i1",
          "text": "That are within the note of expectation",
          "char_start": 45408,
          "char_end": 45447,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp7i2",
          "text": "Already are i' the court.",
          "char_start": 45448,
          "char_end": 45473,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp8i0",
          "text": "His horses go about.",
          "char_start": 45474,
          "char_end": 45494,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp9i0",
          "text": "Almost a mile: but he does usually,",
          "char_start": 45495,
          "char_end": 45530,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp9i1",
          "text": "So all men do, from hence to the palace gate",
          "char_start": 45531,
          "char_end": 45575,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp9i2",
          "text": "Make it their walk.",
          "char_start": 45576,
          "char_end": 45595,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp10i0",
          "text": "A light, a light!",
          "char_start": 45596,
          "char_end": 45613,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp10i1",
          "text": "Enter BANQUO, and FLEANCE with a torch",
          "char_start": 45614,
          "char_end": 45652,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp11i0",
          "text": "'Tis he.",
          "char_start": 45653,
          "char_end": 45661,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp12i0",
          "text": "Stand to't.",
          "char_start": 45662,
          "char_end": 45673,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp13i0",
          "text": "It will be rain to-night.",
          "char_start": 45674,
          "char_end": 45699,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp14i0",
          "text": "Let it come down.",
          "char_start": 45700,
          "char_end": 45717,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp14i1",
          "text": "They set upon BANQUO",
          "char_start": 45718,
          "char_end": 45738,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp15i0",
          "text": "O, treachery! Fly, good Fleance, fly, fly, fly!",
          "char_start": 45739,
          "char_end": 45786,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp15i1",
          "text": "Thou mayst revenge. O slave!",
          "char_start": 45787,
          "char_end": 45815,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp15i2",
          "text": "Dies. FLEANCE escapes",
          "char_start": 45816,
          "char_end": 45837,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "BANQUO"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp16i0",
          "text": "Who did strike out the light?",
          "char_start": 45838,
          "char_end": 45867,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp17i0",
          "text": "Wast not the way?",
          "char_start": 45868,
          "char_end": 45885,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp18i0",
          "text": "There's but one down; the son is fled.",
          "char_start": 45886,
          "char_end": 45924,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp19i0",
          "text": "We have lost",
          "char_start": 45925,
          "char_end": 45937,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp19i1",
          "text": "Best half of our affair.",
          "char_start": 45938,
          "char_end": 45962,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp20i0",
          "text": "Well, let's away, and say how much is done.",
          "char_start": 45963,
          "char_end": 46006,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "3.3.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s3:sp20i1",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 46007,
          "char_end": 46013,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:open",
          "text": "A banquet prepared. Enter MACBETH, LADY MACBETH, ROSS, LENNOX, Lords, and Attendants",
          "char_start": 46014,
          "char_end": 46098,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp1i0",
          "text": "You know your own degrees; sit down: at first",
          "char_start": 46099,
          "char_end": 46144,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp1i1",
          "text": "And last the hearty welcome.",
          "char_start": 46145,
          "char_end": 46173,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp2i0",
          "text": "Thanks to your majesty.",
          "char_start": 46174,
          "char_end": 46197,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lords"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp3i0",
          "text": "Ourself will mingle with society,",
          "char_start": 46198,
          "char_end": 46231,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp3i1",
          "text": "And play the humble host.",
          "char_start": 46232,
          "char_end": 46257,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp3i2",
          "text": "Our hostess keeps her state, but in best time",
          "char_start": 46258,
          "char_end": 46303,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp3i3",
          "text": "We will require her welcome.",
          "char_start": 46304,
          "char_end": 46332,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp4i0",
          "text": "Pronounce it for me, sir, to all our friends;",
          "char_start": 46333,
          "char_end": 46378,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp4i1",
          "text": "For my heart speaks they are welcome.",
          "char_start": 46379,
          "char_end": 46416,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp4i2",
          "text": "First Murderer appears at the door",
          "char_start": 46417,
          "char_end": 46451,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp5i0",
          "text": "See, they encounter thee with their hearts' thanks.",
          "char_start": 46452,
          "char_end": 46503,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp5i1",
          "text": "Both sides are even: here I'll sit i' the midst:",
          "char_start": 46504,
          "char_end": 46552,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp5i2",
          "text": "Be large in mirth; anon we'll drink a measure",
          "char_start": 46553,
          "char_end": 46598,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp5i3",
          "text": "The table round.",
          "char_start": 46599,
          "char_end": 46615,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp5i4",
          "text": "Approaching the door",
          "char_start": 46616,
          "char_end": 46636,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp5i5",
          "text": "There's blood on thy face.",
          "char_start": 46637,
          "char_end": 46663,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp6i0",
          "text": "'Tis Banquo's then.",
          "char_start": 46664,
          "char_end": 46683,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp7i0",
          "text": "'Tis better thee without than he within.",
          "char_start": 46684,
          "char_end": 46724,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp7i1",
          "text": "Is he dispatch'd?",
          "char_start": 46725,
          "char_end": 46742,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp8i0",
          "text": "My lord, his throat is cut; that I did for him.",
          "char_start": 46743,
          "char_end": 46790,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp9i0",
          "text": "Thou art the best o' the cut-throats: yet he's good",
          "char_start": 46791,
          "char_end": 46842,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp9i1",
          "text": "That did the like for Fleance: if thou didst it,",
          "char_start": 46843,
          "char_end": 46891,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp9i2",
          "text": "Thou art the nonpareil.",
          "char_start": 46892,
          "char_end": 46915,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp10i0",
          "text": "Most royal sir,",
          "char_start": 46916,
          "char_end": 46931,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp10i1",
          "text": "Fleance is 'scaped.",
          "char_start": 46932,
          "char_end": 46951,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp11i0",
          "text": "Then comes my fit again: I had else been perfect,",
          "char_start": 46952,
          "char_end": 47001,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp11i1",
          "text": "Whole as the marble, founded as the rock,",
          "char_start": 47002,
          "char_end": 47043,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp11i2",
          "text": "As broad and general as the casing air:",
          "char_start": 47044,
          "char_end": 47083,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp11i3",
          "text": "But now I am cabin'd, cribb'd, confined, bound in",
          "char_start": 47084,
          "char_end": 47133,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp11i4",
          "text": "To saucy doubts and fears. But Banquo's safe?",
          "char_start": 47134,
          "char_end": 47179,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp12i0",
          "text": "Ay, my good lord: safe in a ditch he bides,",
          "char_start": 47180,
          "char_end": 47223,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp12i1",
          "text": "With twenty trenched gashes on his head;",
          "char_start": 47224,
          "char_end": 47264,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp12i2",
          "text": "The least a death to nature.",
          "char_start": 47265,
          "char_end": 47293,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp13i0",
          "text": "Thanks for that:",
          "char_start": 47294,
          "char_end": 47310,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp13i1",
          "text": "There the grown serpent lies; the worm that's fled",
          "char_start": 47311,
          "char_end": 47361,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp13i2",
          "text": "Hath nature that in time will venom breed,",
          "char_start": 47362,
          "char_end": 47404,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp13i3",
          "text": "No teeth for the present. Get thee gone: to-morrow",
          "char_start": 47405,
          "char_end": 47455,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp13i4",
          "text": "We'll hear, ourselves, again.",
          "char_start": 47456,
          "char_end": 47485,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp13i5",
          "text": "Exit Murderer",
          "char_start": 47486,
          "char_end": 47499,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp14i0",
          "text": "My royal lord,",
          "char_start": 47500,
          "char_end": 47514,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp14i1",
          "text": "You do not give the cheer: the feast is sold",
          "char_start": 47515,
          "char_end": 47559,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp14i2",
          "text": "That is not often vouch'd, while 'tis a-making,",
          "char_start": 47560,
          "char_end": 47607,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp14i3",
          "text": "'Tis given with welcome: to feed were best at home;",
          "char_start": 47608,
          "char_end": 47659,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp14i4",
          "text": "From thence the sauce to meat is ceremony;",
          "char_start": 47660,
          "char_end": 47702,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp14i5",
          "text": "Meeting were bare without it.",
          "char_start": 47703,
          "char_end": 47732,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp15i0",
          "text": "Sweet remembrancer!",
          "char_start": 47733,
          "char_end": 47752,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp15i1",
          "text": "Now, good digestion wait on appetite,",
          "char_start": 47753,
          "char_end": 47790,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp15i2",
          "text": "And health on both!",
          "char_start": 47791,
          "char_end": 47810,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp16i0",
          "text": "May't please your highness sit.",
          "char_start": 47811,
          "char_end": 47842,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp16i1",
          "text": "The GHOST OF BANQUO enters, and sits in MACBETH's place",
          "char_start": 47843,
          "char_end": 47898,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp17i0",
          "text": "Here had we now our country's honour roof'd,",
          "char_start": 47899,
          "char_end": 47943,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp17i1",
          "text": "Were the graced person of our Banquo present;",
          "char_start": 47944,
          "char_end": 47989,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp17i2",
          "text": "Who may I rather challenge for unkindness",
          "char_start": 47990,
          "char_end": 48031,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp17i3",
          "text": "Than pity for mischance!",
          "char_start": 48032,
          "char_end": 48056,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp18i0",
          "text": "His absence, sir,",
          "char_start": 48057,
          "char_end": 48074,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp18i1",
          "text": "Lays blame upon his promise. Please't your highness",
          "char_start": 48075,
          "char_end": 48126,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp18i2",
          "text": "To grace us with your royal company.",
          "char_start": 48127,
          "char_end": 48163,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp19i0",
          "text": "The table's full.",
          "char_start": 48164,
          "char_end": 48181,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp20i0",
          "text": "Here is a place reserved, sir.",
          "char_start": 48182,
          "char_end": 48212,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp21i0",
          "text": "Where?",
          "char_start": 48213,
          "char_end": 48219,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp22i0",
          "text": "Here, my good lord. What is't that moves your highness?",
          "char_start": 48220,
          "char_end": 48275,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp23i0",
          "text": "Which of you have done this?",
          "char_start": 48276,
          "char_end": 48304,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp24i0",
          "text": "What, my good lord?",
          "char_start": 48305,
          "char_end": 48324,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lords"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp25i0",
          "text": "Thou canst not say I did it: never shake",
          "char_start": 48325,
          "char_end": 48365,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp25i1",
          "text": "Thy gory locks at me.",
          "char_start": 48366,
          "char_end": 48387,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp26i0",
          "text": "Gentlemen, rise: his highness is not well.",
          "char_start": 48388,
          "char_end": 48430,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp27i0",
          "text": "Sit, worthy friends: my lord is often thus,",
          "char_start": 48431,
          "char_end": 48474,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp27i1",
          "text": "And hath been from his youth: pray you, keep seat;",
          "char_start": 48475,
          "char_end": 48525,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp27i2",
          "text": "The fit is momentary; upon a thought",
          "char_start": 48526,
          "char_end": 48562,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp27i3",
          "text": "He will again be well: if much you note him,",
          "char_start": 48563,
          "char_end": 48607,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp27i4",
          "text": "You shall offend him and extend his passion:",
          "char_start": 48608,
          "char_end": 48652,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp27i5",
          "text": "Feed, and regard him not. Are you a man?",
          "char_start": 48653,
          "char_end": 48693,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp28i0",
          "text": "Ay, and a bold one, that dare look on that",
          "char_start": 48694,
          "char_end": 48736,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp28i1",
          "text": "Which might appal the devil.",
          "char_start": 48737,
          "char_end": 48765,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp29i0",
          "text": "O proper stuff!",
          "char_start": 48766,
          "char_end": 48781,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp29i1",
          "text": "This is the very painting of your fear:",
          "char_start": 48782,
          "char_end": 48821,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp29i2",
          "text": "This is the air-drawn dagger which, you said,",
          "char_start": 48822,
          "char_end": 48867,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp29i3",
          "text": "Led you to Duncan. O, these flaws and starts,",
          "char_start": 48868,
          "char_end": 48913,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp29i4",
          "text": "Impostors to true fear, would well become",
          "char_start": 48914,
          "char_end": 48955,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp29i5",
          "text": "A woman's story at a winter's fire,",
          "char_start": 48956,
          "char_end": 48991,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp29i6",
          "text": "Authorized by her grandam. Shame itself!",
          "char_start": 48992,
          "char_end": 49032,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp29i7",
          "text": "Why do you make such faces? When all's done,",
          "char_start": 49033,
          "char_end": 49077,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp29i8",
          "text": "You look but on a stool.",
          "char_start": 49078,
          "char_end": 49102,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp30i0",
          "text": "Prithee, see there! behold! look! lo!",
          "char_start": 49103,
          "char_end": 49140,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp30i1",
          "text": "how say you?",
          "char_start": 49141,
          "char_end": 49153,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp30i2",
          "text": "Why, what care I? If thou canst nod, speak too.",
          "char_start": 49154,
          "char_end": 49201,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp30i3",
          "text": "If charnel-houses and our graves must send",
          "char_start": 49202,
          "char_end": 49244,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp30i4",
          "text": "Those that we bury back, our monuments",
          "char_start": 49245,
          "char_end": 49283,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp30i5",
          "text": "Shall be the maws of kites.",
          "char_start": 49284,
          "char_end": 49311,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp30i6",
          "text": "GHOST OF BANQUO vanishes",
          "char_start": 49312,
          "char_end": 49336,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp31i0",
          "text": "What, quite unmann'd in folly?",
          "char_start": 49337,
          "char_end": 49367,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp32i0",
          "text": "If I stand here, I saw him.",
          "char_start": 49368,
          "char_end": 49395,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.87",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp33i0",
          "text": "Fie, for shame!",
          "char_start": 49396,
          "char_end": 49411,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.88",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp34i0",
          "text": "Blood hath been shed ere now, i' the olden time,",
          "char_start": 49412,
          "char_end": 49460,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.89",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp34i1",
          "text": "Ere human statute purged the gentle weal;",
          "char_start": 49461,
          "char_end": 49502,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.90",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp34i2",
          "text": "Ay, and since too, murders have been perform'd",
          "char_start": 49503,
          "char_end": 49549,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.91",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp34i3",
          "text": "Too terrible for the ear: the times have been,",
          "char_start": 49550,
          "char_end": 49596,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.92",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp34i4",
          "text": "That, when the brains were out, the man would die,",
          "char_start": 49597,
          "char_end": 49647,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.93",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp34i5",
          "text": "And there an end; but now they rise again,",
          "char_start": 49648,
          "char_end": 49690,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.94",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp34i6",
          "text": "With twenty mortal murders on their crowns,",
          "char_start": 49691,
          "char_end": 49734,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.95",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp34i7",
          "text": "And push us from our stools: this is more strange",
          "char_start": 49735,
          "char_end": 49784,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.96",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp34i8",
          "text": "Than such a murder is.",
          "char_start": 49785,
          "char_end": 49807,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.97",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp35i0",
          "text": "My worthy lord,",
          "char_start": 49808,
          "char_end": 49823,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.98",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp35i1",
          "text": "Your noble friends do lack you.",
          "char_start": 49824,
          "char_end": 49855,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.99",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp36i0",
          "text": "I do forget.",
          "char_start": 49856,
          "char_end": 49868,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.100",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp36i1",
          "text": "Do not muse at me, my most worthy friends,",
          "char_start": 49869,
          "char_end": 49911,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.101",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp36i2",
          "text": "I have a strange infirmity, which is nothing",
          "char_start": 49912,
          "char_end": 49956,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.102",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp36i3",
          "text": "To those that know me. Come, love and health to all;",
          "char_start": 49957,
          "char_end": 50009,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.103",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp36i4",
          "text": "Then I'll sit down. Give me some wine; fill full.",
          "char_start": 50010,
          "char_end": 50059,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.104",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp36i5",
          "text": "I drink to the general joy o' the whole table,",
          "char_start": 50060,
          "char_end": 50106,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.105",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp36i6",
          "text": "And to our dear friend Banquo, whom we miss;",
          "char_start": 50107,
          "char_end": 50151,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.106",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp36i7",
          "text": "Would he were here! to all, and him, we thirst,",
          "char_start": 50152,
          "char_end": 50199,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.107",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp36i8",
          "text": "And all to all.",
          "char_start": 50200,
          "char_end": 50215,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.108",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp37i0",
          "text": "Our duties, and the pledge.",
          "char_start": 50216,
          "char_end": 50243,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.109",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lords"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp37i1",
          "text": "Re-enter GHOST OF BANQUO",
          "char_start": 50244,
          "char_end": 50268,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Lords"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp38i0",
          "text": "Avaunt! and quit my sight! let the earth hide thee!",
          "char_start": 50269,
          "char_end": 50320,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.110",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp38i1",
          "text": "Thy bones are marrowless, thy blood is cold;",
          "char_start": 50321,
          "char_end": 50365,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.111",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp38i2",
          "text": "Thou hast no speculation in those eyes",
          "char_start": 50366,
          "char_end": 50404,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.112",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp38i3",
          "text": "Which thou dost glare with!",
          "char_start": 50405,
          "char_end": 50432,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.113",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp39i0",
          "text": "Think of this, good peers,",
          "char_start": 50433,
          "char_end": 50459,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.114",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp39i1",
          "text": "But as a thing of custom: 'tis no other;",
          "char_start": 50460,
          "char_end": 50500,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.115",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp39i2",
          "text": "Only it spoils the pleasure of the time.",
          "char_start": 50501,
          "char_end": 50541,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.116",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i0",
          "text": "What man dare, I dare:",
          "char_start": 50542,
          "char_end": 50564,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.117",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i1",
          "text": "Approach thou like the rugged Russian bear,",
          "char_start": 50565,
          "char_end": 50608,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.118",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i2",
          "text": "The arm'd rhinoceros, or the Hyrcan tiger;",
          "char_start": 50609,
          "char_end": 50651,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.119",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i3",
          "text": "Take any shape but that, and my firm nerves",
          "char_start": 50652,
          "char_end": 50695,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.120",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i4",
          "text": "Shall never tremble: or be alive again,",
          "char_start": 50696,
          "char_end": 50735,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.121",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i5",
          "text": "And dare me to the desert with thy sword;",
          "char_start": 50736,
          "char_end": 50777,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.122",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i6",
          "text": "If trembling I inhabit then, protest me",
          "char_start": 50778,
          "char_end": 50817,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.123",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i7",
          "text": "The baby of a girl. Hence, horrible shadow!",
          "char_start": 50818,
          "char_end": 50861,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.124",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i8",
          "text": "Unreal mockery, hence!",
          "char_start": 50862,
          "char_end": 50884,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.125",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i9",
          "text": "GHOST OF BANQUO vanishes",
          "char_start": 50885,
          "char_end": 50909,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i10",
          "text": "Why, so: being gone,",
          "char_start": 50910,
          "char_end": 50930,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.126",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp40i11",
          "text": "I am a man again. Pray you, sit still.",
          "char_start": 50931,
          "char_end": 50969,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.127",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp41i0",
          "text": "You have displaced the mirth, broke the good meeting,",
          "char_start": 50970,
          "char_end": 51023,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.128",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp41i1",
          "text": "With most admired disorder.",
          "char_start": 51024,
          "char_end": 51051,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.129",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp42i0",
          "text": "Can such things be,",
          "char_start": 51052,
          "char_end": 51071,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.130",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp42i1",
          "text": "And overcome us like a summer's cloud,",
          "char_start": 51072,
          "char_end": 51110,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.131",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp42i2",
          "text": "Without our special wonder? You make me strange",
          "char_start": 51111,
          "char_end": 51158,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.132",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp42i3",
          "text": "Even to the disposition that I owe,",
          "char_start": 51159,
          "char_end": 51194,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.133",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp42i4",
          "text": "When now I think you can behold such sights,",
          "char_start": 51195,
          "char_end": 51239,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.134",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp42i5",
          "text": "And keep the natural ruby of your cheeks,",
          "char_start": 51240,
          "char_end": 51281,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.135",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp42i6",
          "text": "When mine is blanched with fear.",
          "char_start": 51282,
          "char_end": 51314,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.136",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp43i0",
          "text": "What sights, my lord?",
          "char_start": 51315,
          "char_end": 51336,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.137",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp44i0",
          "text": "I pray you, speak not; he grows worse and worse;",
          "char_start": 51337,
          "char_end": 51385,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.138",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp44i1",
          "text": "Question enrages him. At once, good night:",
          "char_start": 51386,
          "char_end": 51428,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.139",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp44i2",
          "text": "Stand not upon the order of your going,",
          "char_start": 51429,
          "char_end": 51468,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.140",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp44i3",
          "text": "But go at once.",
          "char_start": 51469,
          "char_end": 51484,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.141",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp45i0",
          "text": "Good night; and better health",
          "char_start": 51485,
          "char_end": 51514,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.142",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp45i1",
          "text": "Attend his majesty!",
          "char_start": 51515,
          "char_end": 51534,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.143",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp46i0",
          "text": "A kind good night to all!",
          "char_start": 51535,
          "char_end": 51560,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.144",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp46i1",
          "text": "Exeunt all but MACBETH and LADY MACBETH",
          "char_start": 51561,
          "char_end": 51600,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp47i0",
          "text": "It will have blood; they say, blood will have blood:",
          "char_start": 51601,
          "char_end": 51653,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.145",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp47i1",
          "text": "Stones have been known to move and trees to speak;",
          "char_start": 51654,
          "char_end": 51704,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.146",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp47i2",
          "text": "Augurs and understood relations have",
          "char_start": 51705,
          "char_end": 51741,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.147",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp47i3",
          "text": "By magot-pies and choughs and rooks brought forth",
          "char_start": 51742,
          "char_end": 51791,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.148",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp47i4",
          "text": "The secret'st man of blood. What is the night?",
          "char_start": 51792,
          "char_end": 51838,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.149",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp48i0",
          "text": "Almost at odds with morning, which is which.",
          "char_start": 51839,
          "char_end": 51883,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.150",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp49i0",
          "text": "How say'st thou, that Macduff denies his person",
          "char_start": 51884,
          "char_end": 51931,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.151",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp49i1",
          "text": "At our great bidding?",
          "char_start": 51932,
          "char_end": 51953,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.152",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp50i0",
          "text": "Did you send to him, sir?",
          "char_start": 51954,
          "char_end": 51979,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.153",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i0",
          "text": "I hear it by the way; but I will send:",
          "char_start": 51980,
          "char_end": 52018,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.154",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i1",
          "text": "There's not a one of them but in his house",
          "char_start": 52019,
          "char_end": 52061,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.155",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i2",
          "text": "I keep a servant fee'd. I will to-morrow,",
          "char_start": 52062,
          "char_end": 52103,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.156",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i3",
          "text": "And betimes I will, to the weird sisters:",
          "char_start": 52104,
          "char_end": 52145,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.157",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i4",
          "text": "More shall they speak; for now I am bent to know,",
          "char_start": 52146,
          "char_end": 52195,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.158",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i5",
          "text": "By the worst means, the worst. For mine own good,",
          "char_start": 52196,
          "char_end": 52245,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.159",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i6",
          "text": "All causes shall give way: I am in blood",
          "char_start": 52246,
          "char_end": 52286,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.160",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i7",
          "text": "Stepp'd in so far that, should I wade no more,",
          "char_start": 52287,
          "char_end": 52333,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.161",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i8",
          "text": "Returning were as tedious as go o'er:",
          "char_start": 52334,
          "char_end": 52371,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.162",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i9",
          "text": "Strange things I have in head, that will to hand;",
          "char_start": 52372,
          "char_end": 52421,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.163",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp51i10",
          "text": "Which must be acted ere they may be scann'd.",
          "char_start": 52422,
          "char_end": 52466,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.164",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp52i0",
          "text": "You lack the season of all natures, sleep.",
          "char_start": 52467,
          "char_end": 52509,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.165",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp53i0",
          "text": "Come, we'll to sleep. My strange and self-abuse",
          "char_start": 52510,
          "char_end": 52557,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.166",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp53i1",
          "text": "Is the initiate fear that wants hard use:",
          "char_start": 52558,
          "char_end": 52599,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.167",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp53i2",
          "text": "We are yet but young in deed.",
          "char_start": 52600,
          "char_end": 52629,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "3.4.168",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s4:sp53i3",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 52630,
          "char_end": 52636,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:open",
          "text": "Thunder. Enter the three Witches meeting HECATE",
          "char_start": 52637,
          "char_end": 52684,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp1i0",
          "text": "Why, how now, Hecate! you look angerly.",
          "char_start": 52685,
          "char_end": 52724,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i0",
          "text": "Have I not reason, beldams as you are,",
          "char_start": 52725,
          "char_end": 52763,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i1",
          "text": "Saucy and overbold? How did you dare",
          "char_start": 52764,
          "char_end": 52800,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i2",
          "text": "To trade and traffic with Macbeth",
          "char_start": 52801,
          "char_end": 52834,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i3",
          "text": "In riddles and affairs of death;",
          "char_start": 52835,
          "char_end": 52867,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i4",
          "text": "And I, the mistress of your charms,",
          "char_start": 52868,
          "char_end": 52903,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i5",
          "text": "The close contriver of all harms,",
          "char_start": 52904,
          "char_end": 52937,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i6",
          "text": "Was never call'd to bear my part,",
          "char_start": 52938,
          "char_end": 52971,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i7",
          "text": "Or show the glory of our art?",
          "char_start": 52972,
          "char_end": 53001,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i8",
          "text": "And, which is worse, all you have done",
          "char_start": 53002,
          "char_end": 53040,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i9",
          "text": "Hath been but for a wayward son,",
          "char_start": 53041,
          "char_end": 53073,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i10",
          "text": "Spiteful and wrathful, who, as others do,",
          "char_start": 53074,
          "char_end": 53115,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i11",
          "text": "Loves for his own ends, not for you.",
          "char_start": 53116,
          "char_end": 53152,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i12",
          "text": "But make amends now: get you gone,",
          "char_start": 53153,
          "char_end": 53187,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i13",
          "text": "And at the pit of Acheron",
          "char_start": 53188,
          "char_end": 53213,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i14",
          "text": "Meet me i' the morning: thither he",
          "char_start": 53214,
          "char_end": 53248,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i15",
          "text": "Will come to know his destiny:",
          "char_start": 53249,
          "char_end": 53279,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i16",
          "text": "Your vessels and your spells provide,",
          "char_start": 53280,
          "char_end": 53317,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i17",
          "text": "Your charms and every thing beside.",
          "char_start": 53318,
          "char_end": 53353,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i18",
          "text": "I am for the air; this night I'll spend",
          "char_start": 53354,
          "char_end": 53393,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i19",
          "text": "Unto a dismal and a fatal end:",
          "char_start": 53394,
          "char_end": 53424,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i20",
          "text": "Great business must be wrought ere noon:",
          "char_start": 53425,
          "char_end": 53465,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i21",
          "text": "Upon the corner of the moon",
          "char_start": 53466,
          "char_end": 53493,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i22",
          "text": "There hangs a vaporous drop profound;",
          "char_start": 53494,
          "char_end": 53531,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i23",
          "text": "I'll catch it ere it come to ground:",
          "char_start": 53532,
          "char_end": 53568,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i24",
          "text": "And that distill'd by magic sleights",
          "char_start": 53569,
          "char_end": 53605,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i25",
          "text": "Shall raise such artificial sprites",
          "char_start": 53606,
          "char_end": 53641,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i26",
          "text": "As by the strength of their illusion",
          "char_start": 53642,
          "char_end": 53678,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i27",
          "text": "Shall draw him on to his confusion:",
          "char_start": 53679,
          "char_end": 53714,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i28",
          "text": "He shall spurn fate, scorn death, and bear",
          "char_start": 53715,
          "char_end": 53757,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i29",
          "text": "He hopes 'bove wisdom, grace and fear:",
          "char_start": 53758,
          "char_end": 53796,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i30",
          "text": "And you all know, security",
          "char_start": 53797,
          "char_end": 53823,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i31",
          "text": "Is mortals' chiefest enemy.",
          "char_start": 53824,
          "char_end": 53851,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i32",
          "text": "Music and a song within: 'Come away, come away,' & c",
          "char_start": 53852,
          "char_end": 53904,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i33",
          "text": "Hark! I am call'd; my little spirit, see,",
          "char_start": 53905,
          "char_end": 53946,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i34",
          "text": "Sits in a foggy cloud, and stays for me.",
          "char_start": 53947,
          "char_end": 53987,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp2i35",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 53988,
          "char_end": 53992,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp3i0",
          "text": "Come, let's make haste; she'll soon be back again.",
          "char_start": 53993,
          "char_end": 54043,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "3.5.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s5:sp3i1",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 54044,
          "char_end": 54050,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:open",
          "text": "Enter LENNOX and another Lord",
          "char_start": 54051,
          "char_end": 54080,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i0",
          "text": "My former speeches have but hit your thoughts,",
          "char_start": 54081,
          "char_end": 54127,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i1",
          "text": "Which can interpret further: only, I say,",
          "char_start": 54128,
          "char_end": 54169,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i2",
          "text": "Things have been strangely borne. The",
          "char_start": 54170,
          "char_end": 54207,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i3",
          "text": "gracious Duncan",
          "char_start": 54208,
          "char_end": 54223,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i4",
          "text": "Was pitied of Macbeth: marry, he was dead:",
          "char_start": 54224,
          "char_end": 54266,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i5",
          "text": "And the right-valiant Banquo walk'd too late;",
          "char_start": 54267,
          "char_end": 54312,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i6",
          "text": "Whom, you may say, if't please you, Fleance kill'd,",
          "char_start": 54313,
          "char_end": 54364,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i7",
          "text": "For Fleance fled: men must not walk too late.",
          "char_start": 54365,
          "char_end": 54410,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i8",
          "text": "Who cannot want the thought how monstrous",
          "char_start": 54411,
          "char_end": 54452,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i9",
          "text": "It was for Malcolm and for Donalbain",
          "char_start": 54453,
          "char_end": 54489,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i10",
          "text": "To kill their gracious father? damned fact!",
          "char_start": 54490,
          "char_end": 54533,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i11",
          "text": "How it did grieve Macbeth! did he not straight",
          "char_start": 54534,
          "char_end": 54580,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i12",
          "text": "In pious rage the two delinquents tear,",
          "char_start": 54581,
          "char_end": 54620,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i13",
          "text": "That were the slaves of drink and thralls of sleep?",
          "char_start": 54621,
          "char_end": 54672,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i14",
          "text": "Was not that nobly done? Ay, and wisely too;",
          "char_start": 54673,
          "char_end": 54717,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i15",
          "text": "For 'twould have anger'd any heart alive",
          "char_start": 54718,
          "char_end": 54758,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i16",
          "text": "To hear the men deny't. So that, I say,",
          "char_start": 54759,
          "char_end": 54798,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i17",
          "text": "He has borne all things well: and I do think",
          "char_start": 54799,
          "char_end": 54843,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i18",
          "text": "That had he Duncan's sons under his key--",
          "char_start": 54844,
          "char_end": 54885,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i19",
          "text": "As, an't please heaven, he shall not--they",
          "char_start": 54886,
          "char_end": 54928,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i20",
          "text": "should find",
          "char_start": 54929,
          "char_end": 54940,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i21",
          "text": "What 'twere to kill a father; so should Fleance.",
          "char_start": 54941,
          "char_end": 54989,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i22",
          "text": "But, peace! for from broad words and 'cause he fail'd",
          "char_start": 54990,
          "char_end": 55043,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i23",
          "text": "His presence at the tyrant's feast, I hear",
          "char_start": 55044,
          "char_end": 55086,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i24",
          "text": "Macduff lives in disgrace: sir, can you tell",
          "char_start": 55087,
          "char_end": 55131,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp1i25",
          "text": "Where he bestows himself?",
          "char_start": 55132,
          "char_end": 55157,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i0",
          "text": "The son of Duncan,",
          "char_start": 55158,
          "char_end": 55176,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i1",
          "text": "From whom this tyrant holds the due of birth",
          "char_start": 55177,
          "char_end": 55221,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i2",
          "text": "Lives in the English court, and is received",
          "char_start": 55222,
          "char_end": 55265,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i3",
          "text": "Of the most pious Edward with such grace",
          "char_start": 55266,
          "char_end": 55306,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i4",
          "text": "That the malevolence of fortune nothing",
          "char_start": 55307,
          "char_end": 55346,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i5",
          "text": "Takes from his high respect: thither Macduff",
          "char_start": 55347,
          "char_end": 55391,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i6",
          "text": "Is gone to pray the holy king, upon his aid",
          "char_start": 55392,
          "char_end": 55435,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i7",
          "text": "To wake Northumberland and warlike Siward:",
          "char_start": 55436,
          "char_end": 55478,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i8",
          "text": "That, by the help of these--with Him above",
          "char_start": 55479,
          "char_end": 55521,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i9",
          "text": "To ratify the work--we may again",
          "char_start": 55522,
          "char_end": 55554,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i10",
          "text": "Give to our tables meat, sleep to our nights,",
          "char_start": 55555,
          "char_end": 55600,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i11",
          "text": "Free from our feasts and banquets bloody knives,",
          "char_start": 55601,
          "char_end": 55649,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i12",
          "text": "Do faithful homage and receive free honours:",
          "char_start": 55650,
          "char_end": 55694,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i13",
          "text": "All which we pine for now: and this report",
          "char_start": 55695,
          "char_end": 55737,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i14",
          "text": "Hath so exasperate the king that he",
          "char_start": 55738,
          "char_end": 55773,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp2i15",
          "text": "Prepares for some attempt of war.",
          "char_start": 55774,
          "char_end": 55807,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp3i0",
          "text": "Sent he to Macduff?",
          "char_start": 55808,
          "char_end": 55827,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp4i0",
          "text": "He did: and with an absolute 'Sir, not I,'",
          "char_start": 55828,
          "char_end": 55870,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp4i1",
          "text": "The cloudy messenger turns me his back,",
          "char_start": 55871,
          "char_end": 55910,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp4i2",
          "text": "And hums, as who should say 'You'll rue the time",
          "char_start": 55911,
          "char_end": 55959,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp4i3",
          "text": "That clogs me with this answer.'",
          "char_start": 55960,
          "char_end": 55992,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp5i0",
          "text": "And that well might",
          "char_start": 55993,
          "char_end": 56012,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp5i1",
          "text": "Advise him to a caution, to hold what distance",
          "char_start": 56013,
          "char_end": 56059,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp5i2",
          "text": "His wisdom can provide. Some holy angel",
          "char_start": 56060,
          "char_end": 56099,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp5i3",
          "text": "Fly to the court of England and unfold",
          "char_start": 56100,
          "char_end": 56138,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp5i4",
          "text": "His message ere he come, that a swift blessing",
          "char_start": 56139,
          "char_end": 56185,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp5i5",
          "text": "May soon return to this our suffering country",
          "char_start": 56186,
          "char_end": 56231,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp5i6",
          "text": "Under a hand accursed!",
          "char_start": 56232,
          "char_end": 56254,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp6i0",
          "text": "I'll send my prayers with him.",
          "char_start": 56255,
          "char_end": 56285,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "3.6.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a3s6:sp6i1",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 56286,
          "char_end": 56292,
          "act": 3,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Lord"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:open",
          "text": "Thunder. Enter the three Witches",
          "char_start": 56293,
          "char_end": 56325,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp1i0",
          "text": "Thrice the brinded cat hath mew'd.",
          "char_start": 56326,
          "char_end": 56360,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp2i0",
          "text": "Thrice and once the hedge-pig whined.",
          "char_start": 56361,
          "char_end": 56398,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp3i0",
          "text": "Harpier cries 'Tis time, 'tis time.",
          "char_start": 56399,
          "char_end": 56434,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp4i0",
          "text": "Round about the cauldron go;",
          "char_start": 56435,
          "char_end": 56463,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp4i1",
          "text": "In the poison'd entrails throw.",
          "char_start": 56464,
          "char_end": 56495,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp4i2",
          "text": "Toad, that under cold stone",
          "char_start": 56496,
          "char_end": 56523,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp4i3",
          "text": "Days and nights has thirty-one",
          "char_start": 56524,
          "char_end": 56554,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp4i4",
          "text": "Swelter'd venom sleeping got,",
          "char_start": 56555,
          "char_end": 56584,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp4i5",
          "text": "Boil thou first i' the charmed pot.",
          "char_start": 56585,
          "char_end": 56620,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp5i0",
          "text": "Double, double toil and trouble;",
          "char_start": 56621,
          "char_end": 56653,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp5i1",
          "text": "Fire burn, and cauldron bubble.",
          "char_start": 56654,
          "char_end": 56685,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp6i0",
          "text": "Fillet of a fenny snake,",
          "char_start": 56686,
          "char_end": 56710,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp6i1",
          "text": "In the cauldron boil and bake;",
          "char_start": 56711,
          "char_end": 56741,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp6i2",
          "text": "Eye of newt and toe of frog,",
          "char_start": 56742,
          "char_end": 56770,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp6i3",
          "text": "Wool of bat and tongue of dog,",
          "char_start": 56771,
          "char_end": 56801,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp6i4",
          "text": "Adder's fork and blind-worm's sting,",
          "char_start": 56802,
          "char_end": 56838,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp6i5",
          "text": "Lizard's leg and owlet's wing,",
          "char_start": 56839,
          "char_end": 56869,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp6i6",
          "text": "For a charm of powerful trouble,",
          "char_start": 56870,
          "char_end": 56902,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp6i7",
          "text": "Like a hell-broth boil and bubble.",
          "char_start": 56903,
          "char_end": 56937,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp7i0",
          "text": "Double, double toil and trouble;",
          "char_start": 56938,
          "char_end": 56970,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp7i1",
          "text": "Fire burn and cauldron bubble.",
          "char_start": 56971,
          "char_end": 57001,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i0",
          "text": "Scale of dragon, tooth of wolf,",
          "char_start": 57002,
          "char_end": 57033,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i1",
          "text": "Witches' mummy, maw and gulf",
          "char_start": 57034,
          "char_end": 57062,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i2",
          "text": "Of the ravin'd salt-sea shark,",
          "char_start": 57063,
          "char_end": 57093,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i3",
          "text": "Root of hemlock digg'd i' the dark,",
          "char_start": 57094,
          "char_end": 57129,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i4",
          "text": "Liver of blaspheming Jew,",
          "char_start": 57130,
          "char_end": 57155,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i5",
          "text": "Gall of goat, and slips of yew",
          "char_start": 57156,
          "char_end": 57186,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i6",
          "text": "Silver'd in the moon's eclipse,",
          "char_start": 57187,
          "char_end": 57218,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i7",
          "text": "Nose of Turk and Tartar's lips,",
          "char_start": 57219,
          "char_end": 57250,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i8",
          "text": "Finger of birth-strangled babe",
          "char_start": 57251,
          "char_end": 57281,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i9",
          "text": "Ditch-deliver'd by a drab,",
          "char_start": 57282,
          "char_end": 57308,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i10",
          "text": "Make the gruel thick and slab:",
          "char_start": 57309,
          "char_end": 57339,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i11",
          "text": "Add thereto a tiger's chaudron,",
          "char_start": 57340,
          "char_end": 57371,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp8i12",
          "text": "For the ingredients of our cauldron.",
          "char_start": 57372,
          "char_end": 57408,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp9i0",
          "text": "Double, double toil and trouble;",
          "char_start": 57409,
          "char_end": 57441,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp9i1",
          "text": "Fire burn and cauldron bubble.",
          "char_start": 57442,
          "char_end": 57472,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp10i0",
          "text": "Cool it with a baboon's blood,",
          "char_start": 57473,
          "char_end": 57503,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp10i1",
          "text": "Then the charm is firm and good.",
          "char_start": 57504,
          "char_end": 57536,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp10i2",
          "text": "Enter HECATE to the other three Witches",
          "char_start": 57537,
          "char_end": 57576,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp11i0",
          "text": "O well done! I commend your pains;",
          "char_start": 57577,
          "char_end": 57611,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp11i1",
          "text": "And every one shall share i' the gains;",
          "char_start": 57612,
          "char_end": 57651,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp11i2",
          "text": "And now about the cauldron sing,",
          "char_start": 57652,
          "char_end": 57684,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp11i3",
          "text": "Live elves and fairies in a ring,",
          "char_start": 57685,
          "char_end": 57718,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp11i4",
          "text": "Enchanting all that you put in.",
          "char_start": 57719,
          "char_end": 57750,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp11i5",
          "text": "Music and a song: 'Black spirits,' & c",
          "char_start": 57751,
          "char_end": 57789,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp11i6",
          "text": "HECATE retires",
          "char_start": 57790,
          "char_end": 57804,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "HECATE"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp12i0",
          "text": "By the pricking of my thumbs,",
          "char_start": 57805,
          "char_end": 57834,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp12i1",
          "text": "Something wicked this way comes.",
          "char_start": 57835,
          "char_end": 57867,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp12i2",
          "text": "Open, locks,",
          "char_start": 57868,
          "char_end": 57880,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp12i3",
          "text": "Whoever knocks!",
          "char_start": 57881,
          "char_end": 57896,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp12i4",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH",
          "char_start": 57897,
          "char_end": 57910,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp13i0",
          "text": "How now, you secret, black, and midnight hags!",
          "char_start": 57911,
          "char_end": 57957,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp13i1",
          "text": "What is't you do?",
          "char_start": 57958,
          "char_end": 57975,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp14i0",
          "text": "A deed without a name.",
          "char_start": 57976,
          "char_end": 57998,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i0",
          "text": "I conjure you, by that which you profess,",
          "char_start": 57999,
          "char_end": 58040,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i1",
          "text": "Howe'er you come to know it, answer me:",
          "char_start": 58041,
          "char_end": 58080,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i2",
          "text": "Though you untie the winds and let them fight",
          "char_start": 58081,
          "char_end": 58126,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i3",
          "text": "Against the churches; though the yesty waves",
          "char_start": 58127,
          "char_end": 58171,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i4",
          "text": "Confound and swallow navigation up;",
          "char_start": 58172,
          "char_end": 58207,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i5",
          "text": "Though bladed corn be lodged and trees blown down;",
          "char_start": 58208,
          "char_end": 58258,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i6",
          "text": "Though castles topple on their warders' heads;",
          "char_start": 58259,
          "char_end": 58305,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i7",
          "text": "Though palaces and pyramids do slope",
          "char_start": 58306,
          "char_end": 58342,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i8",
          "text": "Their heads to their foundations; though the treasure",
          "char_start": 58343,
          "char_end": 58396,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i9",
          "text": "Of nature's germens tumble all together,",
          "char_start": 58397,
          "char_end": 58437,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i10",
          "text": "Even till destruction sicken; answer me",
          "char_start": 58438,
          "char_end": 58477,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp15i11",
          "text": "To what I ask you.",
          "char_start": 58478,
          "char_end": 58496,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp16i0",
          "text": "Speak.",
          "char_start": 58497,
          "char_end": 58503,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp17i0",
          "text": "Demand.",
          "char_start": 58504,
          "char_end": 58511,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp18i0",
          "text": "We'll answer.",
          "char_start": 58512,
          "char_end": 58525,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp19i0",
          "text": "Say, if thou'dst rather hear it from our mouths,",
          "char_start": 58526,
          "char_end": 58574,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp19i1",
          "text": "Or from our masters?",
          "char_start": 58575,
          "char_end": 58595,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp20i0",
          "text": "Call 'em; let me see 'em.",
          "char_start": 58596,
          "char_end": 58621,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp21i0",
          "text": "Pour in sow's blood, that hath eaten",
          "char_start": 58622,
          "char_end": 58658,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp21i1",
          "text": "Her nine farrow; grease that's sweaten",
          "char_start": 58659,
          "char_end": 58697,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp21i2",
          "text": "From the murderer's gibbet throw",
          "char_start": 58698,
          "char_end": 58730,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp21i3",
          "text": "Into the flame.",
          "char_start": 58731,
          "char_end": 58746,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp22i0",
          "text": "Come, high or low;",
          "char_start": 58747,
          "char_end": 58765,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp22i1",
          "text": "Thyself and office deftly show!",
          "char_start": 58766,
          "char_end": 58797,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp22i2",
          "text": "Thunder. First Apparition: an armed Head",
          "char_start": 58798,
          "char_end": 58838,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp23i0",
          "text": "Tell me, thou unknown power,--",
          "char_start": 58839,
          "char_end": 58869,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp24i0",
          "text": "He knows thy thought:",
          "char_start": 58870,
          "char_end": 58891,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp24i1",
          "text": "Hear his speech, but say thou nought.",
          "char_start": 58892,
          "char_end": 58929,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp25i0",
          "text": "Macbeth! Macbeth! Macbeth! beware Macduff;",
          "char_start": 58930,
          "char_end": 58972,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp25i1",
          "text": "Beware the thane of Fife. Dismiss me. Enough.",
          "char_start": 58973,
          "char_end": 59018,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp25i2",
          "text": "Descends",
          "char_start": 59019,
          "char_end": 59027,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "First Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp26i0",
          "text": "Whate'er thou art, for thy good caution, thanks;",
          "char_start": 59028,
          "char_end": 59076,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp26i1",
          "text": "Thou hast harp'd my fear aright: but one",
          "char_start": 59077,
          "char_end": 59117,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp26i2",
          "text": "word more,--",
          "char_start": 59118,
          "char_end": 59130,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp27i0",
          "text": "He will not be commanded: here's another,",
          "char_start": 59131,
          "char_end": 59172,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp27i1",
          "text": "More potent than the first.",
          "char_start": 59173,
          "char_end": 59200,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp27i2",
          "text": "Thunder. Second Apparition: A bloody Child",
          "char_start": 59201,
          "char_end": 59243,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp28i0",
          "text": "Macbeth! Macbeth! Macbeth!",
          "char_start": 59244,
          "char_end": 59270,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp29i0",
          "text": "Had I three ears, I'ld hear thee.",
          "char_start": 59271,
          "char_end": 59304,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp30i0",
          "text": "Be bloody, bold, and resolute; laugh to scorn",
          "char_start": 59305,
          "char_end": 59350,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.87",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp30i1",
          "text": "The power of man, for none of woman born",
          "char_start": 59351,
          "char_end": 59391,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.88",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp30i2",
          "text": "Shall harm Macbeth.",
          "char_start": 59392,
          "char_end": 59411,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.89",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp30i3",
          "text": "Descends",
          "char_start": 59412,
          "char_end": 59420,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Second Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i0",
          "text": "Then live, Macduff: what need I fear of thee?",
          "char_start": 59421,
          "char_end": 59466,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.90",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i1",
          "text": "But yet I'll make assurance double sure,",
          "char_start": 59467,
          "char_end": 59507,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.91",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i2",
          "text": "And take a bond of fate: thou shalt not live;",
          "char_start": 59508,
          "char_end": 59553,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.92",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i3",
          "text": "That I may tell pale-hearted fear it lies,",
          "char_start": 59554,
          "char_end": 59596,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.93",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i4",
          "text": "And sleep in spite of thunder.",
          "char_start": 59597,
          "char_end": 59627,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.94",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i5",
          "text": "Thunder. Third Apparition: a Child crowned, with a tree in his hand",
          "char_start": 59628,
          "char_end": 59695,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i6",
          "text": "What is this",
          "char_start": 59696,
          "char_end": 59708,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.95",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i7",
          "text": "That rises like the issue of a king,",
          "char_start": 59709,
          "char_end": 59745,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.96",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i8",
          "text": "And wears upon his baby-brow the round",
          "char_start": 59746,
          "char_end": 59784,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.97",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp31i9",
          "text": "And top of sovereignty?",
          "char_start": 59785,
          "char_end": 59808,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.98",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp32i0",
          "text": "Listen, but speak not to't.",
          "char_start": 59809,
          "char_end": 59836,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.99",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp33i0",
          "text": "Be lion-mettled, proud; and take no care",
          "char_start": 59837,
          "char_end": 59877,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.100",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp33i1",
          "text": "Who chafes, who frets, or where conspirers are:",
          "char_start": 59878,
          "char_end": 59925,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.101",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp33i2",
          "text": "Macbeth shall never vanquish'd be until",
          "char_start": 59926,
          "char_end": 59965,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.102",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp33i3",
          "text": "Great Birnam wood to high Dunsinane hill",
          "char_start": 59966,
          "char_end": 60006,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.103",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp33i4",
          "text": "Shall come against him.",
          "char_start": 60007,
          "char_end": 60030,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.104",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp33i5",
          "text": "Descends",
          "char_start": 60031,
          "char_end": 60039,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Third Apparition"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i0",
          "text": "That will never be",
          "char_start": 60040,
          "char_end": 60058,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.105",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i1",
          "text": "Who can impress the forest, bid the tree",
          "char_start": 60059,
          "char_end": 60099,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.106",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i2",
          "text": "Unfix his earth-bound root? Sweet bodements! good!",
          "char_start": 60100,
          "char_end": 60150,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.107",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i3",
          "text": "Rebellion's head, rise never till the wood",
          "char_start": 60151,
          "char_end": 60193,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.108",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i4",
          "text": "Of Birnam rise, and our high-placed Macbeth",
          "char_start": 60194,
          "char_end": 60237,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.109",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i5",
          "text": "Shall live the lease of nature, pay his breath",
          "char_start": 60238,
          "char_end": 60284,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.110",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i6",
          "text": "To time and mortal custom. Yet my heart",
          "char_start": 60285,
          "char_end": 60324,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.111",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i7",
          "text": "Throbs to know one thing: tell me, if your art",
          "char_start": 60325,
          "char_end": 60371,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.112",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i8",
          "text": "Can tell so much: shall Banquo's issue ever",
          "char_start": 60372,
          "char_end": 60415,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.113",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp34i9",
          "text": "Reign in this kingdom?",
          "char_start": 60416,
          "char_end": 60438,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.114",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp35i0",
          "text": "Seek to know no more.",
          "char_start": 60439,
          "char_end": 60460,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.115",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp36i0",
          "text": "I will be satisfied: deny me this,",
          "char_start": 60461,
          "char_end": 60495,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.116",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp36i1",
          "text": "And an eternal curse fall on you! Let me know.",
          "char_start": 60496,
          "char_end": 60542,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.117",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp36i2",
          "text": "Why sinks that cauldron? and what noise is this?",
          "char_start": 60543,
          "char_end": 60591,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.118",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp36i3",
          "text": "Hautboys",
          "char_start": 60592,
          "char_end": 60600,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp37i0",
          "text": "Show!",
          "char_start": 60601,
          "char_end": 60606,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.119",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp38i0",
          "text": "Show!",
          "char_start": 60607,
          "char_end": 60612,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.120",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Second Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp39i0",
          "text": "Show!",
          "char_start": 60613,
          "char_end": 60618,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.121",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Third Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp40i0",
          "text": "Show his eyes, and grieve his heart;",
          "char_start": 60619,
          "char_end": 60655,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.122",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp40i1",
          "text": "Come like shadows, so depart!",
          "char_start": 60656,
          "char_end": 60685,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.123",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp40i2",
          "text": "A show of Eight Kings, the last with a glass in his hand; GHOST OF BANQUO following",
          "char_start": 60686,
          "char_end": 60769,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i0",
          "text": "Thou art too like the spirit of Banquo: down!",
          "char_start": 60770,
          "char_end": 60815,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.124",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i1",
          "text": "Thy crown does sear mine eye-balls. And thy hair,",
          "char_start": 60816,
          "char_end": 60865,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.125",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i2",
          "text": "Thou other gold-bound brow, is like the first.",
          "char_start": 60866,
          "char_end": 60912,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.126",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i3",
          "text": "A third is like the former. Filthy hags!",
          "char_start": 60913,
          "char_end": 60953,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.127",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i4",
          "text": "Why do you show me this? A fourth! Start, eyes!",
          "char_start": 60954,
          "char_end": 61001,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.128",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i5",
          "text": "What, will the line stretch out to the crack of doom?",
          "char_start": 61002,
          "char_end": 61055,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.129",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i6",
          "text": "Another yet! A seventh! I'll see no more:",
          "char_start": 61056,
          "char_end": 61097,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.130",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i7",
          "text": "And yet the eighth appears, who bears a glass",
          "char_start": 61098,
          "char_end": 61143,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.131",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i8",
          "text": "Which shows me many more; and some I see",
          "char_start": 61144,
          "char_end": 61184,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.132",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i9",
          "text": "That two-fold balls and treble scepters carry:",
          "char_start": 61185,
          "char_end": 61231,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.133",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i10",
          "text": "Horrible sight! Now, I see, 'tis true;",
          "char_start": 61232,
          "char_end": 61270,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.134",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i11",
          "text": "For the blood-bolter'd Banquo smiles upon me,",
          "char_start": 61271,
          "char_end": 61316,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.135",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i12",
          "text": "And points at them for his.",
          "char_start": 61317,
          "char_end": 61344,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.136",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i13",
          "text": "Apparitions vanish",
          "char_start": 61345,
          "char_end": 61363,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp41i14",
          "text": "What, is this so?",
          "char_start": 61364,
          "char_end": 61381,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.137",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp42i0",
          "text": "Ay, sir, all this is so: but why",
          "char_start": 61382,
          "char_end": 61414,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.138",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp42i1",
          "text": "Stands Macbeth thus amazedly?",
          "char_start": 61415,
          "char_end": 61444,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.139",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp42i2",
          "text": "Come, sisters, cheer we up his sprites,",
          "char_start": 61445,
          "char_end": 61484,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.140",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp42i3",
          "text": "And show the best of our delights:",
          "char_start": 61485,
          "char_end": 61519,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.141",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp42i4",
          "text": "I'll charm the air to give a sound,",
          "char_start": 61520,
          "char_end": 61555,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.142",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp42i5",
          "text": "While you perform your antic round:",
          "char_start": 61556,
          "char_end": 61591,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.143",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp42i6",
          "text": "That this great king may kindly say,",
          "char_start": 61592,
          "char_end": 61628,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.144",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp42i7",
          "text": "Our duties did his welcome pay.",
          "char_start": 61629,
          "char_end": 61660,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.145",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp42i8",
          "text": "Music. The witches dance and then vanish, with HECATE",
          "char_start": 61661,
          "char_end": 61714,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "First Witch"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp43i0",
          "text": "Where are they? Gone? Let this pernicious hour",
          "char_start": 61715,
          "char_end": 61761,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.146",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp43i1",
          "text": "Stand aye accursed in the calendar!",
          "char_start": 61762,
          "char_end": 61797,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.147",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp43i2",
          "text": "Come in, without there!",
          "char_start": 61798,
          "char_end": 61821,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.148",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp43i3",
          "text": "Enter LENNOX",
          "char_start": 61822,
          "char_end": 61834,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp44i0",
          "text": "What's your grace's will?",
          "char_start": 61835,
          "char_end": 61860,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.149",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp45i0",
          "text": "Saw you the weird sisters?",
          "char_start": 61861,
          "char_end": 61887,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.150",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp46i0",
          "text": "No, my lord.",
          "char_start": 61888,
          "char_end": 61900,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.151",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp47i0",
          "text": "Came they not by you?",
          "char_start": 61901,
          "char_end": 61922,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.152",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp48i0",
          "text": "No, indeed, my lord.",
          "char_start": 61923,
          "char_end": 61943,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.153",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp49i0",
          "text": "Infected be the air whereon they ride;",
          "char_start": 61944,
          "char_end": 61982,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.154",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp49i1",
          "text": "And damn'd all those that trust them! I did hear",
          "char_start": 61983,
          "char_end": 62031,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.155",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp49i2",
          "text": "The galloping of horse: who was't came by?",
          "char_start": 62032,
          "char_end": 62074,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.156",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp50i0",
          "text": "'Tis two or three, my lord, that bring you word",
          "char_start": 62075,
          "char_end": 62122,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.157",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp50i1",
          "text": "Macduff is fled to England.",
          "char_start": 62123,
          "char_end": 62150,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.158",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp51i0",
          "text": "Fled to England!",
          "char_start": 62151,
          "char_end": 62167,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.159",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp52i0",
          "text": "Ay, my good lord.",
          "char_start": 62168,
          "char_end": 62185,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.160",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i0",
          "text": "Time, thou anticipatest my dread exploits:",
          "char_start": 62186,
          "char_end": 62228,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.161",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i1",
          "text": "The flighty purpose never is o'ertook",
          "char_start": 62229,
          "char_end": 62266,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.162",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i2",
          "text": "Unless the deed go with it; from this moment",
          "char_start": 62267,
          "char_end": 62311,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.163",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i3",
          "text": "The very firstlings of my heart shall be",
          "char_start": 62312,
          "char_end": 62352,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.164",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i4",
          "text": "The firstlings of my hand. And even now,",
          "char_start": 62353,
          "char_end": 62393,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.165",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i5",
          "text": "To crown my thoughts with acts, be it thought and done:",
          "char_start": 62394,
          "char_end": 62449,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.166",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i6",
          "text": "The castle of Macduff I will surprise;",
          "char_start": 62450,
          "char_end": 62488,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.167",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i7",
          "text": "Seize upon Fife; give to the edge o' the sword",
          "char_start": 62489,
          "char_end": 62535,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.168",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i8",
          "text": "His wife, his babes, and all unfortunate souls",
          "char_start": 62536,
          "char_end": 62582,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.169",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i9",
          "text": "That trace him in his line. No boasting like a fool;",
          "char_start": 62583,
          "char_end": 62635,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.170",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i10",
          "text": "This deed I'll do before this purpose cool.",
          "char_start": 62636,
          "char_end": 62679,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.171",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i11",
          "text": "But no more sights!--Where are these gentlemen?",
          "char_start": 62680,
          "char_end": 62727,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.172",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i12",
          "text": "Come, bring me where they are.",
          "char_start": 62728,
          "char_end": 62758,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "4.1.173",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s1:sp53i13",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 62759,
          "char_end": 62765,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:open",
          "text": "Enter LADY MACDUFF, her Son, and ROSS",
          "char_start": 62766,
          "char_end": 62803,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp1i0",
          "text": "What had he done, to make him fly the land?",
          "char_start": 62804,
          "char_end": 62847,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp2i0",
          "text": "You must have patience, madam.",
          "char_start": 62848,
          "char_end": 62878,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp3i0",
          "text": "He had none:",
          "char_start": 62879,
          "char_end": 62891,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp3i1",
          "text": "His flight was madness: when our actions do not,",
          "char_start": 62892,
          "char_end": 62940,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp3i2",
          "text": "Our fears do make us traitors.",
          "char_start": 62941,
          "char_end": 62971,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp4i0",
          "text": "You know not",
          "char_start": 62972,
          "char_end": 62984,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp4i1",
          "text": "Whether it was his wisdom or his fear.",
          "char_start": 62985,
          "char_end": 63023,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp5i0",
          "text": "Wisdom! to leave his wife, to leave his babes,",
          "char_start": 63024,
          "char_end": 63070,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp5i1",
          "text": "His mansion and his titles in a place",
          "char_start": 63071,
          "char_end": 63108,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp5i2",
          "text": "From whence himself does fly? He loves us not;",
          "char_start": 63109,
          "char_end": 63155,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp5i3",
          "text": "He wants the natural touch: for the poor wren,",
          "char_start": 63156,
          "char_end": 63202,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp5i4",
          "text": "The most diminutive of birds, will fight,",
          "char_start": 63203,
          "char_end": 63244,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp5i5",
          "text": "Her young ones in her nest, against the owl.",
          "char_start": 63245,
          "char_end": 63289,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp5i6",
          "text": "All is the fear and nothing is the love;",
          "char_start": 63290,
          "char_end": 63330,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp5i7",
          "text": "As little is the wisdom, where the flight",
          "char_start": 63331,
          "char_end": 63372,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp5i8",
          "text": "So runs against all reason.",
          "char_start": 63373,
          "char_end": 63400,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i0",
          "text": "My dearest coz,",
          "char_start": 63401,
          "char_end": 63416,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i1",
          "text": "I pray you, school yourself: but for your husband,",
          "char_start": 63417,
          "char_end": 63467,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i2",
          "text": "He is noble, wise, judicious, and best knows",
          "char_start": 63468,
          "char_end": 63512,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i3",
          "text": "The fits o' the season. I dare not speak",
          "char_start": 63513,
          "char_end": 63553,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i4",
          "text": "much further;",
          "char_start": 63554,
          "char_end": 63567,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i5",
          "text": "But cruel are the times, when we are traitors",
          "char_start": 63568,
          "char_end": 63613,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i6",
          "text": "And do not know ourselves, when we hold rumour",
          "char_start": 63614,
          "char_end": 63660,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i7",
          "text": "From what we fear, yet know not what we fear,",
          "char_start": 63661,
          "char_end": 63706,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i8",
          "text": "But float upon a wild and violent sea",
          "char_start": 63707,
          "char_end": 63744,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i9",
          "text": "Each way and move. I take my leave of you:",
          "char_start": 63745,
          "char_end": 63787,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i10",
          "text": "Shall not be long but I'll be here again:",
          "char_start": 63788,
          "char_end": 63829,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i11",
          "text": "Things at the worst will cease, or else climb upward",
          "char_start": 63830,
          "char_end": 63882,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i12",
          "text": "To what they were before. My pretty cousin,",
          "char_start": 63883,
          "char_end": 63926,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp6i13",
          "text": "Blessing upon you!",
          "char_start": 63927,
          "char_end": 63945,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp7i0",
          "text": "Father'd he is, and yet he's fatherless.",
          "char_start": 63946,
          "char_end": 63986,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp8i0",
          "text": "I am so much a fool, should I stay longer,",
          "char_start": 63987,
          "char_end": 64029,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp8i1",
          "text": "It would be my disgrace and your discomfort:",
          "char_start": 64030,
          "char_end": 64074,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp8i2",
          "text": "I take my leave at once.",
          "char_start": 64075,
          "char_end": 64099,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp8i3",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 64100,
          "char_end": 64104,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp9i0",
          "text": "Sirrah, your father's dead;",
          "char_start": 64105,
          "char_end": 64132,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp9i1",
          "text": "And what will you do now? How will you live?",
          "char_start": 64133,
          "char_end": 64177,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp10i0",
          "text": "As birds do, mother.",
          "char_start": 64178,
          "char_end": 64198,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp11i0",
          "text": "What, with worms and flies?",
          "char_start": 64199,
          "char_end": 64226,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp12i0",
          "text": "With what I get, I mean; and so do they.",
          "char_start": 64227,
          "char_end": 64267,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp13i0",
          "text": "Poor bird! thou'ldst never fear the net nor lime,",
          "char_start": 64268,
          "char_end": 64317,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp13i1",
          "text": "The pitfall nor the gin.",
          "char_start": 64318,
          "char_end": 64342,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp14i0",
          "text": "Why should I, mother? Poor birds they are not set for.",
          "char_start": 64343,
          "char_end": 64397,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp14i1",
          "text": "My father is not dead, for all your saying.",
          "char_start": 64398,
          "char_end": 64441,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp15i0",
          "text": "Yes, he is dead; how wilt thou do for a father?",
          "char_start": 64442,
          "char_end": 64489,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp16i0",
          "text": "Nay, how will you do for a husband?",
          "char_start": 64490,
          "char_end": 64525,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp17i0",
          "text": "Why, I can buy me twenty at any market.",
          "char_start": 64526,
          "char_end": 64565,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp18i0",
          "text": "Then you'll buy 'em to sell again.",
          "char_start": 64566,
          "char_end": 64600,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp19i0",
          "text": "Thou speak'st with all thy wit: and yet, i' faith,",
          "char_start": 64601,
          "char_end": 64651,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp19i1",
          "text": "With wit enough for thee.",
          "char_start": 64652,
          "char_end": 64677,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp20i0",
          "text": "Was my father a traitor, mother?",
          "char_start": 64678,
          "char_end": 64710,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp21i0",
          "text": "Ay, that he was.",
          "char_start": 64711,
          "char_end": 64727,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp22i0",
          "text": "What is a traitor?",
          "char_start": 64728,
          "char_end": 64746,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp23i0",
          "text": "Why, one that swears and lies.",
          "char_start": 64747,
          "char_end": 64777,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp24i0",
          "text": "And be all traitors that do so?",
          "char_start": 64778,
          "char_end": 64809,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp25i0",
          "text": "Every one that does so is a traitor, and must be hanged.",
          "char_start": 64810,
          "char_end": 64866,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp26i0",
          "text": "And must they all be hanged that swear and lie?",
          "char_start": 64867,
          "char_end": 64914,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp27i0",
          "text": "Every one.",
          "char_start": 64915,
          "char_end": 64925,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp28i0",
          "text": "Who must hang them?",
          "char_start": 64926,
          "char_end": 64945,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp29i0",
          "text": "Why, the honest men.",
          "char_start": 64946,
          "char_end": 64966,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp30i0",
          "text": "Then the liars and swearers are fools,",
          "char_start": 64967,
          "char_end": 65005,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp30i1",
          "text": "for there are liars and swearers enow to beat",
          "char_start": 65006,
          "char_end": 65051,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp30i2",
          "text": "the honest men and hang up them.",
          "char_start": 65052,
          "char_end": 65084,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp31i0",
          "text": "Now, God help thee, poor monkey!",
          "char_start": 65085,
          "char_end": 65117,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp31i1",
          "text": "But how wilt thou do for a father?",
          "char_start": 65118,
          "char_end": 65152,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp32i0",
          "text": "If he were dead, you'ld weep for",
          "char_start": 65153,
          "char_end": 65185,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp32i1",
          "text": "him: if you would not, it were a good sign",
          "char_start": 65186,
          "char_end": 65228,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp32i2",
          "text": "that I should quickly have a new father.",
          "char_start": 65229,
          "char_end": 65269,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp33i0",
          "text": "Poor prattler, how thou talk'st!",
          "char_start": 65270,
          "char_end": 65302,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp33i1",
          "text": "Enter a Messenger",
          "char_start": 65303,
          "char_end": 65320,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i0",
          "text": "Bless you, fair dame! I am not to you known,",
          "char_start": 65321,
          "char_end": 65365,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i1",
          "text": "Though in your state of honour I am perfect.",
          "char_start": 65366,
          "char_end": 65410,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i2",
          "text": "I doubt some danger does approach you nearly:",
          "char_start": 65411,
          "char_end": 65456,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i3",
          "text": "If you will take a homely man's advice,",
          "char_start": 65457,
          "char_end": 65496,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i4",
          "text": "Be not found here; hence, with your little ones.",
          "char_start": 65497,
          "char_end": 65545,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i5",
          "text": "To fright you thus, methinks, I am too savage;",
          "char_start": 65546,
          "char_end": 65592,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i6",
          "text": "To do worse to you were fell cruelty,",
          "char_start": 65593,
          "char_end": 65630,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i7",
          "text": "Which is too nigh your person. Heaven preserve you!",
          "char_start": 65631,
          "char_end": 65682,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i8",
          "text": "I dare abide no longer.",
          "char_start": 65683,
          "char_end": 65706,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp34i9",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 65707,
          "char_end": 65711,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp35i0",
          "text": "Whither should I fly?",
          "char_start": 65712,
          "char_end": 65733,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp35i1",
          "text": "I have done no harm. But I remember now",
          "char_start": 65734,
          "char_end": 65773,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp35i2",
          "text": "I am in this earthly world; where to do harm",
          "char_start": 65774,
          "char_end": 65818,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp35i3",
          "text": "Is often laudable, to do good sometime",
          "char_start": 65819,
          "char_end": 65857,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp35i4",
          "text": "Accounted dangerous folly: why then, alas,",
          "char_start": 65858,
          "char_end": 65900,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp35i5",
          "text": "Do I put up that womanly defence,",
          "char_start": 65901,
          "char_end": 65934,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp35i6",
          "text": "To say I have done no harm?",
          "char_start": 65935,
          "char_end": 65962,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp35i7",
          "text": "Enter Murderers",
          "char_start": 65963,
          "char_end": 65978,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp35i8",
          "text": "What are these faces?",
          "char_start": 65979,
          "char_end": 66000,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp36i0",
          "text": "Where is your husband?",
          "char_start": 66001,
          "char_end": 66023,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp37i0",
          "text": "I hope, in no place so unsanctified",
          "char_start": 66024,
          "char_end": 66059,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.87",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp37i1",
          "text": "Where such as thou mayst find him.",
          "char_start": 66060,
          "char_end": 66094,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.88",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp38i0",
          "text": "He's a traitor.",
          "char_start": 66095,
          "char_end": 66110,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.89",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp39i0",
          "text": "Thou liest, thou shag-hair'd villain!",
          "char_start": 66111,
          "char_end": 66148,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.90",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp40i0",
          "text": "What, you egg!",
          "char_start": 66149,
          "char_end": 66163,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.91",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp40i1",
          "text": "Stabbing him",
          "char_start": 66164,
          "char_end": 66176,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp40i2",
          "text": "Young fry of treachery!",
          "char_start": 66177,
          "char_end": 66200,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.92",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "First Murderer"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp41i0",
          "text": "He has kill'd me, mother:",
          "char_start": 66201,
          "char_end": 66226,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.93",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp41i1",
          "text": "Run away, I pray you!",
          "char_start": 66227,
          "char_end": 66248,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "4.2.94",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp41i2",
          "text": "Dies",
          "char_start": 66249,
          "char_end": 66253,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s2:sp41i3",
          "text": "Exit LADY MACDUFF, crying 'Murder!' Exeunt Murderers, following her",
          "char_start": 66254,
          "char_end": 66321,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Son"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:open",
          "text": "Enter MALCOLM and MACDUFF",
          "char_start": 66322,
          "char_end": 66347,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp1i0",
          "text": "Let us seek out some desolate shade, and there",
          "char_start": 66348,
          "char_end": 66394,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp1i1",
          "text": "Weep our sad bosoms empty.",
          "char_start": 66395,
          "char_end": 66421,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp2i0",
          "text": "Let us rather",
          "char_start": 66422,
          "char_end": 66435,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp2i1",
          "text": "Hold fast the mortal sword, and like good men",
          "char_start": 66436,
          "char_end": 66481,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp2i2",
          "text": "Bestride our down-fall'n birthdom: each new morn",
          "char_start": 66482,
          "char_end": 66530,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp2i3",
          "text": "New widows howl, new orphans cry, new sorrows",
          "char_start": 66531,
          "char_end": 66576,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp2i4",
          "text": "Strike heaven on the face, that it resounds",
          "char_start": 66577,
          "char_end": 66620,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp2i5",
          "text": "As if it felt with Scotland and yell'd out",
          "char_start": 66621,
          "char_end": 66663,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp2i6",
          "text": "Like syllable of dolour.",
          "char_start": 66664,
          "char_end": 66688,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i0",
          "text": "What I believe I'll wail,",
          "char_start": 66689,
          "char_end": 66714,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i1",
          "text": "What know believe, and what I can redress,",
          "char_start": 66715,
          "char_end": 66757,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i2",
          "text": "As I shall find the time to friend, I will.",
          "char_start": 66758,
          "char_end": 66801,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i3",
          "text": "What you have spoke, it may be so perchance.",
          "char_start": 66802,
          "char_end": 66846,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i4",
          "text": "This tyrant, whose sole name blisters our tongues,",
          "char_start": 66847,
          "char_end": 66897,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i5",
          "text": "Was once thought honest: you have loved him well.",
          "char_start": 66898,
          "char_end": 66947,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i6",
          "text": "He hath not touch'd you yet. I am young;",
          "char_start": 66948,
          "char_end": 66988,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i7",
          "text": "but something",
          "char_start": 66989,
          "char_end": 67002,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i8",
          "text": "You may deserve of him through me, and wisdom",
          "char_start": 67003,
          "char_end": 67048,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i9",
          "text": "To offer up a weak poor innocent lamb",
          "char_start": 67049,
          "char_end": 67086,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp3i10",
          "text": "To appease an angry god.",
          "char_start": 67087,
          "char_end": 67111,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp4i0",
          "text": "I am not treacherous.",
          "char_start": 67112,
          "char_end": 67133,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp5i0",
          "text": "But Macbeth is.",
          "char_start": 67134,
          "char_end": 67149,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp5i1",
          "text": "A good and virtuous nature may recoil",
          "char_start": 67150,
          "char_end": 67187,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp5i2",
          "text": "In an imperial charge. But I shall crave",
          "char_start": 67188,
          "char_end": 67228,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp5i3",
          "text": "your pardon;",
          "char_start": 67229,
          "char_end": 67241,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp5i4",
          "text": "That which you are my thoughts cannot transpose:",
          "char_start": 67242,
          "char_end": 67290,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp5i5",
          "text": "Angels are bright still, though the brightest fell;",
          "char_start": 67291,
          "char_end": 67342,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp5i6",
          "text": "Though all things foul would wear the brows of grace,",
          "char_start": 67343,
          "char_end": 67396,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp5i7",
          "text": "Yet grace must still look so.",
          "char_start": 67397,
          "char_end": 67426,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp6i0",
          "text": "I have lost my hopes.",
          "char_start": 67427,
          "char_end": 67448,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp7i0",
          "text": "Perchance even there where I did find my doubts.",
          "char_start": 67449,
          "char_end": 67497,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp7i1",
          "text": "Why in that rawness left you wife and child,",
          "char_start": 67498,
          "char_end": 67542,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp7i2",
          "text": "Those precious motives, those strong knots of love,",
          "char_start": 67543,
          "char_end": 67594,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp7i3",
          "text": "Without leave-taking? I pray you,",
          "char_start": 67595,
          "char_end": 67628,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp7i4",
          "text": "Let not my jealousies be your dishonours,",
          "char_start": 67629,
          "char_end": 67670,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp7i5",
          "text": "But mine own safeties. You may be rightly just,",
          "char_start": 67671,
          "char_end": 67718,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp7i6",
          "text": "Whatever I shall think.",
          "char_start": 67719,
          "char_end": 67742,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp8i0",
          "text": "Bleed, bleed, poor country!",
          "char_start": 67743,
          "char_end": 67770,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp8i1",
          "text": "Great tyranny! lay thou thy basis sure,",
          "char_start": 67771,
          "char_end": 67810,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp8i2",
          "text": "For goodness dare not cheque thee: wear thou",
          "char_start": 67811,
          "char_end": 67855,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp8i3",
          "text": "thy wrongs;",
          "char_start": 67856,
          "char_end": 67867,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp8i4",
          "text": "The title is affeer'd! Fare thee well, lord:",
          "char_start": 67868,
          "char_end": 67912,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp8i5",
          "text": "I would not be the villain that thou think'st",
          "char_start": 67913,
          "char_end": 67958,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp8i6",
          "text": "For the whole space that's in the tyrant's grasp,",
          "char_start": 67959,
          "char_end": 68008,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp8i7",
          "text": "And the rich East to boot.",
          "char_start": 68009,
          "char_end": 68035,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i0",
          "text": "Be not offended:",
          "char_start": 68036,
          "char_end": 68052,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i1",
          "text": "I speak not as in absolute fear of you.",
          "char_start": 68053,
          "char_end": 68092,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i2",
          "text": "I think our country sinks beneath the yoke;",
          "char_start": 68093,
          "char_end": 68136,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i3",
          "text": "It weeps, it bleeds; and each new day a gash",
          "char_start": 68137,
          "char_end": 68181,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i4",
          "text": "Is added to her wounds: I think withal",
          "char_start": 68182,
          "char_end": 68220,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i5",
          "text": "There would be hands uplifted in my right;",
          "char_start": 68221,
          "char_end": 68263,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i6",
          "text": "And here from gracious England have I offer",
          "char_start": 68264,
          "char_end": 68307,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i7",
          "text": "Of goodly thousands: but, for all this,",
          "char_start": 68308,
          "char_end": 68347,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i8",
          "text": "When I shall tread upon the tyrant's head,",
          "char_start": 68348,
          "char_end": 68390,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i9",
          "text": "Or wear it on my sword, yet my poor country",
          "char_start": 68391,
          "char_end": 68434,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i10",
          "text": "Shall have more vices than it had before,",
          "char_start": 68435,
          "char_end": 68476,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i11",
          "text": "More suffer and more sundry ways than ever,",
          "char_start": 68477,
          "char_end": 68520,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp9i12",
          "text": "By him that shall succeed.",
          "char_start": 68521,
          "char_end": 68547,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp10i0",
          "text": "What should he be?",
          "char_start": 68548,
          "char_end": 68566,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp11i0",
          "text": "It is myself I mean: in whom I know",
          "char_start": 68567,
          "char_end": 68602,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp11i1",
          "text": "All the particulars of vice so grafted",
          "char_start": 68603,
          "char_end": 68641,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp11i2",
          "text": "That, when they shall be open'd, black Macbeth",
          "char_start": 68642,
          "char_end": 68688,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp11i3",
          "text": "Will seem as pure as snow, and the poor state",
          "char_start": 68689,
          "char_end": 68734,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp11i4",
          "text": "Esteem him as a lamb, being compared",
          "char_start": 68735,
          "char_end": 68771,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp11i5",
          "text": "With my confineless harms.",
          "char_start": 68772,
          "char_end": 68798,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp12i0",
          "text": "Not in the legions",
          "char_start": 68799,
          "char_end": 68817,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp12i1",
          "text": "Of horrid hell can come a devil more damn'd",
          "char_start": 68818,
          "char_end": 68861,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp12i2",
          "text": "In evils to top Macbeth.",
          "char_start": 68862,
          "char_end": 68886,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i0",
          "text": "I grant him bloody,",
          "char_start": 68887,
          "char_end": 68906,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i1",
          "text": "Luxurious, avaricious, false, deceitful,",
          "char_start": 68907,
          "char_end": 68947,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i2",
          "text": "Sudden, malicious, smacking of every sin",
          "char_start": 68948,
          "char_end": 68988,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i3",
          "text": "That has a name: but there's no bottom, none,",
          "char_start": 68989,
          "char_end": 69034,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i4",
          "text": "In my voluptuousness: your wives, your daughters,",
          "char_start": 69035,
          "char_end": 69084,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i5",
          "text": "Your matrons and your maids, could not fill up",
          "char_start": 69085,
          "char_end": 69131,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i6",
          "text": "The cistern of my lust, and my desire",
          "char_start": 69132,
          "char_end": 69169,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i7",
          "text": "All continent impediments would o'erbear",
          "char_start": 69170,
          "char_end": 69210,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i8",
          "text": "That did oppose my will: better Macbeth",
          "char_start": 69211,
          "char_end": 69250,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp13i9",
          "text": "Than such an one to reign.",
          "char_start": 69251,
          "char_end": 69277,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i0",
          "text": "Boundless intemperance",
          "char_start": 69278,
          "char_end": 69300,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i1",
          "text": "In nature is a tyranny; it hath been",
          "char_start": 69301,
          "char_end": 69337,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i2",
          "text": "The untimely emptying of the happy throne",
          "char_start": 69338,
          "char_end": 69379,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i3",
          "text": "And fall of many kings. But fear not yet",
          "char_start": 69380,
          "char_end": 69420,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i4",
          "text": "To take upon you what is yours: you may",
          "char_start": 69421,
          "char_end": 69460,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i5",
          "text": "Convey your pleasures in a spacious plenty,",
          "char_start": 69461,
          "char_end": 69504,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i6",
          "text": "And yet seem cold, the time you may so hoodwink.",
          "char_start": 69505,
          "char_end": 69553,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i7",
          "text": "We have willing dames enough: there cannot be",
          "char_start": 69554,
          "char_end": 69599,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i8",
          "text": "That vulture in you, to devour so many",
          "char_start": 69600,
          "char_end": 69638,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.87",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i9",
          "text": "As will to greatness dedicate themselves,",
          "char_start": 69639,
          "char_end": 69680,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.88",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp14i10",
          "text": "Finding it so inclined.",
          "char_start": 69681,
          "char_end": 69704,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.89",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp15i0",
          "text": "With this there grows",
          "char_start": 69705,
          "char_end": 69726,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.90",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp15i1",
          "text": "In my most ill-composed affection such",
          "char_start": 69727,
          "char_end": 69765,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.91",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp15i2",
          "text": "A stanchless avarice that, were I king,",
          "char_start": 69766,
          "char_end": 69805,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.92",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp15i3",
          "text": "I should cut off the nobles for their lands,",
          "char_start": 69806,
          "char_end": 69850,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.93",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp15i4",
          "text": "Desire his jewels and this other's house:",
          "char_start": 69851,
          "char_end": 69892,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.94",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp15i5",
          "text": "And my more-having would be as a sauce",
          "char_start": 69893,
          "char_end": 69931,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.95",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp15i6",
          "text": "To make me hunger more; that I should forge",
          "char_start": 69932,
          "char_end": 69975,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.96",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp15i7",
          "text": "Quarrels unjust against the good and loyal,",
          "char_start": 69976,
          "char_end": 70019,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.97",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp15i8",
          "text": "Destroying them for wealth.",
          "char_start": 70020,
          "char_end": 70047,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.98",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp16i0",
          "text": "This avarice",
          "char_start": 70048,
          "char_end": 70060,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.99",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp16i1",
          "text": "Sticks deeper, grows with more pernicious root",
          "char_start": 70061,
          "char_end": 70107,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.100",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp16i2",
          "text": "Than summer-seeming lust, and it hath been",
          "char_start": 70108,
          "char_end": 70150,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.101",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp16i3",
          "text": "The sword of our slain kings: yet do not fear;",
          "char_start": 70151,
          "char_end": 70197,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.102",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp16i4",
          "text": "Scotland hath foisons to fill up your will.",
          "char_start": 70198,
          "char_end": 70241,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.103",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp16i5",
          "text": "Of your mere own: all these are portable,",
          "char_start": 70242,
          "char_end": 70283,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.104",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp16i6",
          "text": "With other graces weigh'd.",
          "char_start": 70284,
          "char_end": 70310,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.105",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i0",
          "text": "But I have none: the king-becoming graces,",
          "char_start": 70311,
          "char_end": 70353,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.106",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i1",
          "text": "As justice, verity, temperance, stableness,",
          "char_start": 70354,
          "char_end": 70397,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.107",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i2",
          "text": "Bounty, perseverance, mercy, lowliness,",
          "char_start": 70398,
          "char_end": 70437,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.108",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i3",
          "text": "Devotion, patience, courage, fortitude,",
          "char_start": 70438,
          "char_end": 70477,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.109",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i4",
          "text": "I have no relish of them, but abound",
          "char_start": 70478,
          "char_end": 70514,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.110",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i5",
          "text": "In the division of each several crime,",
          "char_start": 70515,
          "char_end": 70553,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.111",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i6",
          "text": "Acting it many ways. Nay, had I power, I should",
          "char_start": 70554,
          "char_end": 70601,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.112",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i7",
          "text": "Pour the sweet milk of concord into hell,",
          "char_start": 70602,
          "char_end": 70643,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.113",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i8",
          "text": "Uproar the universal peace, confound",
          "char_start": 70644,
          "char_end": 70680,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.114",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp17i9",
          "text": "All unity on earth.",
          "char_start": 70681,
          "char_end": 70700,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.115",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp18i0",
          "text": "O Scotland, Scotland!",
          "char_start": 70701,
          "char_end": 70722,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.116",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp19i0",
          "text": "If such a one be fit to govern, speak:",
          "char_start": 70723,
          "char_end": 70761,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.117",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp19i1",
          "text": "I am as I have spoken.",
          "char_start": 70762,
          "char_end": 70784,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.118",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i0",
          "text": "Fit to govern!",
          "char_start": 70785,
          "char_end": 70799,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.119",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i1",
          "text": "No, not to live. O nation miserable,",
          "char_start": 70800,
          "char_end": 70836,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.120",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i2",
          "text": "With an untitled tyrant bloody-scepter'd,",
          "char_start": 70837,
          "char_end": 70878,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.121",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i3",
          "text": "When shalt thou see thy wholesome days again,",
          "char_start": 70879,
          "char_end": 70924,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.122",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i4",
          "text": "Since that the truest issue of thy throne",
          "char_start": 70925,
          "char_end": 70966,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.123",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i5",
          "text": "By his own interdiction stands accursed,",
          "char_start": 70967,
          "char_end": 71007,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.124",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i6",
          "text": "And does blaspheme his breed? Thy royal father",
          "char_start": 71008,
          "char_end": 71054,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.125",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i7",
          "text": "Was a most sainted king: the queen that bore thee,",
          "char_start": 71055,
          "char_end": 71105,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.126",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i8",
          "text": "Oftener upon her knees than on her feet,",
          "char_start": 71106,
          "char_end": 71146,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.127",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i9",
          "text": "Died every day she lived. Fare thee well!",
          "char_start": 71147,
          "char_end": 71188,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.128",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i10",
          "text": "These evils thou repeat'st upon thyself",
          "char_start": 71189,
          "char_end": 71228,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.129",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i11",
          "text": "Have banish'd me from Scotland. O my breast,",
          "char_start": 71229,
          "char_end": 71273,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.130",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp20i12",
          "text": "Thy hope ends here!",
          "char_start": 71274,
          "char_end": 71293,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.131",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i0",
          "text": "Macduff, this noble passion,",
          "char_start": 71294,
          "char_end": 71322,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.132",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i1",
          "text": "Child of integrity, hath from my soul",
          "char_start": 71323,
          "char_end": 71360,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.133",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i2",
          "text": "Wiped the black scruples, reconciled my thoughts",
          "char_start": 71361,
          "char_end": 71409,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.134",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i3",
          "text": "To thy good truth and honour. Devilish Macbeth",
          "char_start": 71410,
          "char_end": 71456,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.135",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i4",
          "text": "By many of these trains hath sought to win me",
          "char_start": 71457,
          "char_end": 71502,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.136",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i5",
          "text": "Into his power, and modest wisdom plucks me",
          "char_start": 71503,
          "char_end": 71546,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.137",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i6",
          "text": "From over-credulous haste: but God above",
          "char_start": 71547,
          "char_end": 71587,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.138",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i7",
          "text": "Deal between thee and me! for even now",
          "char_start": 71588,
          "char_end": 71626,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.139",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i8",
          "text": "I put myself to thy direction, and",
          "char_start": 71627,
          "char_end": 71661,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.140",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i9",
          "text": "Unspeak mine own detraction, here abjure",
          "char_start": 71662,
          "char_end": 71702,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.141",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i10",
          "text": "The taints and blames I laid upon myself,",
          "char_start": 71703,
          "char_end": 71744,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.142",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i11",
          "text": "For strangers to my nature. I am yet",
          "char_start": 71745,
          "char_end": 71781,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.143",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i12",
          "text": "Unknown to woman, never was forsworn,",
          "char_start": 71782,
          "char_end": 71819,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.144",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i13",
          "text": "Scarcely have coveted what was mine own,",
          "char_start": 71820,
          "char_end": 71860,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.145",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i14",
          "text": "At no time broke my faith, would not betray",
          "char_start": 71861,
          "char_end": 71904,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.146",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i15",
          "text": "The devil to his fellow and delight",
          "char_start": 71905,
          "char_end": 71940,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.147",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i16",
          "text": "No less in truth than life: my first false speaking",
          "char_start": 71941,
          "char_end": 71992,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.148",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i17",
          "text": "Was this upon myself: what I am truly,",
          "char_start": 71993,
          "char_end": 72031,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.149",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i18",
          "text": "Is thine and my poor country's to command:",
          "char_start": 72032,
          "char_end": 72074,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.150",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i19",
          "text": "Whither indeed, before thy here-approach,",
          "char_start": 72075,
          "char_end": 72116,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.151",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i20",
          "text": "Old Siward, with ten thousand warlike men,",
          "char_start": 72117,
          "char_end": 72159,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.152",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i21",
          "text": "Already at a point, was setting forth.",
          "char_start": 72160,
          "char_end": 72198,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.153",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i22",
          "text": "Now we'll together; and the chance of goodness",
          "char_start": 72199,
          "char_end": 72245,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.154",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp21i23",
          "text": "Be like our warranted quarrel! Why are you silent?",
          "char_start": 72246,
          "char_end": 72296,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.155",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp22i0",
          "text": "Such welcome and unwelcome things at once",
          "char_start": 72297,
          "char_end": 72338,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.156",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp22i1",
          "text": "'Tis hard to reconcile.",
          "char_start": 72339,
          "char_end": 72362,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.157",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp22i2",
          "text": "Enter a Doctor",
          "char_start": 72363,
          "char_end": 72377,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp23i0",
          "text": "Well; more anon.--Comes the king forth, I pray you?",
          "char_start": 72378,
          "char_end": 72429,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.158",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp24i0",
          "text": "Ay, sir; there are a crew of wretched souls",
          "char_start": 72430,
          "char_end": 72473,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.159",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp24i1",
          "text": "That stay his cure: their malady convinces",
          "char_start": 72474,
          "char_end": 72516,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.160",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp24i2",
          "text": "The great assay of art; but at his touch--",
          "char_start": 72517,
          "char_end": 72559,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.161",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp24i3",
          "text": "Such sanctity hath heaven given his hand--",
          "char_start": 72560,
          "char_end": 72602,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.162",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp24i4",
          "text": "They presently amend.",
          "char_start": 72603,
          "char_end": 72624,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.163",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp25i0",
          "text": "I thank you, doctor.",
          "char_start": 72625,
          "char_end": 72645,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.164",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp25i1",
          "text": "Exit Doctor",
          "char_start": 72646,
          "char_end": 72657,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp26i0",
          "text": "What's the disease he means?",
          "char_start": 72658,
          "char_end": 72686,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.165",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i0",
          "text": "'Tis call'd the evil:",
          "char_start": 72687,
          "char_end": 72708,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.166",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i1",
          "text": "A most miraculous work in this good king;",
          "char_start": 72709,
          "char_end": 72750,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.167",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i2",
          "text": "Which often, since my here-remain in England,",
          "char_start": 72751,
          "char_end": 72796,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.168",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i3",
          "text": "I have seen him do. How he solicits heaven,",
          "char_start": 72797,
          "char_end": 72840,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.169",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i4",
          "text": "Himself best knows: but strangely-visited people,",
          "char_start": 72841,
          "char_end": 72890,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.170",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i5",
          "text": "All swoln and ulcerous, pitiful to the eye,",
          "char_start": 72891,
          "char_end": 72934,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.171",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i6",
          "text": "The mere despair of surgery, he cures,",
          "char_start": 72935,
          "char_end": 72973,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.172",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i7",
          "text": "Hanging a golden stamp about their necks,",
          "char_start": 72974,
          "char_end": 73015,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.173",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i8",
          "text": "Put on with holy prayers: and 'tis spoken,",
          "char_start": 73016,
          "char_end": 73058,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.174",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i9",
          "text": "To the succeeding royalty he leaves",
          "char_start": 73059,
          "char_end": 73094,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.175",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i10",
          "text": "The healing benediction. With this strange virtue,",
          "char_start": 73095,
          "char_end": 73145,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.176",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i11",
          "text": "He hath a heavenly gift of prophecy,",
          "char_start": 73146,
          "char_end": 73182,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.177",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i12",
          "text": "And sundry blessings hang about his throne,",
          "char_start": 73183,
          "char_end": 73226,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.178",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i13",
          "text": "That speak him full of grace.",
          "char_start": 73227,
          "char_end": 73256,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.179",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp27i14",
          "text": "Enter ROSS",
          "char_start": 73257,
          "char_end": 73267,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp28i0",
          "text": "See, who comes here?",
          "char_start": 73268,
          "char_end": 73288,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.180",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp29i0",
          "text": "My countryman; but yet I know him not.",
          "char_start": 73289,
          "char_end": 73327,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.181",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp30i0",
          "text": "My ever-gentle cousin, welcome hither.",
          "char_start": 73328,
          "char_end": 73366,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.182",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp31i0",
          "text": "I know him now. Good God, betimes remove",
          "char_start": 73367,
          "char_end": 73407,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.183",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp31i1",
          "text": "The means that makes us strangers!",
          "char_start": 73408,
          "char_end": 73442,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.184",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp32i0",
          "text": "Sir, amen.",
          "char_start": 73443,
          "char_end": 73453,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.185",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp33i0",
          "text": "Stands Scotland where it did?",
          "char_start": 73454,
          "char_end": 73483,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.186",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i0",
          "text": "Alas, poor country!",
          "char_start": 73484,
          "char_end": 73503,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.187",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i1",
          "text": "Almost afraid to know itself. It cannot",
          "char_start": 73504,
          "char_end": 73543,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.188",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i2",
          "text": "Be call'd our mother, but our grave; where nothing,",
          "char_start": 73544,
          "char_end": 73595,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.189",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i3",
          "text": "But who knows nothing, is once seen to smile;",
          "char_start": 73596,
          "char_end": 73641,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.190",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i4",
          "text": "Where sighs and groans and shrieks that rend the air",
          "char_start": 73642,
          "char_end": 73694,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.191",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i5",
          "text": "Are made, not mark'd; where violent sorrow seems",
          "char_start": 73695,
          "char_end": 73743,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.192",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i6",
          "text": "A modern ecstasy; the dead man's knell",
          "char_start": 73744,
          "char_end": 73782,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.193",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i7",
          "text": "Is there scarce ask'd for who; and good men's lives",
          "char_start": 73783,
          "char_end": 73834,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.194",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i8",
          "text": "Expire before the flowers in their caps,",
          "char_start": 73835,
          "char_end": 73875,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.195",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp34i9",
          "text": "Dying or ere they sicken.",
          "char_start": 73876,
          "char_end": 73901,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.196",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp35i0",
          "text": "O, relation",
          "char_start": 73902,
          "char_end": 73913,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.197",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp35i1",
          "text": "Too nice, and yet too true!",
          "char_start": 73914,
          "char_end": 73941,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.198",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp36i0",
          "text": "What's the newest grief?",
          "char_start": 73942,
          "char_end": 73966,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.199",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp37i0",
          "text": "That of an hour's age doth hiss the speaker:",
          "char_start": 73967,
          "char_end": 74011,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.200",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp37i1",
          "text": "Each minute teems a new one.",
          "char_start": 74012,
          "char_end": 74040,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.201",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp38i0",
          "text": "How does my wife?",
          "char_start": 74041,
          "char_end": 74058,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.202",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp39i0",
          "text": "Why, well.",
          "char_start": 74059,
          "char_end": 74069,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.203",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp40i0",
          "text": "And all my children?",
          "char_start": 74070,
          "char_end": 74090,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.204",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp41i0",
          "text": "Well too.",
          "char_start": 74091,
          "char_end": 74100,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.205",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp42i0",
          "text": "The tyrant has not batter'd at their peace?",
          "char_start": 74101,
          "char_end": 74144,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.206",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp43i0",
          "text": "No; they were well at peace when I did leave 'em.",
          "char_start": 74145,
          "char_end": 74194,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.207",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp44i0",
          "text": "But not a niggard of your speech: how goes't?",
          "char_start": 74195,
          "char_end": 74240,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.208",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp45i0",
          "text": "When I came hither to transport the tidings,",
          "char_start": 74241,
          "char_end": 74285,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.209",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp45i1",
          "text": "Which I have heavily borne, there ran a rumour",
          "char_start": 74286,
          "char_end": 74332,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.210",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp45i2",
          "text": "Of many worthy fellows that were out;",
          "char_start": 74333,
          "char_end": 74370,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.211",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp45i3",
          "text": "Which was to my belief witness'd the rather,",
          "char_start": 74371,
          "char_end": 74415,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.212",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp45i4",
          "text": "For that I saw the tyrant's power a-foot:",
          "char_start": 74416,
          "char_end": 74457,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.213",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp45i5",
          "text": "Now is the time of help; your eye in Scotland",
          "char_start": 74458,
          "char_end": 74503,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.214",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp45i6",
          "text": "Would create soldiers, make our women fight,",
          "char_start": 74504,
          "char_end": 74548,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.215",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp45i7",
          "text": "To doff their dire distresses.",
          "char_start": 74549,
          "char_end": 74579,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.216",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp46i0",
          "text": "Be't their comfort",
          "char_start": 74580,
          "char_end": 74598,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.217",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp46i1",
          "text": "We are coming thither: gracious England hath",
          "char_start": 74599,
          "char_end": 74643,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.218",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp46i2",
          "text": "Lent us good Siward and ten thousand men;",
          "char_start": 74644,
          "char_end": 74685,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.219",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp46i3",
          "text": "An older and a better soldier none",
          "char_start": 74686,
          "char_end": 74720,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.220",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp46i4",
          "text": "That Christendom gives out.",
          "char_start": 74721,
          "char_end": 74748,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.221",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp47i0",
          "text": "Would I could answer",
          "char_start": 74749,
          "char_end": 74769,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.222",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp47i1",
          "text": "This comfort with the like! But I have words",
          "char_start": 74770,
          "char_end": 74814,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.223",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp47i2",
          "text": "That would be howl'd out in the desert air,",
          "char_start": 74815,
          "char_end": 74858,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.224",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp47i3",
          "text": "Where hearing should not latch them.",
          "char_start": 74859,
          "char_end": 74895,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.225",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp48i0",
          "text": "What concern they?",
          "char_start": 74896,
          "char_end": 74914,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.226",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp48i1",
          "text": "The general cause? or is it a fee-grief",
          "char_start": 74915,
          "char_end": 74954,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.227",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp48i2",
          "text": "Due to some single breast?",
          "char_start": 74955,
          "char_end": 74981,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.228",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp49i0",
          "text": "No mind that's honest",
          "char_start": 74982,
          "char_end": 75003,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.229",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp49i1",
          "text": "But in it shares some woe; though the main part",
          "char_start": 75004,
          "char_end": 75051,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.230",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp49i2",
          "text": "Pertains to you alone.",
          "char_start": 75052,
          "char_end": 75074,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.231",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp50i0",
          "text": "If it be mine,",
          "char_start": 75075,
          "char_end": 75089,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.232",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp50i1",
          "text": "Keep it not from me, quickly let me have it.",
          "char_start": 75090,
          "char_end": 75134,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.233",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp51i0",
          "text": "Let not your ears despise my tongue for ever,",
          "char_start": 75135,
          "char_end": 75180,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.234",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp51i1",
          "text": "Which shall possess them with the heaviest sound",
          "char_start": 75181,
          "char_end": 75229,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.235",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp51i2",
          "text": "That ever yet they heard.",
          "char_start": 75230,
          "char_end": 75255,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.236",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp52i0",
          "text": "Hum! I guess at it.",
          "char_start": 75256,
          "char_end": 75275,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.237",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp53i0",
          "text": "Your castle is surprised; your wife and babes",
          "char_start": 75276,
          "char_end": 75321,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.238",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp53i1",
          "text": "Savagely slaughter'd: to relate the manner,",
          "char_start": 75322,
          "char_end": 75365,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.239",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp53i2",
          "text": "Were, on the quarry of these murder'd deer,",
          "char_start": 75366,
          "char_end": 75409,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.240",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp53i3",
          "text": "To add the death of you.",
          "char_start": 75410,
          "char_end": 75434,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.241",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp54i0",
          "text": "Merciful heaven!",
          "char_start": 75435,
          "char_end": 75451,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.242",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp54i1",
          "text": "What, man! ne'er pull your hat upon your brows;",
          "char_start": 75452,
          "char_end": 75499,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.243",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp54i2",
          "text": "Give sorrow words: the grief that does not speak",
          "char_start": 75500,
          "char_end": 75548,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.244",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp54i3",
          "text": "Whispers the o'er-fraught heart and bids it break.",
          "char_start": 75549,
          "char_end": 75599,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.245",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp55i0",
          "text": "My children too?",
          "char_start": 75600,
          "char_end": 75616,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.246",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp56i0",
          "text": "Wife, children, servants, all",
          "char_start": 75617,
          "char_end": 75646,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.247",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp56i1",
          "text": "That could be found.",
          "char_start": 75647,
          "char_end": 75667,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.248",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp57i0",
          "text": "And I must be from thence!",
          "char_start": 75668,
          "char_end": 75694,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.249",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp57i1",
          "text": "My wife kill'd too?",
          "char_start": 75695,
          "char_end": 75714,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.250",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp58i0",
          "text": "I have said.",
          "char_start": 75715,
          "char_end": 75727,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.251",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp59i0",
          "text": "Be comforted:",
          "char_start": 75728,
          "char_end": 75741,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.252",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp59i1",
          "text": "Let's make us medicines of our great revenge,",
          "char_start": 75742,
          "char_end": 75787,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.253",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp59i2",
          "text": "To cure this deadly grief.",
          "char_start": 75788,
          "char_end": 75814,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.254",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp60i0",
          "text": "He has no children. All my pretty ones?",
          "char_start": 75815,
          "char_end": 75854,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.255",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp60i1",
          "text": "Did you say all? O hell-kite! All?",
          "char_start": 75855,
          "char_end": 75889,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.256",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp60i2",
          "text": "What, all my pretty chickens and their dam",
          "char_start": 75890,
          "char_end": 75932,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.257",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp60i3",
          "text": "At one fell swoop?",
          "char_start": 75933,
          "char_end": 75951,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.258",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp61i0",
          "text": "Dispute it like a man.",
          "char_start": 75952,
          "char_end": 75974,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.259",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp62i0",
          "text": "I shall do so;",
          "char_start": 75975,
          "char_end": 75989,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.260",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp62i1",
          "text": "But I must also feel it as a man:",
          "char_start": 75990,
          "char_end": 76023,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.261",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp62i2",
          "text": "I cannot but remember such things were,",
          "char_start": 76024,
          "char_end": 76063,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.262",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp62i3",
          "text": "That were most precious to me. Did heaven look on,",
          "char_start": 76064,
          "char_end": 76114,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.263",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp62i4",
          "text": "And would not take their part? Sinful Macduff,",
          "char_start": 76115,
          "char_end": 76161,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.264",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp62i5",
          "text": "They were all struck for thee! naught that I am,",
          "char_start": 76162,
          "char_end": 76210,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.265",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp62i6",
          "text": "Not for their own demerits, but for mine,",
          "char_start": 76211,
          "char_end": 76252,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.266",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp62i7",
          "text": "Fell slaughter on their souls. Heaven rest them now!",
          "char_start": 76253,
          "char_end": 76305,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.267",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp63i0",
          "text": "Be this the whetstone of your sword: let grief",
          "char_start": 76306,
          "char_end": 76352,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.268",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp63i1",
          "text": "Convert to anger; blunt not the heart, enrage it.",
          "char_start": 76353,
          "char_end": 76402,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.269",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp64i0",
          "text": "O, I could play the woman with mine eyes",
          "char_start": 76403,
          "char_end": 76443,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.270",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp64i1",
          "text": "And braggart with my tongue! But, gentle heavens,",
          "char_start": 76444,
          "char_end": 76493,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.271",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp64i2",
          "text": "Cut short all intermission; front to front",
          "char_start": 76494,
          "char_end": 76536,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.272",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp64i3",
          "text": "Bring thou this fiend of Scotland and myself;",
          "char_start": 76537,
          "char_end": 76582,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.273",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp64i4",
          "text": "Within my sword's length set him; if he 'scape,",
          "char_start": 76583,
          "char_end": 76630,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.274",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp64i5",
          "text": "Heaven forgive him too!",
          "char_start": 76631,
          "char_end": 76654,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.275",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp65i0",
          "text": "This tune goes manly.",
          "char_start": 76655,
          "char_end": 76676,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.276",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp65i1",
          "text": "Come, go we to the king; our power is ready;",
          "char_start": 76677,
          "char_end": 76721,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.277",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp65i2",
          "text": "Our lack is nothing but our leave; Macbeth",
          "char_start": 76722,
          "char_end": 76764,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.278",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp65i3",
          "text": "Is ripe for shaking, and the powers above",
          "char_start": 76765,
          "char_end": 76806,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.279",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp65i4",
          "text": "Put on their instruments. Receive what cheer you may:",
          "char_start": 76807,
          "char_end": 76860,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.280",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp65i5",
          "text": "The night is long that never finds the day.",
          "char_start": 76861,
          "char_end": 76904,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "4.3.281",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a4s3:sp65i6",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 76905,
          "char_end": 76911,
          "act": 4,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:open",
          "text": "Enter a Doctor of Physic and a Waiting-Gentlewoman",
          "char_start": 76912,
          "char_end": 76962,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp1i0",
          "text": "I have two nights watched with you, but can perceive",
          "char_start": 76963,
          "char_end": 77015,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp1i1",
          "text": "no truth in your report. When was it she last walked?",
          "char_start": 77016,
          "char_end": 77069,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp2i0",
          "text": "Since his majesty went into the field, I have seen",
          "char_start": 77070,
          "char_end": 77120,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp2i1",
          "text": "her rise from her bed, throw her night-gown upon",
          "char_start": 77121,
          "char_end": 77169,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp2i2",
          "text": "her, unlock her closet, take forth paper, fold it,",
          "char_start": 77170,
          "char_end": 77220,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp2i3",
          "text": "write upon't, read it, afterwards seal it, and again",
          "char_start": 77221,
          "char_end": 77273,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp2i4",
          "text": "return to bed; yet all this while in a most fast sleep.",
          "char_start": 77274,
          "char_end": 77329,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp3i0",
          "text": "A great perturbation in nature, to receive at once",
          "char_start": 77330,
          "char_end": 77380,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp3i1",
          "text": "the benefit of sleep, and do the effects of",
          "char_start": 77381,
          "char_end": 77424,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp3i2",
          "text": "watching! In this slumbery agitation, besides her",
          "char_start": 77425,
          "char_end": 77474,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp3i3",
          "text": "walking and other actual performances, what, at any",
          "char_start": 77475,
          "char_end": 77526,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp3i4",
          "text": "time, have you heard her say?",
          "char_start": 77527,
          "char_end": 77556,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp4i0",
          "text": "That, sir, which I will not report after her.",
          "char_start": 77557,
          "char_end": 77602,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp5i0",
          "text": "You may to me: and 'tis most meet you should.",
          "char_start": 77603,
          "char_end": 77648,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp6i0",
          "text": "Neither to you nor any one; having no witness to",
          "char_start": 77649,
          "char_end": 77697,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp6i1",
          "text": "confirm my speech.",
          "char_start": 77698,
          "char_end": 77716,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp6i2",
          "text": "Enter LADY MACBETH, with a taper",
          "char_start": 77717,
          "char_end": 77749,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp6i3",
          "text": "Lo you, here she comes! This is her very guise;",
          "char_start": 77750,
          "char_end": 77797,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp6i4",
          "text": "and, upon my life, fast asleep. Observe her; stand close.",
          "char_start": 77798,
          "char_end": 77855,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp7i0",
          "text": "How came she by that light?",
          "char_start": 77856,
          "char_end": 77883,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp8i0",
          "text": "Why, it stood by her: she has light by her",
          "char_start": 77884,
          "char_end": 77926,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp8i1",
          "text": "continually; 'tis her command.",
          "char_start": 77927,
          "char_end": 77957,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp9i0",
          "text": "You see, her eyes are open.",
          "char_start": 77958,
          "char_end": 77985,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp10i0",
          "text": "Ay, but their sense is shut.",
          "char_start": 77986,
          "char_end": 78014,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp11i0",
          "text": "What is it she does now? Look, how she rubs her hands.",
          "char_start": 78015,
          "char_end": 78069,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp12i0",
          "text": "It is an accustomed action with her, to seem thus",
          "char_start": 78070,
          "char_end": 78119,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp12i1",
          "text": "washing her hands: I have known her continue in",
          "char_start": 78120,
          "char_end": 78167,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp12i2",
          "text": "this a quarter of an hour.",
          "char_start": 78168,
          "char_end": 78194,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp13i0",
          "text": "Yet here's a spot.",
          "char_start": 78195,
          "char_end": 78213,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp14i0",
          "text": "Hark! she speaks: I will set down what comes from",
          "char_start": 78214,
          "char_end": 78263,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp14i1",
          "text": "her, to satisfy my remembrance the more strongly.",
          "char_start": 78264,
          "char_end": 78313,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp15i0",
          "text": "Out, damned spot! out, I say!--One: two: why,",
          "char_start": 78314,
          "char_end": 78359,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp15i1",
          "text": "then, 'tis time to do't.--Hell is murky!--Fie, my",
          "char_start": 78360,
          "char_end": 78409,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp15i2",
          "text": "lord, fie! a soldier, and afeard? What need we",
          "char_start": 78410,
          "char_end": 78456,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp15i3",
          "text": "fear who knows it, when none can call our power to",
          "char_start": 78457,
          "char_end": 78507,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp15i4",
          "text": "account?--Yet who would have thought the old man",
          "char_start": 78508,
          "char_end": 78556,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp15i5",
          "text": "to have had so much blood in him.",
          "char_start": 78557,
          "char_end": 78590,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp16i0",
          "text": "Do you mark that?",
          "char_start": 78591,
          "char_end": 78608,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp17i0",
          "text": "The thane of Fife had a wife: where is she now?--",
          "char_start": 78609,
          "char_end": 78658,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp17i1",
          "text": "What, will these hands ne'er be clean?--No more o'",
          "char_start": 78659,
          "char_end": 78709,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp17i2",
          "text": "that, my lord, no more o' that: you mar all with",
          "char_start": 78710,
          "char_end": 78758,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp17i3",
          "text": "this starting.",
          "char_start": 78759,
          "char_end": 78773,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp18i0",
          "text": "Go to, go to; you have known what you should not.",
          "char_start": 78774,
          "char_end": 78823,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp19i0",
          "text": "She has spoke what she should not, I am sure of",
          "char_start": 78824,
          "char_end": 78871,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp19i1",
          "text": "that: heaven knows what she has known.",
          "char_start": 78872,
          "char_end": 78910,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp20i0",
          "text": "Here's the smell of the blood still: all the",
          "char_start": 78911,
          "char_end": 78955,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp20i1",
          "text": "perfumes of Arabia will not sweeten this little",
          "char_start": 78956,
          "char_end": 79003,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp20i2",
          "text": "hand. Oh, oh, oh!",
          "char_start": 79004,
          "char_end": 79021,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp21i0",
          "text": "What a sigh is there! The heart is sorely charged.",
          "char_start": 79022,
          "char_end": 79072,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp22i0",
          "text": "I would not have such a heart in my bosom for the",
          "char_start": 79073,
          "char_end": 79122,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp22i1",
          "text": "dignity of the whole body.",
          "char_start": 79123,
          "char_end": 79149,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp23i0",
          "text": "Well, well, well,--",
          "char_start": 79150,
          "char_end": 79169,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp24i0",
          "text": "Pray God it be, sir.",
          "char_start": 79170,
          "char_end": 79190,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp25i0",
          "text": "This disease is beyond my practise: yet I have known",
          "char_start": 79191,
          "char_end": 79243,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp25i1",
          "text": "those which have walked in their sleep who have died",
          "char_start": 79244,
          "char_end": 79296,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp25i2",
          "text": "holily in their beds.",
          "char_start": 79297,
          "char_end": 79318,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp26i0",
          "text": "Wash your hands, put on your nightgown; look not so",
          "char_start": 79319,
          "char_end": 79370,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp26i1",
          "text": "pale.--I tell you yet again, Banquo's buried; he",
          "char_start": 79371,
          "char_end": 79419,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp26i2",
          "text": "cannot come out on's grave.",
          "char_start": 79420,
          "char_end": 79447,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp27i0",
          "text": "Even so?",
          "char_start": 79448,
          "char_end": 79456,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp28i0",
          "text": "To bed, to bed! there's knocking at the gate:",
          "char_start": 79457,
          "char_end": 79502,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp28i1",
          "text": "come, come, come, come, give me your hand. What's",
          "char_start": 79503,
          "char_end": 79552,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp28i2",
          "text": "done cannot be undone.--To bed, to bed, to bed!",
          "char_start": 79553,
          "char_end": 79600,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp28i3",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 79601,
          "char_end": 79605,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LADY MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp29i0",
          "text": "Will she go now to bed?",
          "char_start": 79606,
          "char_end": 79629,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp30i0",
          "text": "Directly.",
          "char_start": 79630,
          "char_end": 79639,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp31i0",
          "text": "Foul whisperings are abroad: unnatural deeds",
          "char_start": 79640,
          "char_end": 79684,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp31i1",
          "text": "Do breed unnatural troubles: infected minds",
          "char_start": 79685,
          "char_end": 79728,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp31i2",
          "text": "To their deaf pillows will discharge their secrets:",
          "char_start": 79729,
          "char_end": 79780,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp31i3",
          "text": "More needs she the divine than the physician.",
          "char_start": 79781,
          "char_end": 79826,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp31i4",
          "text": "God, God forgive us all! Look after her;",
          "char_start": 79827,
          "char_end": 79867,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp31i5",
          "text": "Remove from her the means of all annoyance,",
          "char_start": 79868,
          "char_end": 79911,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp31i6",
          "text": "And still keep eyes upon her. So, good night:",
          "char_start": 79912,
          "char_end": 79957,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp31i7",
          "text": "My mind she has mated, and amazed my sight.",
          "char_start": 79958,
          "char_end": 80001,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp31i8",
          "text": "I think, but dare not speak.",
          "char_start": 80002,
          "char_end": 80030,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp32i0",
          "text": "Good night, good doctor.",
          "char_start": 80031,
          "char_end": 80055,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": "5.1.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s1:sp32i1",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 80056,
          "char_end": 80062,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 1,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Gentlewoman"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:open",
          "text": "Drum and colours. Enter MENTEITH, CAITHNESS, ANGUS, LENNOX, and Soldiers",
          "char_start": 80063,
          "char_end": 80135,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp1i0",
          "text": "The English power is near, led on by Malcolm,",
          "char_start": 80136,
          "char_end": 80181,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp1i1",
          "text": "His uncle Siward and the good Macduff:",
          "char_start": 80182,
          "char_end": 80220,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp1i2",
          "text": "Revenges burn in them; for their dear causes",
          "char_start": 80221,
          "char_end": 80265,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp1i3",
          "text": "Would to the bleeding and the grim alarm",
          "char_start": 80266,
          "char_end": 80306,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp1i4",
          "text": "Excite the mortified man.",
          "char_start": 80307,
          "char_end": 80332,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp2i0",
          "text": "Near Birnam wood",
          "char_start": 80333,
          "char_end": 80349,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp2i1",
          "text": "Shall we well meet them; that way are they coming.",
          "char_start": 80350,
          "char_end": 80400,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp3i0",
          "text": "Who knows if Donalbain be with his brother?",
          "char_start": 80401,
          "char_end": 80444,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp4i0",
          "text": "For certain, sir, he is not: I have a file",
          "char_start": 80445,
          "char_end": 80487,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp4i1",
          "text": "Of all the gentry: there is Siward's son,",
          "char_start": 80488,
          "char_end": 80529,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp4i2",
          "text": "And many unrough youths that even now",
          "char_start": 80530,
          "char_end": 80567,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp4i3",
          "text": "Protest their first of manhood.",
          "char_start": 80568,
          "char_end": 80599,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp5i0",
          "text": "What does the tyrant?",
          "char_start": 80600,
          "char_end": 80621,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp6i0",
          "text": "Great Dunsinane he strongly fortifies:",
          "char_start": 80622,
          "char_end": 80660,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp6i1",
          "text": "Some say he's mad; others that lesser hate him",
          "char_start": 80661,
          "char_end": 80707,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp6i2",
          "text": "Do call it valiant fury: but, for certain,",
          "char_start": 80708,
          "char_end": 80750,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp6i3",
          "text": "He cannot buckle his distemper'd cause",
          "char_start": 80751,
          "char_end": 80789,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp6i4",
          "text": "Within the belt of rule.",
          "char_start": 80790,
          "char_end": 80814,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp7i0",
          "text": "Now does he feel",
          "char_start": 80815,
          "char_end": 80831,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp7i1",
          "text": "His secret murders sticking on his hands;",
          "char_start": 80832,
          "char_end": 80873,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp7i2",
          "text": "Now minutely revolts upbraid his faith-breach;",
          "char_start": 80874,
          "char_end": 80920,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp7i3",
          "text": "Those he commands move only in command,",
          "char_start": 80921,
          "char_end": 80960,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp7i4",
          "text": "Nothing in love: now does he feel his title",
          "char_start": 80961,
          "char_end": 81004,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp7i5",
          "text": "Hang loose about him, like a giant's robe",
          "char_start": 81005,
          "char_end": 81046,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp7i6",
          "text": "Upon a dwarfish thief.",
          "char_start": 81047,
          "char_end": 81069,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ANGUS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp8i0",
          "text": "Who then shall blame",
          "char_start": 81070,
          "char_end": 81090,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp8i1",
          "text": "His pester'd senses to recoil and start,",
          "char_start": 81091,
          "char_end": 81131,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp8i2",
          "text": "When all that is within him does condemn",
          "char_start": 81132,
          "char_end": 81172,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp8i3",
          "text": "Itself for being there?",
          "char_start": 81173,
          "char_end": 81196,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp9i0",
          "text": "Well, march we on,",
          "char_start": 81197,
          "char_end": 81215,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp9i1",
          "text": "To give obedience where 'tis truly owed:",
          "char_start": 81216,
          "char_end": 81256,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp9i2",
          "text": "Meet we the medicine of the sickly weal,",
          "char_start": 81257,
          "char_end": 81297,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp9i3",
          "text": "And with him pour we in our country's purge",
          "char_start": 81298,
          "char_end": 81341,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp9i4",
          "text": "Each drop of us.",
          "char_start": 81342,
          "char_end": 81358,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "CAITHNESS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp10i0",
          "text": "Or so much as it needs,",
          "char_start": 81359,
          "char_end": 81382,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp10i1",
          "text": "To dew the sovereign flower and drown the weeds.",
          "char_start": 81383,
          "char_end": 81431,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp10i2",
          "text": "Make we our march towards Birnam.",
          "char_start": 81432,
          "char_end": 81465,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": "5.2.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s2:sp10i3",
          "text": "Exeunt, marching",
          "char_start": 81466,
          "char_end": 81482,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 2,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "LENNOX"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:open",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH, Doctor, and Attendants",
          "char_start": 81483,
          "char_end": 81520,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i0",
          "text": "Bring me no more reports; let them fly all:",
          "char_start": 81521,
          "char_end": 81564,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i1",
          "text": "Till Birnam wood remove to Dunsinane,",
          "char_start": 81565,
          "char_end": 81602,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i2",
          "text": "I cannot taint with fear. What's the boy Malcolm?",
          "char_start": 81603,
          "char_end": 81652,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i3",
          "text": "Was he not born of woman? The spirits that know",
          "char_start": 81653,
          "char_end": 81700,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i4",
          "text": "All mortal consequences have pronounced me thus:",
          "char_start": 81701,
          "char_end": 81749,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i5",
          "text": "'Fear not, Macbeth; no man that's born of woman",
          "char_start": 81750,
          "char_end": 81797,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i6",
          "text": "Shall e'er have power upon thee.' Then fly,",
          "char_start": 81798,
          "char_end": 81841,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i7",
          "text": "false thanes,",
          "char_start": 81842,
          "char_end": 81855,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i8",
          "text": "And mingle with the English epicures:",
          "char_start": 81856,
          "char_end": 81893,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i9",
          "text": "The mind I sway by and the heart I bear",
          "char_start": 81894,
          "char_end": 81933,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i10",
          "text": "Shall never sag with doubt nor shake with fear.",
          "char_start": 81934,
          "char_end": 81981,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i11",
          "text": "Enter a Servant",
          "char_start": 81982,
          "char_end": 81997,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i12",
          "text": "The devil damn thee black, thou cream-faced loon!",
          "char_start": 81998,
          "char_end": 82047,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp1i13",
          "text": "Where got'st thou that goose look?",
          "char_start": 82048,
          "char_end": 82082,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp2i0",
          "text": "There is ten thousand--",
          "char_start": 82083,
          "char_end": 82106,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Servant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp3i0",
          "text": "Geese, villain!",
          "char_start": 82107,
          "char_end": 82122,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp4i0",
          "text": "Soldiers, sir.",
          "char_start": 82123,
          "char_end": 82137,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Servant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp5i0",
          "text": "Go prick thy face, and over-red thy fear,",
          "char_start": 82138,
          "char_end": 82179,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp5i1",
          "text": "Thou lily-liver'd boy. What soldiers, patch?",
          "char_start": 82180,
          "char_end": 82224,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp5i2",
          "text": "Death of thy soul! those linen cheeks of thine",
          "char_start": 82225,
          "char_end": 82271,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp5i3",
          "text": "Are counsellors to fear. What soldiers, whey-face?",
          "char_start": 82272,
          "char_end": 82322,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp6i0",
          "text": "The English force, so please you.",
          "char_start": 82323,
          "char_end": 82356,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Servant"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i0",
          "text": "Take thy face hence.",
          "char_start": 82357,
          "char_end": 82377,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i1",
          "text": "Exit Servant",
          "char_start": 82378,
          "char_end": 82390,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i2",
          "text": "Seyton!--I am sick at heart,",
          "char_start": 82391,
          "char_end": 82419,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i3",
          "text": "When I behold--Seyton, I say!--This push",
          "char_start": 82420,
          "char_end": 82460,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i4",
          "text": "Will cheer me ever, or disseat me now.",
          "char_start": 82461,
          "char_end": 82499,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i5",
          "text": "I have lived long enough: my way of life",
          "char_start": 82500,
          "char_end": 82540,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i6",
          "text": "Is fall'n into the sear, the yellow leaf;",
          "char_start": 82541,
          "char_end": 82582,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i7",
          "text": "And that which should accompany old age,",
          "char_start": 82583,
          "char_end": 82623,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i8",
          "text": "As honour, love, obedience, troops of friends,",
          "char_start": 82624,
          "char_end": 82670,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i9",
          "text": "I must not look to have; but, in their stead,",
          "char_start": 82671,
          "char_end": 82716,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i10",
          "text": "Curses, not loud but deep, mouth-honour, breath,",
          "char_start": 82717,
          "char_end": 82765,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i11",
          "text": "Which the poor heart would fain deny, and dare not. Seyton!",
          "char_start": 82766,
          "char_end": 82825,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp7i12",
          "text": "Enter SEYTON",
          "char_start": 82826,
          "char_end": 82838,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp8i0",
          "text": "What is your gracious pleasure?",
          "char_start": 82839,
          "char_end": 82870,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SEYTON"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp9i0",
          "text": "What news more?",
          "char_start": 82871,
          "char_end": 82886,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp10i0",
          "text": "All is confirm'd, my lord, which was reported.",
          "char_start": 82887,
          "char_end": 82933,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SEYTON"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp11i0",
          "text": "I'll fight till from my bones my flesh be hack'd.",
          "char_start": 82934,
          "char_end": 82983,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp11i1",
          "text": "Give me my armour.",
          "char_start": 82984,
          "char_end": 83002,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp12i0",
          "text": "'Tis not needed yet.",
          "char_start": 83003,
          "char_end": 83023,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SEYTON"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp13i0",
          "text": "I'll put it on.",
          "char_start": 83024,
          "char_end": 83039,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp13i1",
          "text": "Send out more horses; skirr the country round;",
          "char_start": 83040,
          "char_end": 83086,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp13i2",
          "text": "Hang those that talk of fear. Give me mine armour.",
          "char_start": 83087,
          "char_end": 83137,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp13i3",
          "text": "How does your patient, doctor?",
          "char_start": 83138,
          "char_end": 83168,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp14i0",
          "text": "Not so sick, my lord,",
          "char_start": 83169,
          "char_end": 83190,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp14i1",
          "text": "As she is troubled with thick coming fancies,",
          "char_start": 83191,
          "char_end": 83236,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp14i2",
          "text": "That keep her from her rest.",
          "char_start": 83237,
          "char_end": 83265,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp15i0",
          "text": "Cure her of that.",
          "char_start": 83266,
          "char_end": 83283,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp15i1",
          "text": "Canst thou not minister to a mind diseased,",
          "char_start": 83284,
          "char_end": 83327,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp15i2",
          "text": "Pluck from the memory a rooted sorrow,",
          "char_start": 83328,
          "char_end": 83366,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp15i3",
          "text": "Raze out the written troubles of the brain",
          "char_start": 83367,
          "char_end": 83409,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp15i4",
          "text": "And with some sweet oblivious antidote",
          "char_start": 83410,
          "char_end": 83448,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp15i5",
          "text": "Cleanse the stuff'd bosom of that perilous stuff",
          "char_start": 83449,
          "char_end": 83497,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp15i6",
          "text": "Which weighs upon the heart?",
          "char_start": 83498,
          "char_end": 83526,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp16i0",
          "text": "Therein the patient",
          "char_start": 83527,
          "char_end": 83546,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp16i1",
          "text": "Must minister to himself.",
          "char_start": 83547,
          "char_end": 83572,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i0",
          "text": "Throw physic to the dogs; I'll none of it.",
          "char_start": 83573,
          "char_end": 83615,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i1",
          "text": "Come, put mine armour on; give me my staff.",
          "char_start": 83616,
          "char_end": 83659,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i2",
          "text": "Seyton, send out. Doctor, the thanes fly from me.",
          "char_start": 83660,
          "char_end": 83709,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i3",
          "text": "Come, sir, dispatch. If thou couldst, doctor, cast",
          "char_start": 83710,
          "char_end": 83760,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i4",
          "text": "The water of my land, find her disease,",
          "char_start": 83761,
          "char_end": 83800,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i5",
          "text": "And purge it to a sound and pristine health,",
          "char_start": 83801,
          "char_end": 83845,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i6",
          "text": "I would applaud thee to the very echo,",
          "char_start": 83846,
          "char_end": 83884,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i7",
          "text": "That should applaud again.--Pull't off, I say.--",
          "char_start": 83885,
          "char_end": 83933,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i8",
          "text": "What rhubarb, cyme, or what purgative drug,",
          "char_start": 83934,
          "char_end": 83977,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp17i9",
          "text": "Would scour these English hence? Hear'st thou of them?",
          "char_start": 83978,
          "char_end": 84032,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp18i0",
          "text": "Ay, my good lord; your royal preparation",
          "char_start": 84033,
          "char_end": 84073,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp18i1",
          "text": "Makes us hear something.",
          "char_start": 84074,
          "char_end": 84098,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp19i0",
          "text": "Bring it after me.",
          "char_start": 84099,
          "char_end": 84117,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp19i1",
          "text": "I will not be afraid of death and bane,",
          "char_start": 84118,
          "char_end": 84157,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp19i2",
          "text": "Till Birnam forest come to Dunsinane.",
          "char_start": 84158,
          "char_end": 84195,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp20i0",
          "text": "[Aside] Were I from Dunsinane away and clear,",
          "char_start": 84196,
          "char_end": 84241,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp20i1",
          "text": "Profit again should hardly draw me here.",
          "char_start": 84242,
          "char_end": 84282,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": "5.3.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s3:sp20i2",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 84283,
          "char_end": 84289,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 3,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "Doctor"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:open",
          "text": "Drum and colours. Enter MALCOLM, SIWARD and YOUNG SIWARD, MACDUFF, MENTEITH, CAITHNESS, ANGUS, LENNOX, ROSS, and Soldiers, marching",
          "char_start": 84290,
          "char_end": 84421,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp1i0",
          "text": "Cousins, I hope the days are near at hand",
          "char_start": 84422,
          "char_end": 84463,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp1i1",
          "text": "That chambers will be safe.",
          "char_start": 84464,
          "char_end": 84491,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp2i0",
          "text": "We doubt it nothing.",
          "char_start": 84492,
          "char_end": 84512,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp3i0",
          "text": "What wood is this before us?",
          "char_start": 84513,
          "char_end": 84541,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp4i0",
          "text": "The wood of Birnam.",
          "char_start": 84542,
          "char_end": 84561,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MENTEITH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp5i0",
          "text": "Let every soldier hew him down a bough",
          "char_start": 84562,
          "char_end": 84600,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp5i1",
          "text": "And bear't before him: thereby shall we shadow",
          "char_start": 84601,
          "char_end": 84647,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp5i2",
          "text": "The numbers of our host and make discovery",
          "char_start": 84648,
          "char_end": 84690,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp5i3",
          "text": "Err in report of us.",
          "char_start": 84691,
          "char_end": 84711,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp6i0",
          "text": "It shall be done.",
          "char_start": 84712,
          "char_end": 84729,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Soldiers"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp7i0",
          "text": "We learn no other but the confident tyrant",
          "char_start": 84730,
          "char_end": 84772,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp7i1",
          "text": "Keeps still in Dunsinane, and will endure",
          "char_start": 84773,
          "char_end": 84814,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp7i2",
          "text": "Our setting down before 't.",
          "char_start": 84815,
          "char_end": 84842,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp8i0",
          "text": "'Tis his main hope:",
          "char_start": 84843,
          "char_end": 84862,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp8i1",
          "text": "For where there is advantage to be given,",
          "char_start": 84863,
          "char_end": 84904,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp8i2",
          "text": "Both more and less have given him the revolt,",
          "char_start": 84905,
          "char_end": 84950,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp8i3",
          "text": "And none serve with him but constrained things",
          "char_start": 84951,
          "char_end": 84997,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp8i4",
          "text": "Whose hearts are absent too.",
          "char_start": 84998,
          "char_end": 85026,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp9i0",
          "text": "Let our just censures",
          "char_start": 85027,
          "char_end": 85048,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp9i1",
          "text": "Attend the true event, and put we on",
          "char_start": 85049,
          "char_end": 85085,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp9i2",
          "text": "Industrious soldiership.",
          "char_start": 85086,
          "char_end": 85110,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp10i0",
          "text": "The time approaches",
          "char_start": 85111,
          "char_end": 85130,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp10i1",
          "text": "That will with due decision make us know",
          "char_start": 85131,
          "char_end": 85171,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp10i2",
          "text": "What we shall say we have and what we owe.",
          "char_start": 85172,
          "char_end": 85214,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp10i3",
          "text": "Thoughts speculative their unsure hopes relate,",
          "char_start": 85215,
          "char_end": 85262,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp10i4",
          "text": "But certain issue strokes must arbitrate:",
          "char_start": 85263,
          "char_end": 85304,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp10i5",
          "text": "Towards which advance the war.",
          "char_start": 85305,
          "char_end": 85335,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": "5.4.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s4:sp10i6",
          "text": "Exeunt, marching",
          "char_start": 85336,
          "char_end": 85352,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 4,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:open",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH, SEYTON, and Soldiers, with drum and colours",
          "char_start": 85353,
          "char_end": 85411,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp1i0",
          "text": "Hang out our banners on the outward walls;",
          "char_start": 85412,
          "char_end": 85454,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp1i1",
          "text": "The cry is still 'They come:' our castle's strength",
          "char_start": 85455,
          "char_end": 85506,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp1i2",
          "text": "Will laugh a siege to scorn: here let them lie",
          "char_start": 85507,
          "char_end": 85553,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp1i3",
          "text": "Till famine and the ague eat them up:",
          "char_start": 85554,
          "char_end": 85591,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp1i4",
          "text": "Were they not forced with those that should be ours,",
          "char_start": 85592,
          "char_end": 85644,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp1i5",
          "text": "We might have met them dareful, beard to beard,",
          "char_start": 85645,
          "char_end": 85692,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp1i6",
          "text": "And beat them backward home.",
          "char_start": 85693,
          "char_end": 85721,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp1i7",
          "text": "A cry of women within",
          "char_start": 85722,
          "char_end": 85743,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp1i8",
          "text": "What is that noise?",
          "char_start": 85744,
          "char_end": 85763,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp2i0",
          "text": "It is the cry of women, my good lord.",
          "char_start": 85764,
          "char_end": 85801,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SEYTON"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp2i1",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 85802,
          "char_end": 85806,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "SEYTON"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp3i0",
          "text": "I have almost forgot the taste of fears;",
          "char_start": 85807,
          "char_end": 85847,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp3i1",
          "text": "The time has been, my senses would have cool'd",
          "char_start": 85848,
          "char_end": 85894,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp3i2",
          "text": "To hear a night-shriek; and my fell of hair",
          "char_start": 85895,
          "char_end": 85938,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp3i3",
          "text": "Would at a dismal treatise rouse and stir",
          "char_start": 85939,
          "char_end": 85980,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp3i4",
          "text": "As life were in't: I have supp'd full with horrors;",
          "char_start": 85981,
          "char_end": 86032,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp3i5",
          "text": "Direness, familiar to my slaughterous thoughts",
          "char_start": 86033,
          "char_end": 86079,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp3i6",
          "text": "Cannot once start me.",
          "char_start": 86080,
          "char_end": 86101,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp3i7",
          "text": "Re-enter SEYTON",
          "char_start": 86102,
          "char_end": 86117,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp3i8",
          "text": "Wherefore was that cry?",
          "char_start": 86118,
          "char_end": 86141,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp4i0",
          "text": "The queen, my lord, is dead.",
          "char_start": 86142,
          "char_end": 86170,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SEYTON"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i0",
          "text": "She should have died hereafter;",
          "char_start": 86171,
          "char_end": 86202,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i1",
          "text": "There would have been a time for such a word.",
          "char_start": 86203,
          "char_end": 86248,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i2",
          "text": "To-morrow, and to-morrow, and to-morrow,",
          "char_start": 86249,
          "char_end": 86289,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i3",
          "text": "Creeps in this petty pace from day to day",
          "char_start": 86290,
          "char_end": 86331,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i4",
          "text": "To the last syllable of recorded time,",
          "char_start": 86332,
          "char_end": 86370,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i5",
          "text": "And all our yesterdays have lighted fools",
          "char_start": 86371,
          "char_end": 86412,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i6",
          "text": "The way to dusty death. Out, out, brief candle!",
          "char_start": 86413,
          "char_end": 86460,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i7",
          "text": "Life's but a walking shadow, a poor player",
          "char_start": 86461,
          "char_end": 86503,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i8",
          "text": "That struts and frets his hour upon the stage",
          "char_start": 86504,
          "char_end": 86549,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i9",
          "text": "And then is heard no more: it is a tale",
          "char_start": 86550,
          "char_end": 86589,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i10",
          "text": "Told by an idiot, full of sound and fury,",
          "char_start": 86590,
          "char_end": 86631,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i11",
          "text": "Signifying nothing.",
          "char_start": 86632,
          "char_end": 86651,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i12",
          "text": "Enter a Messenger",
          "char_start": 86652,
          "char_end": 86669,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp5i13",
          "text": "Thou comest to use thy tongue; thy story quickly.",
          "char_start": 86670,
          "char_end": 86719,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp6i0",
          "text": "Gracious my lord,",
          "char_start": 86720,
          "char_end": 86737,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp6i1",
          "text": "I should report that which I say I saw,",
          "char_start": 86738,
          "char_end": 86777,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp6i2",
          "text": "But know not how to do it.",
          "char_start": 86778,
          "char_end": 86804,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp7i0",
          "text": "Well, say, sir.",
          "char_start": 86805,
          "char_end": 86820,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp8i0",
          "text": "As I did stand my watch upon the hill,",
          "char_start": 86821,
          "char_end": 86859,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp8i1",
          "text": "I look'd toward Birnam, and anon, methought,",
          "char_start": 86860,
          "char_end": 86904,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp8i2",
          "text": "The wood began to move.",
          "char_start": 86905,
          "char_end": 86928,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp9i0",
          "text": "Liar and slave!",
          "char_start": 86929,
          "char_end": 86944,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp10i0",
          "text": "Let me endure your wrath, if't be not so:",
          "char_start": 86945,
          "char_end": 86986,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp10i1",
          "text": "Within this three mile may you see it coming;",
          "char_start": 86987,
          "char_end": 87032,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp10i2",
          "text": "I say, a moving grove.",
          "char_start": 87033,
          "char_end": 87055,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "Messenger"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i0",
          "text": "If thou speak'st false,",
          "char_start": 87056,
          "char_end": 87079,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i1",
          "text": "Upon the next tree shalt thou hang alive,",
          "char_start": 87080,
          "char_end": 87121,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i2",
          "text": "Till famine cling thee: if thy speech be sooth,",
          "char_start": 87122,
          "char_end": 87169,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i3",
          "text": "I care not if thou dost for me as much.",
          "char_start": 87170,
          "char_end": 87209,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i4",
          "text": "I pull in resolution, and begin",
          "char_start": 87210,
          "char_end": 87241,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i5",
          "text": "To doubt the equivocation of the fiend",
          "char_start": 87242,
          "char_end": 87280,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i6",
          "text": "That lies like truth: 'Fear not, till Birnam wood",
          "char_start": 87281,
          "char_end": 87330,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.49",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i7",
          "text": "Do come to Dunsinane:' and now a wood",
          "char_start": 87331,
          "char_end": 87368,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i8",
          "text": "Comes toward Dunsinane. Arm, arm, and out!",
          "char_start": 87369,
          "char_end": 87411,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i9",
          "text": "If this which he avouches does appear,",
          "char_start": 87412,
          "char_end": 87450,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i10",
          "text": "There is nor flying hence nor tarrying here.",
          "char_start": 87451,
          "char_end": 87495,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i11",
          "text": "I gin to be aweary of the sun,",
          "char_start": 87496,
          "char_end": 87526,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i12",
          "text": "And wish the estate o' the world were now undone.",
          "char_start": 87527,
          "char_end": 87576,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i13",
          "text": "Ring the alarum-bell! Blow, wind! come, wrack!",
          "char_start": 87577,
          "char_end": 87623,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i14",
          "text": "At least we'll die with harness on our back.",
          "char_start": 87624,
          "char_end": 87668,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": "5.5.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s5:sp11i15",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 87669,
          "char_end": 87675,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 5,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:open",
          "text": "Drum and colours. Enter MALCOLM, SIWARD, MACDUFF, and their Army, with boughs",
          "char_start": 87676,
          "char_end": 87753,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp1i0",
          "text": "Now near enough: your leafy screens throw down.",
          "char_start": 87754,
          "char_end": 87801,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp1i1",
          "text": "And show like those you are. You, worthy uncle,",
          "char_start": 87802,
          "char_end": 87849,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp1i2",
          "text": "Shall, with my cousin, your right-noble son,",
          "char_start": 87850,
          "char_end": 87894,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp1i3",
          "text": "Lead our first battle: worthy Macduff and we",
          "char_start": 87895,
          "char_end": 87939,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp1i4",
          "text": "Shall take upon 's what else remains to do,",
          "char_start": 87940,
          "char_end": 87983,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp1i5",
          "text": "According to our order.",
          "char_start": 87984,
          "char_end": 88007,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp2i0",
          "text": "Fare you well.",
          "char_start": 88008,
          "char_end": 88022,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp2i1",
          "text": "Do we but find the tyrant's power to-night,",
          "char_start": 88023,
          "char_end": 88066,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp2i2",
          "text": "Let us be beaten, if we cannot fight.",
          "char_start": 88067,
          "char_end": 88104,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp3i0",
          "text": "Make all our trumpets speak; give them all breath,",
          "char_start": 88105,
          "char_end": 88155,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp3i1",
          "text": "Those clamorous harbingers of blood and death.",
          "char_start": 88156,
          "char_end": 88202,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": "5.6.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s6:sp3i2",
          "text": "Exeunt",
          "char_start": 88203,
          "char_end": 88209,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 6,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:open",
          "text": "Alarums. Enter MACBETH",
          "char_start": 88210,
          "char_end": 88232,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp1i0",
          "text": "They have tied me to a stake; I cannot fly,",
          "char_start": 88233,
          "char_end": 88276,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp1i1",
          "text": "But, bear-like, I must fight the course. What's he",
          "char_start": 88277,
          "char_end": 88327,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp1i2",
          "text": "That was not born of woman? Such a one",
          "char_start": 88328,
          "char_end": 88366,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp1i3",
          "text": "Am I to fear, or none.",
          "char_start": 88367,
          "char_end": 88389,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp1i4",
          "text": "Enter YOUNG SIWARD",
          "char_start": 88390,
          "char_end": 88408,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp2i0",
          "text": "What is thy name?",
          "char_start": 88409,
          "char_end": 88426,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "YOUNG SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp3i0",
          "text": "Thou'lt be afraid to hear it.",
          "char_start": 88427,
          "char_end": 88456,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp4i0",
          "text": "No; though thou call'st thyself a hotter name",
          "char_start": 88457,
          "char_end": 88502,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "YOUNG SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp4i1",
          "text": "Than any is in hell.",
          "char_start": 88503,
          "char_end": 88523,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "YOUNG SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp5i0",
          "text": "My name's Macbeth.",
          "char_start": 88524,
          "char_end": 88542,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp6i0",
          "text": "The devil himself could not pronounce a title",
          "char_start": 88543,
          "char_end": 88588,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "YOUNG SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp6i1",
          "text": "More hateful to mine ear.",
          "char_start": 88589,
          "char_end": 88614,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "YOUNG SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp7i0",
          "text": "No, nor more fearful.",
          "char_start": 88615,
          "char_end": 88636,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp8i0",
          "text": "Thou liest, abhorred tyrant; with my sword",
          "char_start": 88637,
          "char_end": 88679,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "YOUNG SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp8i1",
          "text": "I'll prove the lie thou speak'st.",
          "char_start": 88680,
          "char_end": 88713,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "YOUNG SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp8i2",
          "text": "They fight and YOUNG SIWARD is slain",
          "char_start": 88714,
          "char_end": 88750,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "YOUNG SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp9i0",
          "text": "Thou wast born of woman",
          "char_start": 88751,
          "char_end": 88774,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp9i1",
          "text": "But swords I smile at, weapons laugh to scorn,",
          "char_start": 88775,
          "char_end": 88821,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp9i2",
          "text": "Brandish'd by man that's of a woman born.",
          "char_start": 88822,
          "char_end": 88863,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp9i3",
          "text": "Exit",
          "char_start": 88864,
          "char_end": 88868,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp9i4",
          "text": "Alarums. Enter MACDUFF",
          "char_start": 88869,
          "char_end": 88891,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i0",
          "text": "That way the noise is. Tyrant, show thy face!",
          "char_start": 88892,
          "char_end": 88937,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i1",
          "text": "If thou be'st slain and with no stroke of mine,",
          "char_start": 88938,
          "char_end": 88985,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i2",
          "text": "My wife and children's ghosts will haunt me still.",
          "char_start": 88986,
          "char_end": 89036,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i3",
          "text": "I cannot strike at wretched kerns, whose arms",
          "char_start": 89037,
          "char_end": 89082,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i4",
          "text": "Are hired to bear their staves: either thou, Macbeth,",
          "char_start": 89083,
          "char_end": 89136,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i5",
          "text": "Or else my sword with an unbatter'd edge",
          "char_start": 89137,
          "char_end": 89177,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i6",
          "text": "I sheathe again undeeded. There thou shouldst be;",
          "char_start": 89178,
          "char_end": 89227,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i7",
          "text": "By this great clatter, one of greatest note",
          "char_start": 89228,
          "char_end": 89271,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i8",
          "text": "Seems bruited. Let me find him, fortune!",
          "char_start": 89272,
          "char_end": 89312,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i9",
          "text": "And more I beg not.",
          "char_start": 89313,
          "char_end": 89332,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i10",
          "text": "Exit. Alarums",
          "char_start": 89333,
          "char_end": 89346,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp10i11",
          "text": "Enter MALCOLM and SIWARD",
          "char_start": 89347,
          "char_end": 89371,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp11i0",
          "text": "This way, my lord; the castle's gently render'd:",
          "char_start": 89372,
          "char_end": 89420,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp11i1",
          "text": "The tyrant's people on both sides do fight;",
          "char_start": 89421,
          "char_end": 89464,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp11i2",
          "text": "The noble thanes do bravely in the war;",
          "char_start": 89465,
          "char_end": 89504,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp11i3",
          "text": "The day almost itself professes yours,",
          "char_start": 89505,
          "char_end": 89543,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp11i4",
          "text": "And little is to do.",
          "char_start": 89544,
          "char_end": 89564,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp12i0",
          "text": "We have met with foes",
          "char_start": 89565,
          "char_end": 89586,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp12i1",
          "text": "That strike beside us.",
          "char_start": 89587,
          "char_end": 89609,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp13i0",
          "text": "Enter, sir, the castle.",
          "char_start": 89610,
          "char_end": 89633,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": "5.7.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s7:sp13i1",
          "text": "Exeunt. Alarums",
          "char_start": 89634,
          "char_end": 89649,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 7,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:open",
          "text": "Enter MACBETH",
          "char_start": 89650,
          "char_end": 89663,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
          "speaker": null
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp1i0",
          "text": "Why should I play the Roman fool, and die",
          "char_start": 89664,
          "char_end": 89705,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.1",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp1i1",
          "text": "On mine own sword? whiles I see lives, the gashes",
          "char_start": 89706,
          "char_end": 89755,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.2",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp1i2",
          "text": "Do better upon them.",
          "char_start": 89756,
          "char_end": 89776,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.3",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp1i3",
          "text": "Enter MACDUFF",
          "char_start": 89777,
          "char_end": 89790,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp2i0",
          "text": "Turn, hell-hound, turn!",
          "char_start": 89791,
          "char_end": 89814,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.4",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp3i0",
          "text": "Of all men else I have avoided thee:",
          "char_start": 89815,
          "char_end": 89851,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.5",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp3i1",
          "text": "But get thee back; my soul is too much charged",
          "char_start": 89852,
          "char_end": 89898,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.6",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp3i2",
          "text": "With blood of thine already.",
          "char_start": 89899,
          "char_end": 89927,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.7",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp4i0",
          "text": "I have no words:",
          "char_start": 89928,
          "char_end": 89944,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.8",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp4i1",
          "text": "My voice is in my sword: thou bloodier villain",
          "char_start": 89945,
          "char_end": 89991,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.9",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp4i2",
          "text": "Than terms can give thee out!",
          "char_start": 89992,
          "char_end": 90021,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.10",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp4i3",
          "text": "They fight",
          "char_start": 90022,
          "char_end": 90032,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp5i0",
          "text": "Thou losest labour:",
          "char_start": 90033,
          "char_end": 90052,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.11",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp5i1",
          "text": "As easy mayst thou the intrenchant air",
          "char_start": 90053,
          "char_end": 90091,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.12",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp5i2",
          "text": "With thy keen sword impress as make me bleed:",
          "char_start": 90092,
          "char_end": 90137,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.13",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp5i3",
          "text": "Let fall thy blade on vulnerable crests;",
          "char_start": 90138,
          "char_end": 90178,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.14",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp5i4",
          "text": "I bear a charmed life, which must not yield,",
          "char_start": 90179,
          "char_end": 90223,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.15",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp5i5",
          "text": "To one of woman born.",
          "char_start": 90224,
          "char_end": 90245,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.16",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp6i0",
          "text": "Despair thy charm;",
          "char_start": 90246,
          "char_end": 90264,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.17",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp6i1",
          "text": "And let the angel whom thou still hast served",
          "char_start": 90265,
          "char_end": 90310,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.18",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp6i2",
          "text": "Tell thee, Macduff was from his mother's womb",
          "char_start": 90311,
          "char_end": 90356,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.19",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp6i3",
          "text": "Untimely ripp'd.",
          "char_start": 90357,
          "char_end": 90373,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.20",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp7i0",
          "text": "Accursed be that tongue that tells me so,",
          "char_start": 90374,
          "char_end": 90415,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.21",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp7i1",
          "text": "For it hath cow'd my better part of man!",
          "char_start": 90416,
          "char_end": 90456,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.22",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp7i2",
          "text": "And be these juggling fiends no more believed,",
          "char_start": 90457,
          "char_end": 90503,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.23",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp7i3",
          "text": "That palter with us in a double sense;",
          "char_start": 90504,
          "char_end": 90542,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.24",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp7i4",
          "text": "That keep the word of promise to our ear,",
          "char_start": 90543,
          "char_end": 90584,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.25",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp7i5",
          "text": "And break it to our hope. I'll not fight with thee.",
          "char_start": 90585,
          "char_end": 90636,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.26",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp8i0",
          "text": "Then yield thee, coward,",
          "char_start": 90637,
          "char_end": 90661,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.27",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp8i1",
          "text": "And live to be the show and gaze o' the time:",
          "char_start": 90662,
          "char_end": 90707,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.28",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp8i2",
          "text": "We'll have thee, as our rarer monsters are,",
          "char_start": 90708,
          "char_end": 90751,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.29",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp8i3",
          "text": "Painted on a pole, and underwrit,",
          "char_start": 90752,
          "char_end": 90785,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.30",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp8i4",
          "text": "'Here may you see the tyrant.'",
          "char_start": 90786,
          "char_end": 90816,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.31",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i0",
          "text": "I will not yield,",
          "char_start": 90817,
          "char_end": 90834,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.32",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i1",
          "text": "To kiss the ground before young Malcolm's feet,",
          "char_start": 90835,
          "char_end": 90882,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.33",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i2",
          "text": "And to be baited with the rabble's curse.",
          "char_start": 90883,
          "char_end": 90924,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.34",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i3",
          "text": "Though Birnam wood be come to Dunsinane,",
          "char_start": 90925,
          "char_end": 90965,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.35",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i4",
          "text": "And thou opposed, being of no woman born,",
          "char_start": 90966,
          "char_end": 91007,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.36",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i5",
          "text": "Yet I will try the last. Before my body",
          "char_start": 91008,
          "char_end": 91047,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.37",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i6",
          "text": "I throw my warlike shield. Lay on, Macduff,",
          "char_start": 91048,
          "char_end": 91091,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.38",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i7",
          "text": "And damn'd be him that first cries, 'Hold, enough!'",
          "char_start": 91092,
          "char_end": 91143,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.39",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i8",
          "text": "Exeunt, fighting. Alarums",
          "char_start": 91144,
          "char_end": 91169,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp9i9",
          "text": "Retreat. Flourish. Enter, with drum and colours, MALCOLM, SIWARD, ROSS, the other Thanes, and Soldiers",
          "char_start": 91170,
          "char_end": 91272,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "MACBETH"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp10i0",
          "text": "I would the friends we miss were safe arrived.",
          "char_start": 91273,
          "char_end": 91319,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.40",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp11i0",
          "text": "Some must go off: and yet, by these I see,",
          "char_start": 91320,
          "char_end": 91362,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.41",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp11i1",
          "text": "So great a day as this is cheaply bought.",
          "char_start": 91363,
          "char_end": 91404,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.42",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp12i0",
          "text": "Macduff is missing, and your noble son.",
          "char_start": 91405,
          "char_end": 91444,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.43",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp13i0",
          "text": "Your son, my lord, has paid a soldier's debt:",
          "char_start": 91445,
          "char_end": 91490,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.44",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp13i1",
          "text": "He only lived but till he was a man;",
          "char_start": 91491,
          "char_end": 91527,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.45",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp13i2",
          "text": "The which no sooner had his prowess confirm'd",
          "char_start": 91528,
          "char_end": 91573,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.46",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp13i3",
          "text": "In the unshrinking station where he fought,",
          "char_start": 91574,
          "char_end": 91617,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.47",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp13i4",
          "text": "But like a man he died.",
          "char_start": 91618,
          "char_end": 91641,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.48",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp14i0",
          "text": "Then he is dead?",
          "char_start": 91642,
          "char_end": 91658,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
