          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp15i0",
          "text": "Ay, and brought off the field: your cause of sorrow",
          "char_start": 91659,
          "char_end": 91710,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.50",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp15i1",
          "text": "Must not be measured by his worth, for then",
          "char_start": 91711,
          "char_end": 91754,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.51",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp15i2",
          "text": "It hath no end.",
          "char_start": 91755,
          "char_end": 91770,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.52",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp16i0",
          "text": "Had he his hurts before?",
          "char_start": 91771,
          "char_end": 91795,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.53",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp17i0",
          "text": "Ay, on the front.",
          "char_start": 91796,
          "char_end": 91813,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.54",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ROSS"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp18i0",
          "text": "Why then, God's soldier be he!",
          "char_start": 91814,
          "char_end": 91844,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.55",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp18i1",
          "text": "Had I as many sons as I have hairs,",
          "char_start": 91845,
          "char_end": 91880,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.56",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp18i2",
          "text": "I would not wish them to a fairer death:",
          "char_start": 91881,
          "char_end": 91921,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.57",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp18i3",
          "text": "And so, his knell is knoll'd.",
          "char_start": 91922,
          "char_end": 91951,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.58",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp19i0",
          "text": "He's worth more sorrow,",
          "char_start": 91952,
          "char_end": 91975,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.59",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp19i1",
          "text": "And that I'll spend for him.",
          "char_start": 91976,
          "char_end": 92004,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.60",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp20i0",
          "text": "He's worth no more",
          "char_start": 92005,
          "char_end": 92023,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.61",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp20i1",
          "text": "They say he parted well, and paid his score:",
          "char_start": 92024,
          "char_end": 92068,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.62",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp20i2",
          "text": "And so, God be with him! Here comes newer comfort.",
          "char_start": 92069,
          "char_end": 92119,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.63",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp20i3",
          "text": "Re-enter MACDUFF, with MACBETH's head",
          "char_start": 92120,
          "char_end": 92157,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "SIWARD"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp21i0",
          "text": "Hail, king! for so thou art: behold, where stands",
          "char_start": 92158,
          "char_end": 92207,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.64",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp21i1",
          "text": "The usurper's cursed head: the time is free:",
          "char_start": 92208,
          "char_end": 92252,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.65",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp21i2",
          "text": "I see thee compass'd with thy kingdom's pearl,",
          "char_start": 92253,
          "char_end": 92299,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.66",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp21i3",
          "text": "That speak my salutation in their minds;",
          "char_start": 92300,
          "char_end": 92340,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.67",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp21i4",
          "text": "Whose voices I desire aloud with mine:",
          "char_start": 92341,
          "char_end": 92379,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.68",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp21i5",
          "text": "Hail, King of Scotland!",
          "char_start": 92380,
          "char_end": 92403,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.69",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MACDUFF"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp22i0",
          "text": "Hail, King of Scotland!",
          "char_start": 92404,
          "char_end": 92427,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.70",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp22i1",
          "text": "Flourish",
          "char_start": 92428,
          "char_end": 92436,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
          "speaker": "ALL"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i0",
          "text": "We shall not spend a large expense of time",
          "char_start": 92437,
          "char_end": 92479,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.71",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i1",
          "text": "Before we reckon with your several loves,",
          "char_start": 92480,
          "char_end": 92521,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.72",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i2",
          "text": "And make us even with you. My thanes and kinsmen,",
          "char_start": 92522,
          "char_end": 92571,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.73",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i3",
          "text": "Henceforth be earls, the first that ever Scotland",
          "char_start": 92572,
          "char_end": 92621,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.74",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i4",
          "text": "In such an honour named. What's more to do,",
          "char_start": 92622,
          "char_end": 92665,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.75",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i5",
          "text": "Which would be planted newly with the time,",
          "char_start": 92666,
          "char_end": 92709,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.76",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i6",
          "text": "As calling home our exiled friends abroad",
          "char_start": 92710,
          "char_end": 92751,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.77",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i7",
          "text": "That fled the snares of watchful tyranny;",
          "char_start": 92752,
          "char_end": 92793,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.78",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i8",
          "text": "Producing forth the cruel ministers",
          "char_start": 92794,
          "char_end": 92829,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.79",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i9",
          "text": "Of this dead butcher and his fiend-like queen,",
          "char_start": 92830,
          "char_end": 92876,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.80",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i10",
          "text": "Who, as 'tis thought, by self and violent hands",
          "char_start": 92877,
          "char_end": 92924,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.81",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i11",
          "text": "Took off her life; this, and what needful else",
          "char_start": 92925,
          "char_end": 92971,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.82",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i12",
          "text": "That calls upon us, by the grace of Grace,",
          "char_start": 92972,
          "char_end": 93014,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.83",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i13",
          "text": "We will perform in measure, time and place:",
          "char_start": 93015,
          "char_end": 93058,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.84",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i14",
          "text": "So, thanks to all at once and to each one,",
          "char_start": 93059,
          "char_end": 93101,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.85",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i15",
          "text": "Whom we invite to see us crown'd at Scone.",
          "char_start": 93102,
          "char_end": 93144,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": "5.8.86",
          "item_kind": "line",
          "speaker": "MALCOLM"
        },
        {
          "span_id": "passage-macbeth-44ddaa53:a5s8:sp23i16",
          "text": "Flourish. Exeunt",
          "char_start": 93145,
          "char_end": 93161,
          "act": 5,
          "scene": 8,
          "line_anchor": null,
          "item_kind": "stage_direction",
